{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_63","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Writing the content for ops.js.","signature":"5+4u0965WfgQiZROF/XjZhYgdsozwzkYTBKCxtccjcXzG/mwbhOeLJB996tQWxvAV5iy4Ea9as7k+pCR8Ou8vIN0DcSYbkR8Ho23QQte0jtx67HxRy4ztn+4HkYeduO1pvPTokj+muqikVHJVkWRwbtSNVS5bRuZjifNYpsJbP2fb5qFsA+1GOHuj0gFQ7ewbp3kHcnpQ/xQ1+iyZtZykwwwFhDnswWjaTPKJCHjisBPhKoKf7rN"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5b2be7d4-ff35-4e30-ba61-36f6f19bc151-66","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js","old_string":"","new_string":"/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\n\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\n\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\n  const list = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\n  }\n  return list;\n}\n\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\n}\n\nexport const OPS = [\n  {\n    id: 'op1',\n    n: 1,\n    title: 'Eleven Hooks',\n    patient: 'Tomasz Dolan',\n    age: 34,\n    job: 'Deckhand',\n    hook: 'Eleven fishhooks. He says it was a long net.',\n    objective: 'Drain, draw the hooks, close, and count again.',\n    arena: 'forearm',\n    time: 240,\n    vitals: { start: 85, drain: 0.1 },\n    doses: 3,\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'The net missed the rest of him.'),\n    reyes: follow({ S: 'I would let you near my own arm.', C: 'He still has an arm. Barely a compliment.' }, 'Count slower next time.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Two pools. Hooks under both.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('p1', 'pool', -3.1, -1.1, { r: 0.7 }),\n          line('p2', 'pool', -2.48, -1.1, { r: 0.65 }),\n          { ...hooks(1)[0], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p1' },\n          { ...hooks(2)[1], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p2' },\n          ...hooks(11).slice(2),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Lacerations. Close them.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('w1', 'wound', -1.4, 0.8, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('w2', 'wound', 1.2, 0.7, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0.15 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Gel the rust. Syringe if he fades.',\n        unlock: ['syringe'],\n        spawn: [\n          line('g1', 'gel', 0.2, -0.4, { w: 1.6, h: 1.0 }),\n          line('ring', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Twelve. I counted twelve.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('dress', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.4, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\n          line('h12', 'hook', 2.6, -0.8, { pull: 1.0, curve: 0.8, dx: -0.2, dz: 1 }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op2',\n    n: 2,\n    title: 'The Vanishing Act',\n    patient: 'The Great Zamboni',\n    age: 51,\n    job: 'Stage magician',\n    hook: 'He swallowed the act and will not say which half.',\n    objective: 'Find every prop, then the thing that is not a prop.',\n    arena: 'stomach',\n    time: 300,\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.15 },\n    doses: 3,\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'scanner', 'laser', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'The coin turned up in the laundry.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'That one was not a prop.'),\n    stages: [\n      { say: 'Midline. Keep it straight.', spawn: [line('cut', 'incision', -0.8, 0.2, { len: 1.6, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\n      {\n        say: 'Bleeders along the cut.',\n        spawn: [line('b1', 'pool', -0.4, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }), line('b2', 'pool', 0.5, 0.25, { r: 0.55, bleed: true })],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Scan, lance, then pull. Mind the magnets.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('lk', 'incision', -2.2, -0.8, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('lc', 'incision', -0.6, -0.9, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('lcard', 'incision', 0.8, -0.85, { len: 0.45, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\n          line('lm', 'incision', 2.0, -0.7, { len: 0.4, dx: 1, dz: 0.2 }),\n          line('key', 'prop', -2.2, -0.8, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\n          line('coin', 'prop', -0.6, -0.9, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\n          line('card', 'prop', 0.8, -0.85, { hidden: true, pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\n          line('mag', 'magnet', 2.0, -0.7, { hidden: true, pull: 1.1, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, speedLimit: 3.2 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'That one is not a prop.',\n        spawn: [line('tumor', 'tumor', 0.1, 0.35, { radius: 0.62 })],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Lift it. Burn the satellites.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('mass', 'organ', 0.1, 0.35, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\n          line('poly1', 'polyp', -1.3, 1.1, {}),\n          line('poly2', 'polyp', -0.5, 1.25, {}),\n          line('poly3', 'polyp', 0.4, 1.2, {}),\n          line('poly4', 'polyp', 1.2, 1.05, {}),\n          line('poly5', 'polyp', 1.8, 0.5, {}),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Drain, suture, gel, dress.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('bp', 'pool', -1.5, -0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }),\n          line('ws', 'wound', 1.4, -0.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('gs', 'gel', -0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.6, h: 0.8 }),\n          line('ds', 'dressing', 0, 1.6, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring2', 'ring', 2.4, 1.5, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op3',\n    n: 3,\n    title: 'Night Ferry',\n    patient: 'Three passengers',\n    age: 0,\n    job: 'Ferry',\n    hook: 'One doctor. Three tables. The room will go quiet.',\n    objective: 'Keep every table alive.',\n    arena: 'ferry',\n    time: 360,\n    vitals: { start: [70, 60, 55], drain: 0.22 },\n    doses: 5,\n    tools: ['suture', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'scalpel', 'laser', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: [],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'All three made the morning paper. Alive.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'You went quiet. I noticed.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Table A. Leg gash.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('a1', 'wound', -0.4, 0.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 0 }),\n          line('a2', 'pool', 1.2, -0.4, { r: 0.65, table: 0 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Table B. Debris and burns.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('bdeb', 'debris', -0.6, 0.1, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\n          line('bgel', 'gel', 0.8, -0.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.9, table: 1 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Table C. Chest.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('c1', 'incision', -0.8, 0.3, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 2 }),\n          line('c2', 'pool', 0.6, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true, table: 2 }),\n          line('c3', 'wound', -0.2, -0.8, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1, table: 2 }),\n          line('c4', 'polyp', 1.4, 0.8, { table: 2 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      { say: 'The room goes quiet. Hold your gift.', quiet: true, flag: 'awakened', until: 'flag' },\n      {\n        say: 'Second wave. Do not lose one.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('a3', 'pool', 0, 0.8, { r: 0.55, table: 0 }),\n          line('b2', 'debris', 1.1, 0.4, { pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\n          line('c5', 'wound', 0.4, -0.2, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.3, dz: 1, table: 2 }),\n          line('ring3', 'ring', 2, 1.2, { optional: true, table: 0 }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op4',\n    n: 4,\n    title: 'Sticks and Stones',\n    patient: 'Ollie Brandt',\n    age: 16,\n    job: 'Student',\n    hook: 'Ferry survivor. The bone is a puzzle.',\n    objective: 'Turn each fragment true, then shock the heart.',\n    arena: 'bone',\n    time: 330,\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.18 },\n    doses: 3,\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'suture', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if the scar could look like a lightning bolt.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Adequate. Sabine said it first.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Open, then drain.',\n        spawn: [line('open', 'incision', -0.6, 1.1, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }), line('flood', 'pool', 0.2, 0.2, { r: 0.7 })],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Rotate each fragment onto the bone.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('fp1', 'pool', -2.2, -0.6, { r: 0.6 }),\n          line('fp2', 'pool', 2.0, -0.5, { r: 0.55 }),\n          line('f1', 'fragment', -2.2, -0.6, { ang: 80, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp1' }),\n          line('f2', 'fragment', 2.0, -0.5, { ang: -70, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp2' }),\n          line('f3', 'fragment', -1.0, 0.2, { ang: 55, targetAng: 0 }),\n          line('f4', 'fragment', 0.1, -0.2, { ang: 40, targetAng: 10 }),\n          line('f5', 'fragment', 1.0, 0.4, { ang: -35, targetAng: 0 }),\n          line('f6', 'fragment', 0.2, 0.9, { ang: 25, targetAng: 0 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      { say: 'Gel along the seams.', spawn: [line('cement', 'gel', 0, 0.1, { w: 2.2, h: 0.8 })] },\n      { say: 'Artery. Suture it now.', spawn: [line('art', 'bleeder', -0.3, -1.1, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 })] },\n      { say: 'Paddles. Two good shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\n      {\n        say: 'Close. Sabine will call it adequate.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('cl', 'wound', 0.4, 1.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('cg', 'gel', -1.4, 1.2, { w: 1.2, h: 0.7 }),\n          line('cd', 'dressing', 1.2, -1.2, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring4', 'ring', 2.3, 1.4, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op5',\n    n: 5,\n    title: 'Introit',\n    patient: 'Mr. Anselm',\n    age: 62,\n    job: 'Harbour pilot',\n    hook: 'He feels nothing. Something under the liver knocks.',\n    objective: 'Answer the knock. Pull the tether. Burn the eggs.',\n    arena: 'liver',\n    time: 360,\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.22 },\n    doses: 4,\n    tools: ['scanner', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if it could knock on the way out.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Get it out.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Scanner. It is moving.',\n        spawn: [line('blotch', 'cyst', 0.2, 0.2, { hidden: true, real: true })],\n      },\n      { say: 'It knocked.', strain: 'introit', until: 'strain' },\n      { say: 'Close the tears.', until: 'kinds', kinds: ['wound', 'pool'] },\n      {\n        say: 'Six eggs. Burn them.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('e1', 'egg', -2.2, 0.6, {}),\n          line('e2', 'egg', -1.2, 1.0, {}),\n          line('e3', 'egg', -0.2, 0.7, {}),\n          line('e4', 'egg', 0.8, 1.0, {}),\n          line('e5', 'egg', 1.6, 0.5, {}),\n          line('e6', 'egg', 2.3, -0.2, {}),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Gel and dressing.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('eg', 'gel', 0, -1.1, { w: 1.8, h: 0.7 }),\n          line('ed', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.5, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring5', 'ring', 2.2, -1.3, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op6',\n    n: 6,\n    title: 'Cold Hands',\n    patient: 'Ada Okoye',\n    age: 29,\n    job: 'Teacher',\n    hook: 'Failing kidney. The donor is on ice. Sabine operates.',\n    objective: 'Transplant, rewind the clot, let it pink up.',\n    arena: 'kidney',\n    time: 360,\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.16 },\n    doses: 3,\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'scanner', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['look'],\n    surgeon: 'sabine',\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'The new kidney took. The sample did not stay dormant.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Again. Then it pinks.'),\n    stages: [\n      { say: 'Open.', spawn: [line('kcut', 'incision', -0.5, 1.0, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\n      {\n        say: 'Clamp both vessels.',\n        spawn: [line('cA', 'clamp', -1.2, 0.2, {}), line('cB', 'clamp', 0.8, 0.15, {})],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Cut between the clamps.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('v1', 'incision', -1.2, -0.35, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('v2', 'incision', 0.8, -0.4, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      { say: 'Lift the failing kidney.', spawn: [line('oldk', 'organ', 0, 0.1, { pull: 1.2, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 })] },\n      { say: 'Donor kidney. The ice starts now.', cold: 120, spawn: [line('newk', 'organ', 2.4, -1.2, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.4, dz: 1 })] },\n      {\n        say: 'Artery, vein, ureter.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('an1', 'wound', -1.6, 0.6, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('an2', 'wound', 0, 0.55, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('an3', 'wound', 1.5, 0.5, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Unclamp in order.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('u0', 'unclamp', -1.3, -0.8, { order: 0, firstClot: true }),\n          line('u1', 'unclamp', 0, -0.85, { order: 1 }),\n          line('u2', 'unclamp', 1.3, -0.8, { order: 2 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'It pinks. Scan the sample.',\n        flag: 'pink',\n        spawn: [\n          line('sample', 'cyst', 2.1, 1.1, { hidden: true, real: true }),\n          line('kg', 'gel', -0.2, 1.3, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\n          line('kd', 'dressing', 0.4, -1.4, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring6', 'ring', -2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op7',\n    n: 7,\n    title: 'Lacrimosa',\n    patient: 'Ottilie Marr',\n    age: 58,\n    job: 'Hospice nurse',\n    hook: 'She smiles. The lung weeps.',\n    objective: 'Laser the eyes, paint the sob, pull the stalk.',\n    arena: 'lung',\n    time: 390,\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.2 },\n    doses: 4,\n    tools: ['laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'forceps', 'scalpel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'She thanked them for the pain.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'I will be in the hall.'),\n    stages: [\n      { say: 'A small cut. Then it weeps.', spawn: [line('lcut', 'incision', -0.4, 1.2, { len: 0.8, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\n      { say: 'Eyes open in turn.', strain: 'lacrimosa', until: 'strain' },\n      {\n        say: 'Gel. Dressing. She can feel it.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('lg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.2, { w: 1.6, h: 0.7 }),\n          line('ld', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.5, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring7', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op8',\n    n: 8,\n    title: 'Dies Irae',\n    patient: 'Cornelius Bram',\n    age: 67,\n    job: 'Chief',\n    hook: 'His tremor was Mercy. Do not be gentle.',\n    objective: 'Cut, lift, and burn on diastole. Then shock and massage.',\n    arena: 'heart',\n    time: 420,\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.2 },\n    doses: 5,\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'laser', 'drain', 'syringe', 'suture', 'gel'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    heart: true,\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'He gave Ilya the old scalpel.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Do not you dare be gentle.'),\n    stages: [\n      { say: 'On the beat. Diastole only.', spawn: [line('hcut', 'incision', -0.3, 1.3, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0, window: 'diastole' })] },\n      { say: 'Seven plates.', strain: 'dies', until: 'strain' },\n      { say: 'Fibrillation. Two shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\n      { say: 'Massage. Left, then right.', massage: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'massaged' },\n      {\n        say: 'Close him.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('hw', 'wound', 0.2, 1.2, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('hg', 'gel', -0.4, -1.1, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\n          line('hd', 'dressing', 1.0, -1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring8', 'ring', 2.3, 0.4, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op9',\n    n: 9,\n    title: 'Libera Me',\n    patient: 'Odalys Reyes',\n    age: 44,\n    job: 'Nurse',\n    hook: 'No signal. The monitor is lying.',\n    objective: 'Tell real from false, survive the copy, pull together.',\n    arena: 'chest',\n    time: 540,\n    vitals: { start: 70, drain: 0.18 },\n    doses: 6,\n    tools: ['scanner', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\n    surgeon: 'both',\n    partner: true,\n    heart: true,\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\n    stages: [\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', lie: true, strain: 'sanctus', until: 'strain' },\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'reprise', until: 'strain' },\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'miserere', until: 'strain' },\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\n      {\n        say: 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('rd', 'dressing', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring9', 'ring', 2.2, -1.2, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'op10',\n    n: 10,\n    title: 'Do No Harm',\n    patient: 'Hesper Lindqvist',\n    age: 46,\n    job: 'Director',\n    hook: 'A pale strain along the spine. It does not fight.',\n    objective: 'Remove it slowly. Pain means she is still here.',\n    arena: 'spine',\n    time: 240,\n    vitals: { start: 60, drain: 0.05 },\n    doses: 2,\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'Why? Because it is my shift.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'She felt it. That was the point.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Slow. It will not fight.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('s1', 'incision', -1.6, 0.2, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.15, dz: 1 }),\n          line('x1', 'extraction', -1.6, -0.5, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'She flinched. Good.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('s2', 'incision', -0.4, 0.3, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }),\n          line('x2', 'extraction', -0.4, -0.45, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Why does it hurt?',\n        spawn: [\n          line('s3', 'incision', 0.8, 0.25, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\n          line('x3', 'extraction', 0.8, -0.5, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 12 }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Because it is my shift.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('x4', 'extraction', 1.8, 0.1, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 8, painOnDone: 14 }),\n          line('sw', 'wound', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('sg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.8, h: 0.6 }),\n          line('sd', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.6, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ring10', 'ring', 2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'pile',\n    n: 11,\n    title: 'Consult Pile-Up',\n    patient: 'Whoever is bleeding',\n    age: 0,\n    job: 'Consult',\n    hook: 'A wave of a chest. Then one knock.',\n    objective: 'Keep the patient alive and top the team score.',\n    arena: 'chest',\n    time: 180,\n    vitals: { start: 78, drain: 0.16 },\n    doses: 4,\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'gel', 'scanner', 'syringe'],\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\n    consultOp: true,\n    par: 1,\n    follow: follow({}, 'Next wave will not wait.'),\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Hands in. All of them.'),\n    stages: [\n      {\n        say: 'Hooks and pools.',\n        spawn: [\n          ...hooks(4, -0.8),\n          line('pp1', 'pool', 1.6, 0.4, { r: 0.6 }),\n          line('pp2', 'pool', -1.8, 0.6, { r: 0.55, bleed: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Lacerations. Polyps.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('pw', 'wound', -0.4, 0.9, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('pw2', 'wound', 1.2, -0.9, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\n          line('ppy', 'polyp', -1.5, 1.2, {}),\n          line('ppy2', 'polyp', 2.0, 1.0, {}),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'It knocked.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('ip', 'pore', 0.4, 0.2, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\n          line('ic', 'core', 0.5, -0.4, { pull: 1.6, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, tether: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n      {\n        say: 'Dress it.',\n        spawn: [\n          line('pg', 'gel', 0, -1.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.6 }),\n          line('pd', 'dressing', 0, 1.4, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\n          line('ringp', 'ring', 2.3, 0.2, { optional: true }),\n        ],\n      },\n    ],\n  },\n];\n\nexport function sessionOp(base, mul) {\n  return { ...base, id: `s${base.id}`, session: true, time: 200, strainHp: mul, par: base.par };\n}\n\nexport const SESSION_OPS = [\n  OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'pile'),\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op5'), 0.34),\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op7'), 0.4),\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op8'), 1 / 7),\n];\n\nexport const STORY_OPS = OPS.filter((o) => o.n <= 10);\nexport const ALL_OPS = OPS;\n\nexport function opById(id) {\n  return OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || SESSION_OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || null;\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":11948,"output_tokens":8203,"cache_read_input_tokens":149504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"bb58d207-670f-4a16-8aaf-73f6a4a82cb4"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-5b2be7d4-ff35-4e30-ba61-36f6f19bc151-66","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\\n\\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\\n\\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\\n  const list = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\\n  }\\n  return list;\\n}\\n\\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\\n}\\n\\nexport const OPS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'op1',\\n    n: 1,\\n    title: 'Eleven Hooks',\\n    patient: 'Tomasz Dolan',\\n    age: 34,\\n    job: 'Deckhand',\\n    hook: 'Eleven fishhooks. He says it was a long net.',\\n    objective: 'Drain, draw the hooks, close, and count again.',\\n    arena: 'forearm',\\n    time: 240,\\n    vitals: { start: 85, drain: 0.1 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The net missed the rest of him.'),\\n    reyes: follow({ S: 'I would let you near my own arm.', C: 'He still has an arm. Barely a compliment.' }, 'Count slower next time.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Two pools. Hooks under both.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('p1', 'pool', -3.1, -1.1, { r: 0.7 }),\\n          line('p2', 'pool', -2.48, -1.1, { r: 0.65 }),\\n          { ...hooks(1)[0], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p1' },\\n          { ...hooks(2)[1], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p2' },\\n          ...hooks(11).slice(2),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lacerations. Close them.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('w1', 'wound', -1.4, 0.8, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('w2', 'wound', 1.2, 0.7, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0.15 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel the rust. Syringe if he fades.',\\n        unlock: ['syringe'],\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('g1', 'gel', 0.2, -0.4, { w: 1.6, h: 1.0 }),\\n          line('ring', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Twelve. I counted twelve.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('dress', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.4, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\\n          line('h12', 'hook', 2.6, -0.8, { pull: 1.0, curve: 0.8, dx: -0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op2',\\n    n: 2,\\n    title: 'The Vanishing Act',\\n    patient: 'The Great Zamboni',\\n    age: 51,\\n    job: 'Stage magician',\\n    hook: 'He swallowed the act and will not say which half.',\\n    objective: 'Find every prop, then the thing that is not a prop.',\\n    arena: 'stomach',\\n    time: 300,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.15 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'scanner', 'laser', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The coin turned up in the laundry.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'That one was not a prop.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'Midline. Keep it straight.', spawn: [line('cut', 'incision', -0.8, 0.2, { len: 1.6, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Bleeders along the cut.',\\n        spawn: [line('b1', 'pool', -0.4, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }), line('b2', 'pool', 0.5, 0.25, { r: 0.55, bleed: true })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Scan, lance, then pull. Mind the magnets.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('lk', 'incision', -2.2, -0.8, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('lc', 'incision', -0.6, -0.9, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('lcard', 'incision', 0.8, -0.85, { len: 0.45, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('lm', 'incision', 2.0, -0.7, { len: 0.4, dx: 1, dz: 0.2 }),\\n          line('key', 'prop', -2.2, -0.8, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('coin', 'prop', -0.6, -0.9, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('card', 'prop', 0.8, -0.85, { hidden: true, pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('mag', 'magnet', 2.0, -0.7, { hidden: true, pull: 1.1, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, speedLimit: 3.2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'That one is not a prop.',\\n        spawn: [line('tumor', 'tumor', 0.1, 0.35, { radius: 0.62 })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lift it. Burn the satellites.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('mass', 'organ', 0.1, 0.35, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('poly1', 'polyp', -1.3, 1.1, {}),\\n          line('poly2', 'polyp', -0.5, 1.25, {}),\\n          line('poly3', 'polyp', 0.4, 1.2, {}),\\n          line('poly4', 'polyp', 1.2, 1.05, {}),\\n          line('poly5', 'polyp', 1.8, 0.5, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Drain, suture, gel, dress.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('bp', 'pool', -1.5, -0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }),\\n          line('ws', 'wound', 1.4, -0.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('gs', 'gel', -0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.6, h: 0.8 }),\\n          line('ds', 'dressing', 0, 1.6, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring2', 'ring', 2.4, 1.5, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op3',\\n    n: 3,\\n    title: 'Night Ferry',\\n    patient: 'Three passengers',\\n    age: 0,\\n    job: 'Ferry',\\n    hook: 'One doctor. Three tables. The room will go quiet.',\\n    objective: 'Keep every table alive.',\\n    arena: 'ferry',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: [70, 60, 55], drain: 0.22 },\\n    doses: 5,\\n    tools: ['suture', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'scalpel', 'laser', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: [],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'All three made the morning paper. Alive.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'You went quiet. I noticed.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table A. Leg gash.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('a1', 'wound', -0.4, 0.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 0 }),\\n          line('a2', 'pool', 1.2, -0.4, { r: 0.65, table: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table B. Debris and burns.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('bdeb', 'debris', -0.6, 0.1, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\\n          line('bgel', 'gel', 0.8, -0.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.9, table: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table C. Chest.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('c1', 'incision', -0.8, 0.3, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c2', 'pool', 0.6, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c3', 'wound', -0.2, -0.8, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c4', 'polyp', 1.4, 0.8, { table: 2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'The room goes quiet. Hold your gift.', quiet: true, flag: 'awakened', until: 'flag' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Second wave. Do not lose one.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('a3', 'pool', 0, 0.8, { r: 0.55, table: 0 }),\\n          line('b2', 'debris', 1.1, 0.4, { pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\\n          line('c5', 'wound', 0.4, -0.2, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.3, dz: 1, table: 2 }),\\n          line('ring3', 'ring', 2, 1.2, { optional: true, table: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op4',\\n    n: 4,\\n    title: 'Sticks and Stones',\\n    patient: 'Ollie Brandt',\\n    age: 16,\\n    job: 'Student',\\n    hook: 'Ferry survivor. The bone is a puzzle.',\\n    objective: 'Turn each fragment true, then shock the heart.',\\n    arena: 'bone',\\n    time: 330,\\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.18 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'suture', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if the scar could look like a lightning bolt.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Adequate. Sabine said it first.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Open, then drain.',\\n        spawn: [line('open', 'incision', -0.6, 1.1, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }), line('flood', 'pool', 0.2, 0.2, { r: 0.7 })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Rotate each fragment onto the bone.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('fp1', 'pool', -2.2, -0.6, { r: 0.6 }),\\n          line('fp2', 'pool', 2.0, -0.5, { r: 0.55 }),\\n          line('f1', 'fragment', -2.2, -0.6, { ang: 80, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp1' }),\\n          line('f2', 'fragment', 2.0, -0.5, { ang: -70, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp2' }),\\n          line('f3', 'fragment', -1.0, 0.2, { ang: 55, targetAng: 0 }),\\n          line('f4', 'fragment', 0.1, -0.2, { ang: 40, targetAng: 10 }),\\n          line('f5', 'fragment', 1.0, 0.4, { ang: -35, targetAng: 0 }),\\n          line('f6', 'fragment', 0.2, 0.9, { ang: 25, targetAng: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'Gel along the seams.', spawn: [line('cement', 'gel', 0, 0.1, { w: 2.2, h: 0.8 })] },\\n      { say: 'Artery. Suture it now.', spawn: [line('art', 'bleeder', -0.3, -1.1, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 })] },\\n      { say: 'Paddles. Two good shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Close. Sabine will call it adequate.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('cl', 'wound', 0.4, 1.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('cg', 'gel', -1.4, 1.2, { w: 1.2, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('cd', 'dressing', 1.2, -1.2, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring4', 'ring', 2.3, 1.4, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op5',\\n    n: 5,\\n    title: 'Introit',\\n    patient: 'Mr. Anselm',\\n    age: 62,\\n    job: 'Harbour pilot',\\n    hook: 'He feels nothing. Something under the liver knocks.',\\n    objective: 'Answer the knock. Pull the tether. Burn the eggs.',\\n    arena: 'liver',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.22 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['scanner', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if it could knock on the way out.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Get it out.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Scanner. It is moving.',\\n        spawn: [line('blotch', 'cyst', 0.2, 0.2, { hidden: true, real: true })],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'It knocked.', strain: 'introit', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'Close the tears.', until: 'kinds', kinds: ['wound', 'pool'] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Six eggs. Burn them.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('e1', 'egg', -2.2, 0.6, {}),\\n          line('e2', 'egg', -1.2, 1.0, {}),\\n          line('e3', 'egg', -0.2, 0.7, {}),\\n          line('e4', 'egg', 0.8, 1.0, {}),\\n          line('e5', 'egg', 1.6, 0.5, {}),\\n          line('e6', 'egg', 2.3, -0.2, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel and dressing.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('eg', 'gel', 0, -1.1, { w: 1.8, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('ed', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.5, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring5', 'ring', 2.2, -1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op6',\\n    n: 6,\\n    title: 'Cold Hands',\\n    patient: 'Ada Okoye',\\n    age: 29,\\n    job: 'Teacher',\\n    hook: 'Failing kidney. The donor is on ice. Sabine operates.',\\n    objective: 'Transplant, rewind the clot, let it pink up.',\\n    arena: 'kidney',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.16 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'scanner', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['look'],\\n    surgeon: 'sabine',\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The new kidney took. The sample did not stay dormant.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Again. Then it pinks.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'Open.', spawn: [line('kcut', 'incision', -0.5, 1.0, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Clamp both vessels.',\\n        spawn: [line('cA', 'clamp', -1.2, 0.2, {}), line('cB', 'clamp', 0.8, 0.15, {})],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Cut between the clamps.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('v1', 'incision', -1.2, -0.35, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('v2', 'incision', 0.8, -0.4, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'Lift the failing kidney.', spawn: [line('oldk', 'organ', 0, 0.1, { pull: 1.2, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 })] },\\n      { say: 'Donor kidney. The ice starts now.', cold: 120, spawn: [line('newk', 'organ', 2.4, -1.2, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.4, dz: 1 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Artery, vein, ureter.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('an1', 'wound', -1.6, 0.6, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('an2', 'wound', 0, 0.55, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('an3', 'wound', 1.5, 0.5, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Unclamp in order.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('u0', 'unclamp', -1.3, -0.8, { order: 0, firstClot: true }),\\n          line('u1', 'unclamp', 0, -0.85, { order: 1 }),\\n          line('u2', 'unclamp', 1.3, -0.8, { order: 2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'It pinks. Scan the sample.',\\n        flag: 'pink',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('sample', 'cyst', 2.1, 1.1, { hidden: true, real: true }),\\n          line('kg', 'gel', -0.2, 1.3, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('kd', 'dressing', 0.4, -1.4, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring6', 'ring', -2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op7',\\n    n: 7,\\n    title: 'Lacrimosa',\\n    patient: 'Ottilie Marr',\\n    age: 58,\\n    job: 'Hospice nurse',\\n    hook: 'She smiles. The lung weeps.',\\n    objective: 'Laser the eyes, paint the sob, pull the stalk.',\\n    arena: 'lung',\\n    time: 390,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.2 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'forceps', 'scalpel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'She thanked them for the pain.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'I will be in the hall.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'A small cut. Then it weeps.', spawn: [line('lcut', 'incision', -0.4, 1.2, { len: 0.8, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      { say: 'Eyes open in turn.', strain: 'lacrimosa', until: 'strain' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel. Dressing. She can feel it.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('lg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.2, { w: 1.6, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('ld', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.5, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring7', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op8',\\n    n: 8,\\n    title: 'Dies Irae',\\n    patient: 'Cornelius Bram',\\n    age: 67,\\n    job: 'Chief',\\n    hook: 'His tremor was Mercy. Do not be gentle.',\\n    objective: 'Cut, lift, and burn on diastole. Then shock and massage.',\\n    arena: 'heart',\\n    time: 420,\\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.2 },\\n    doses: 5,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'laser', 'drain', 'syringe', 'suture', 'gel'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    heart: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He gave Ilya the old scalpel.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Do not you dare be gentle.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'On the beat. Diastole only.', spawn: [line('hcut', 'incision', -0.3, 1.3, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0, window: 'diastole' })] },\\n      { say: 'Seven plates.', strain: 'dies', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'Fibrillation. Two shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      { say: 'Massage. Left, then right.', massage: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'massaged' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Close him.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('hw', 'wound', 0.2, 1.2, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('hg', 'gel', -0.4, -1.1, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('hd', 'dressing', 1.0, -1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring8', 'ring', 2.3, 0.4, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op9',\\n    n: 9,\\n    title: 'Libera Me',\\n    patient: 'Odalys Reyes',\\n    age: 44,\\n    job: 'Nurse',\\n    hook: 'No signal. The monitor is lying.',\\n    objective: 'Tell real from false, survive the copy, pull together.',\\n    arena: 'chest',\\n    time: 540,\\n    vitals: { start: 70, drain: 0.18 },\\n    doses: 6,\\n    tools: ['scanner', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\\n    surgeon: 'both',\\n    partner: true,\\n    heart: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', lie: true, strain: 'sanctus', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'reprise', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'miserere', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('rd', 'dressing', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring9', 'ring', 2.2, -1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op10',\\n    n: 10,\\n    title: 'Do No Harm',\\n    patient: 'Hesper Lindqvist',\\n    age: 46,\\n    job: 'Director',\\n    hook: 'A pale strain along the spine. It does not fight.',\\n    objective: 'Remove it slowly. Pain means she is still here.',\\n    arena: 'spine',\\n    time: 240,\\n    vitals: { start: 60, drain: 0.05 },\\n    doses: 2,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Why? Because it is my shift.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'She felt it. That was the point.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Slow. It will not fight.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s1', 'incision', -1.6, 0.2, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.15, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x1', 'extraction', -1.6, -0.5, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'She flinched. Good.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s2', 'incision', -0.4, 0.3, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x2', 'extraction', -0.4, -0.45, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Why does it hurt?',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s3', 'incision', 0.8, 0.25, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x3', 'extraction', 0.8, -0.5, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 12 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Because it is my shift.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('x4', 'extraction', 1.8, 0.1, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 8, painOnDone: 14 }),\\n          line('sw', 'wound', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('sg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.8, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('sd', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.6, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring10', 'ring', 2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'pile',\\n    n: 11,\\n    title: 'Consult Pile-Up',\\n    patient: 'Whoever is bleeding',\\n    age: 0,\\n    job: 'Consult',\\n    hook: 'A wave of a chest. Then one knock.',\\n    objective: 'Keep the patient alive and top the team score.',\\n    arena: 'chest',\\n    time: 180,\\n    vitals: { start: 78, drain: 0.16 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'gel', 'scanner', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\\n    consultOp: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Next wave will not wait.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Hands in. All of them.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Hooks and pools.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          ...hooks(4, -0.8),\\n          line('pp1', 'pool', 1.6, 0.4, { r: 0.6 }),\\n          line('pp2', 'pool', -1.8, 0.6, { r: 0.55, bleed: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lacerations. Polyps.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('pw', 'wound', -0.4, 0.9, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('pw2', 'wound', 1.2, -0.9, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('ppy', 'polyp', -1.5, 1.2, {}),\\n          line('ppy2', 'polyp', 2.0, 1.0, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'It knocked.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('ip', 'pore', 0.4, 0.2, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\\n          line('ic', 'core', 0.5, -0.4, { pull: 1.6, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, tether: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Dress it.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('pg', 'gel', 0, -1.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('pd', 'dressing', 0, 1.4, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ringp', 'ring', 2.3, 0.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport function sessionOp(base, mul) {\\n  return { ...base, id: `s${base.id}`, session: true, time: 200, strainHp: mul, par: base.par };\\n}\\n\\nexport const SESSION_OPS = [\\n  OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'pile'),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op5'), 0.34),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op7'), 0.4),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op8'), 1 / 7),\\n];\\n\\nexport const STORY_OPS = OPS.filter((o) => o.n <= 10);\\nexport const ALL_OPS = OPS;\\n\\nexport function opById(id) {\\n  return OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || SESSION_OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || null;\\n}\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js has been created successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\\n\\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\\n\\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\\n  const list = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\\n  }\\n  return list;\\n}\\n\\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\\n}\\n\\nexport const OPS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'op1',\\n    n: 1,\\n    title: 'Eleven Hooks',\\n    patient: 'Tomasz Dolan',\\n    age: 34,\\n    job: 'Deckhand',\\n    hook: 'Eleven fishhooks. He says it was a long net.',\\n    objective: 'Drain, draw the hooks, close, and count again.',\\n    arena: 'forearm',\\n    time: 240,\\n    vitals: { start: 85, drain: 0.1 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The net missed the rest of him.'),\\n    reyes: follow({ S: 'I would let you near my own arm.', C: 'He still has an arm. Barely a compliment.' }, 'Count slower next time.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Two pools. Hooks under both.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('p1', 'pool', -3.1, -1.1, { r: 0.7 }),\\n          line('p2', 'pool', -2.48, -1.1, { r: 0.65 }),\\n          { ...hooks(1)[0], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p1' },\\n          { ...hooks(2)[1], hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'p2' },\\n          ...hooks(11).slice(2),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lacerations. Close them.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('w1', 'wound', -1.4, 0.8, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('w2', 'wound', 1.2, 0.7, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0.15 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel the rust. Syringe if he fades.',\\n        unlock: ['syringe'],\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('g1', 'gel', 0.2, -0.4, { w: 1.6, h: 1.0 }),\\n          line('ring', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Twelve. I counted twelve.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('dress', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.4, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\\n          line('h12', 'hook', 2.6, -0.8, { pull: 1.0, curve: 0.8, dx: -0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op2',\\n    n: 2,\\n    title: 'The Vanishing Act',\\n    patient: 'The Great Zamboni',\\n    age: 51,\\n    job: 'Stage magician',\\n    hook: 'He swallowed the act and will not say which half.',\\n    objective: 'Find every prop, then the thing that is not a prop.',\\n    arena: 'stomach',\\n    time: 300,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.15 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'scanner', 'laser', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The coin turned up in the laundry.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'That one was not a prop.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'Midline. Keep it straight.', spawn: [line('cut', 'incision', -0.8, 0.2, { len: 1.6, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Bleeders along the cut.',\\n        spawn: [line('b1', 'pool', -0.4, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }), line('b2', 'pool', 0.5, 0.25, { r: 0.55, bleed: true })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Scan, lance, then pull. Mind the magnets.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('lk', 'incision', -2.2, -0.8, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('lc', 'incision', -0.6, -0.9, { len: 0.45, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('lcard', 'incision', 0.8, -0.85, { len: 0.45, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('lm', 'incision', 2.0, -0.7, { len: 0.4, dx: 1, dz: 0.2 }),\\n          line('key', 'prop', -2.2, -0.8, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('coin', 'prop', -0.6, -0.9, { hidden: true, pull: 1.0, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('card', 'prop', 0.8, -0.85, { hidden: true, pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('mag', 'magnet', 2.0, -0.7, { hidden: true, pull: 1.1, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, speedLimit: 3.2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'That one is not a prop.',\\n        spawn: [line('tumor', 'tumor', 0.1, 0.35, { radius: 0.62 })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lift it. Burn the satellites.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('mass', 'organ', 0.1, 0.35, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('poly1', 'polyp', -1.3, 1.1, {}),\\n          line('poly2', 'polyp', -0.5, 1.25, {}),\\n          line('poly3', 'polyp', 0.4, 1.2, {}),\\n          line('poly4', 'polyp', 1.2, 1.05, {}),\\n          line('poly5', 'polyp', 1.8, 0.5, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Drain, suture, gel, dress.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('bp', 'pool', -1.5, -0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true }),\\n          line('ws', 'wound', 1.4, -0.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('gs', 'gel', -0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.6, h: 0.8 }),\\n          line('ds', 'dressing', 0, 1.6, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring2', 'ring', 2.4, 1.5, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op3',\\n    n: 3,\\n    title: 'Night Ferry',\\n    patient: 'Three passengers',\\n    age: 0,\\n    job: 'Ferry',\\n    hook: 'One doctor. Three tables. The room will go quiet.',\\n    objective: 'Keep every table alive.',\\n    arena: 'ferry',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: [70, 60, 55], drain: 0.22 },\\n    doses: 5,\\n    tools: ['suture', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'scalpel', 'laser', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: [],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'All three made the morning paper. Alive.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'You went quiet. I noticed.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table A. Leg gash.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('a1', 'wound', -0.4, 0.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 0 }),\\n          line('a2', 'pool', 1.2, -0.4, { r: 0.65, table: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table B. Debris and burns.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('bdeb', 'debris', -0.6, 0.1, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\\n          line('bgel', 'gel', 0.8, -0.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.9, table: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Table C. Chest.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('c1', 'incision', -0.8, 0.3, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c2', 'pool', 0.6, 0.2, { r: 0.6, bleed: true, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c3', 'wound', -0.2, -0.8, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1, table: 2 }),\\n          line('c4', 'polyp', 1.4, 0.8, { table: 2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'The room goes quiet. Hold your gift.', quiet: true, flag: 'awakened', until: 'flag' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Second wave. Do not lose one.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('a3', 'pool', 0, 0.8, { r: 0.55, table: 0 }),\\n          line('b2', 'debris', 1.1, 0.4, { pull: 0.9, dx: 0, dz: 1, table: 1 }),\\n          line('c5', 'wound', 0.4, -0.2, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.3, dz: 1, table: 2 }),\\n          line('ring3', 'ring', 2, 1.2, { optional: true, table: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op4',\\n    n: 4,\\n    title: 'Sticks and Stones',\\n    patient: 'Ollie Brandt',\\n    age: 16,\\n    job: 'Student',\\n    hook: 'Ferry survivor. The bone is a puzzle.',\\n    objective: 'Turn each fragment true, then shock the heart.',\\n    arena: 'bone',\\n    time: 330,\\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.18 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'drain', 'forceps', 'gel', 'suture', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if the scar could look like a lightning bolt.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Adequate. Sabine said it first.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Open, then drain.',\\n        spawn: [line('open', 'incision', -0.6, 1.1, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }), line('flood', 'pool', 0.2, 0.2, { r: 0.7 })],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Rotate each fragment onto the bone.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('fp1', 'pool', -2.2, -0.6, { r: 0.6 }),\\n          line('fp2', 'pool', 2.0, -0.5, { r: 0.55 }),\\n          line('f1', 'fragment', -2.2, -0.6, { ang: 80, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp1' }),\\n          line('f2', 'fragment', 2.0, -0.5, { ang: -70, targetAng: 0, hidden: true, hiddenBy: 'fp2' }),\\n          line('f3', 'fragment', -1.0, 0.2, { ang: 55, targetAng: 0 }),\\n          line('f4', 'fragment', 0.1, -0.2, { ang: 40, targetAng: 10 }),\\n          line('f5', 'fragment', 1.0, 0.4, { ang: -35, targetAng: 0 }),\\n          line('f6', 'fragment', 0.2, 0.9, { ang: 25, targetAng: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'Gel along the seams.', spawn: [line('cement', 'gel', 0, 0.1, { w: 2.2, h: 0.8 })] },\\n      { say: 'Artery. Suture it now.', spawn: [line('art', 'bleeder', -0.3, -1.1, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 })] },\\n      { say: 'Paddles. Two good shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Close. Sabine will call it adequate.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('cl', 'wound', 0.4, 1.3, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('cg', 'gel', -1.4, 1.2, { w: 1.2, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('cd', 'dressing', 1.2, -1.2, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring4', 'ring', 2.3, 1.4, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op5',\\n    n: 5,\\n    title: 'Introit',\\n    patient: 'Mr. Anselm',\\n    age: 62,\\n    job: 'Harbour pilot',\\n    hook: 'He feels nothing. Something under the liver knocks.',\\n    objective: 'Answer the knock. Pull the tether. Burn the eggs.',\\n    arena: 'liver',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.22 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['scanner', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if it could knock on the way out.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Get it out.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Scanner. It is moving.',\\n        spawn: [line('blotch', 'cyst', 0.2, 0.2, { hidden: true, real: true })],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'It knocked.', strain: 'introit', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'Close the tears.', until: 'kinds', kinds: ['wound', 'pool'] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Six eggs. Burn them.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('e1', 'egg', -2.2, 0.6, {}),\\n          line('e2', 'egg', -1.2, 1.0, {}),\\n          line('e3', 'egg', -0.2, 0.7, {}),\\n          line('e4', 'egg', 0.8, 1.0, {}),\\n          line('e5', 'egg', 1.6, 0.5, {}),\\n          line('e6', 'egg', 2.3, -0.2, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel and dressing.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('eg', 'gel', 0, -1.1, { w: 1.8, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('ed', 'dressing', -0.4, 1.5, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring5', 'ring', 2.2, -1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op6',\\n    n: 6,\\n    title: 'Cold Hands',\\n    patient: 'Ada Okoye',\\n    age: 29,\\n    job: 'Teacher',\\n    hook: 'Failing kidney. The donor is on ice. Sabine operates.',\\n    objective: 'Transplant, rewind the clot, let it pink up.',\\n    arena: 'kidney',\\n    time: 360,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.16 },\\n    doses: 3,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'scanner', 'laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['look'],\\n    surgeon: 'sabine',\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'The new kidney took. The sample did not stay dormant.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Again. Then it pinks.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'Open.', spawn: [line('kcut', 'incision', -0.5, 1.0, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Clamp both vessels.',\\n        spawn: [line('cA', 'clamp', -1.2, 0.2, {}), line('cB', 'clamp', 0.8, 0.15, {})],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Cut between the clamps.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('v1', 'incision', -1.2, -0.35, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('v2', 'incision', 0.8, -0.4, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      { say: 'Lift the failing kidney.', spawn: [line('oldk', 'organ', 0, 0.1, { pull: 1.2, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 })] },\\n      { say: 'Donor kidney. The ice starts now.', cold: 120, spawn: [line('newk', 'organ', 2.4, -1.2, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.4, dz: 1 })] },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Artery, vein, ureter.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('an1', 'wound', -1.6, 0.6, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('an2', 'wound', 0, 0.55, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('an3', 'wound', 1.5, 0.5, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Unclamp in order.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('u0', 'unclamp', -1.3, -0.8, { order: 0, firstClot: true }),\\n          line('u1', 'unclamp', 0, -0.85, { order: 1 }),\\n          line('u2', 'unclamp', 1.3, -0.8, { order: 2 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'It pinks. Scan the sample.',\\n        flag: 'pink',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('sample', 'cyst', 2.1, 1.1, { hidden: true, real: true }),\\n          line('kg', 'gel', -0.2, 1.3, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('kd', 'dressing', 0.4, -1.4, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring6', 'ring', -2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op7',\\n    n: 7,\\n    title: 'Lacrimosa',\\n    patient: 'Ottilie Marr',\\n    age: 58,\\n    job: 'Hospice nurse',\\n    hook: 'She smiles. The lung weeps.',\\n    objective: 'Laser the eyes, paint the sob, pull the stalk.',\\n    arena: 'lung',\\n    time: 390,\\n    vitals: { start: 80, drain: 0.2 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['laser', 'drain', 'gel', 'forceps', 'scalpel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'She thanked them for the pain.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'I will be in the hall.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'A small cut. Then it weeps.', spawn: [line('lcut', 'incision', -0.4, 1.2, { len: 0.8, dx: 1, dz: 0 })] },\\n      { say: 'Eyes open in turn.', strain: 'lacrimosa', until: 'strain' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Gel. Dressing. She can feel it.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('lg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.2, { w: 1.6, h: 0.7 }),\\n          line('ld', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.5, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring7', 'ring', 2.2, 1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op8',\\n    n: 8,\\n    title: 'Dies Irae',\\n    patient: 'Cornelius Bram',\\n    age: 67,\\n    job: 'Chief',\\n    hook: 'His tremor was Mercy. Do not be gentle.',\\n    objective: 'Cut, lift, and burn on diastole. Then shock and massage.',\\n    arena: 'heart',\\n    time: 420,\\n    vitals: { start: 75, drain: 0.2 },\\n    doses: 5,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'laser', 'drain', 'syringe', 'suture', 'gel'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    heart: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'He gave Ilya the old scalpel.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Do not you dare be gentle.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'On the beat. Diastole only.', spawn: [line('hcut', 'incision', -0.3, 1.3, { len: 0.7, dx: 1, dz: 0, window: 'diastole' })] },\\n      { say: 'Seven plates.', strain: 'dies', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'Fibrillation. Two shocks.', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      { say: 'Massage. Left, then right.', massage: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'massaged' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Close him.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('hw', 'wound', 0.2, 1.2, { len: 1.0, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('hg', 'gel', -0.4, -1.1, { w: 1.4, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('hd', 'dressing', 1.0, -1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring8', 'ring', 2.3, 0.4, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op9',\\n    n: 9,\\n    title: 'Libera Me',\\n    patient: 'Odalys Reyes',\\n    age: 44,\\n    job: 'Nurse',\\n    hook: 'No signal. The monitor is lying.',\\n    objective: 'Tell real from false, survive the copy, pull together.',\\n    arena: 'chest',\\n    time: 540,\\n    vitals: { start: 70, drain: 0.18 },\\n    doses: 6,\\n    tools: ['scanner', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'drain', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\\n    surgeon: 'both',\\n    partner: true,\\n    heart: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', lie: true, strain: 'sanctus', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'reprise', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', strain: 'miserere', until: 'strain' },\\n      { say: 'NO SIGNAL', codeblue: true, until: 'flag', flag: 'blueDone' },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Your sutures are crooked, Doctor.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('rd', 'dressing', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.4, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring9', 'ring', 2.2, -1.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'op10',\\n    n: 10,\\n    title: 'Do No Harm',\\n    patient: 'Hesper Lindqvist',\\n    age: 46,\\n    job: 'Director',\\n    hook: 'A pale strain along the spine. It does not fight.',\\n    objective: 'Remove it slowly. Pain means she is still here.',\\n    arena: 'spine',\\n    time: 240,\\n    vitals: { start: 60, drain: 0.05 },\\n    doses: 2,\\n    tools: ['scalpel', 'forceps', 'suture', 'gel', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet'],\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Why? Because it is my shift.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'She felt it. That was the point.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Slow. It will not fight.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s1', 'incision', -1.6, 0.2, { len: 0.7, dx: 0.15, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x1', 'extraction', -1.6, -0.5, { pull: 1.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'She flinched. Good.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s2', 'incision', -0.4, 0.3, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x2', 'extraction', -0.4, -0.45, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 10 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Why does it hurt?',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('s3', 'incision', 0.8, 0.25, { len: 0.65, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('x3', 'extraction', 0.8, -0.5, { pull: 1.1, dx: 0, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 6, painOnDone: 12 }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Because it is my shift.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('x4', 'extraction', 1.8, 0.1, { pull: 1.3, dx: -0.1, dz: 1, vitalOnDone: 8, painOnDone: 14 }),\\n          line('sw', 'wound', 0, 1.2, { len: 1.2, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('sg', 'gel', 0.2, -1.3, { w: 1.8, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('sd', 'dressing', -0.2, 1.6, { len: 1.5, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ring10', 'ring', 2.4, 1.3, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: 'pile',\\n    n: 11,\\n    title: 'Consult Pile-Up',\\n    patient: 'Whoever is bleeding',\\n    age: 0,\\n    job: 'Consult',\\n    hook: 'A wave of a chest. Then one knock.',\\n    objective: 'Keep the patient alive and top the team score.',\\n    arena: 'chest',\\n    time: 180,\\n    vitals: { start: 78, drain: 0.16 },\\n    doses: 4,\\n    tools: ['drain', 'forceps', 'suture', 'laser', 'scalpel', 'gel', 'scanner', 'syringe'],\\n    gifts: ['quiet', 'look'],\\n    consultOp: true,\\n    par: 1,\\n    follow: follow({}, 'Next wave will not wait.'),\\n    reyes: follow({}, 'Hands in. All of them.'),\\n    stages: [\\n      {\\n        say: 'Hooks and pools.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          ...hooks(4, -0.8),\\n          line('pp1', 'pool', 1.6, 0.4, { r: 0.6 }),\\n          line('pp2', 'pool', -1.8, 0.6, { r: 0.55, bleed: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Lacerations. Polyps.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('pw', 'wound', -0.4, 0.9, { len: 1.1, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('pw2', 'wound', 1.2, -0.9, { len: 0.9, dx: 0.2, dz: 1 }),\\n          line('ppy', 'polyp', -1.5, 1.2, {}),\\n          line('ppy2', 'polyp', 2.0, 1.0, {}),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'It knocked.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('ip', 'pore', 0.4, 0.2, { len: 0.5, dx: 1, dz: 0.1 }),\\n          line('ic', 'core', 0.5, -0.4, { pull: 1.6, dx: 0.2, dz: 1, tether: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n      {\\n        say: 'Dress it.',\\n        spawn: [\\n          line('pg', 'gel', 0, -1.3, { w: 1.5, h: 0.6 }),\\n          line('pd', 'dressing', 0, 1.4, { len: 1.3, dx: 1, dz: 0 }),\\n          line('ringp', 'ring', 2.3, 0.2, { optional: true }),\\n        ],\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport function sessionOp(base, mul) {\\n  return { ...base, id: `s${base.id}`, session: true, time: 200, strainHp: mul, par: base.par };\\n}\\n\\nexport const SESSION_OPS = [\\n  OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'pile'),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op5'), 0.34),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op7'), 0.4),\\n  sessionOp(OPS.find((o) => o.id === 'op8'), 1 / 7),\\n];\\n\\nexport const STORY_OPS = OPS.filter((o) => o.n <= 10);\\nexport const ALL_OPS = OPS;\\n\\nexport function opById(id) {\\n  return OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || SESSION_OPS.find((o) => o.id === id) || null;\\n}\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"2320e879-3733-4c4e-bd8e-ba0e98eec1ba"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_64","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the op1 hooks.\n\nHook coordinates and hidden states are verified. Op3 drains 0.22 per table across three tables, so Table C should last 250 seconds. The bot finishes in 40 seconds, losing 8.8 from base damage. Pools add bleed.\n\nOp5's cyst stage is confirmed: the bot must scan and laser it before strain. Op1 correctly handles hidden hooks under pools without duplication. The bot must scan magnets and props before using forceps. Incisions are visible and ranked higher than magnets.\n\nThe pathAim logic for the tumor circle is being traced. The first call returns the start position when no target is active yet. On the next frame, the started flag becomes true and along jumps to the full length because the cap is large.\n\nAt skill 1 the bot advances along a line by roughly 0.28 units per frame. A 1.6-unit incision takes about six frames. maxAlong updates each frame so the bot stays on the path. The scalpel places the tool directly at the aim point without using approach logic.\n\nThe closed-circuit path logic for the tumor circle is being traced. The closed check runs before the initial start position return, so the bot begins at the start point when no target is active yet.\n\nThe bot jumps to 20% of the circle path on the second frame. It then creeps toward 94%. Completion requires maxAlong to reach 90% and distance to end under 0.5. The radius is 0.62, so this threshold must be checked.\n\nThe circle perimeter is roughly 3.43 units. The 94% point sits 0.21 units from the end, satisfying the 0.5 completion threshold. However, that point may be closer to the start vertex than to its true position along the path.\n\nThe 94% circle point is confirmed valid. It sits 0.21 units from the start vertex, so it is not closer to the wrong endpoint.\n\nForceps pull logic is verified. The bot starts at the path origin, grabs on the first frame, then advances along the path once holding begins.\n\nMagnet speed is within limits. The per-frame delta of 2.4 is below the 3.2 cap.\n\nDressing tool selection and path tracking are verified. The syringe ring on op1 is optional, so the stage clears without injecting. Op5 cyst laser takes 0.7 seconds. Op6 cold time of 120 seconds should be manageable with sutures, a 4.5-second wait, and unclamping; look rewind may add extra time.\n\nOp6 firstClot waits four seconds for lookReady before unclamping. Orders one and two are blocked during that idle period. Composure is confirmed sufficient at 89 points, covering the 60-point look cost. Clamp finish is clean. A potential bug was noted in stage seven unclamp timing.\n\nThe stage seven timing concern is resolved. The four-second lookReady window captures a sample from the new stage, so unclamping succeeds. A subsequent look rewind restores the bot to just after the stage start, before unclamping finished, but the next frame proceeds correctly. Look restoration preserves stage index, spawned entities, and score. The cold value also recovers from the earlier snapshot.\n\ntryLook returns early before tools run. The gift frame skips unclamping, but the next frame rewinds and the look latch clears so unclamping proceeds normally.\n\nOp7 sobs may be slow. Droplets only outrank the eye when z is above -1.6; otherwise the eye wins. Droplets steal priority at -1.6 and above, costing one vital each. Up to fifteen droplets could drain vitals from 80 down to roughly 65.\n\nOp8 heart diastole timing is verified. The beat starts in systole, so the bot waits for diastole before incising and later before strain plates.\n\nOp8 total time is roughly 420 seconds, covering diastole waits, seven plates, code blue, massage, and closure.\n\nOp9 sanctus uses eight real cysts and four fake ones. The bot scans and lasers only the real ones. Seat 0 is left and seat 1 is right.\n\nBoth seats may scan the same cyst, but claimed() prevents duplicate laser claims. Sanctus drains vitals from 70 down to roughly 41 after eight parallel laser sessions. Reprise, miserere, code blue, and dressing then drain another eleven points, leaving vitals near 30. The syringe ring is only available on the final stage, so it cannot be used during this hard period. An optional ring on the first stage was considered, but that stage only handles strain and does not spawn entities.\n\nAn optional ring will be spawned at the start of the sanctus strain stage so the bot can syringe it. The reprise and miserere sequence takes roughly forty seconds, draining about seven vitals to thirty-four. That keeps vitals above zero.\n\nMiserere incisions are assigned to seat 0 on the right side, leaving seat 1 idle. Both seats then tether. Seat 0 copies the ghost scalpel near target without error and sets the copied flag. The partner seat skill argument is ignored because play() uses the skill argument for all seats. Op3 table selection scores the current table at roughly 0.1 points and other tables at roughly 2.1 points.\n\nTables are sequential stages, so the bot finishes one table before the next spawns. Table C drains vitals while it is idle, but it still survives because the first two tables take only about thirty seconds. The quiet stage is instant. All three tables become active during the second wave.\n\nThe \"three live tables\" test only requires three tables to survive with positive vitals at the end. An idle op3 table will fail once vitals hit zero and trigger code blue or timeout. Op1 twelfth is confirmed for a later stage. The op5 and op6 hidden cysts are real and finish normally via finish(), not a special strain. The opening incision waits for diastole, so it cannot nick the heart during systole.\n\nA quick Node test runner will be written to run op1 first and catch failures. The hooks spread bug is confirmed safe because only h3 through h11 are used. Op2 magnet speed and hidden placement are verified. Forcep