{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_70","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The bot is at the end of the path.\n\nThe pulled value stays at 0.00 because the update logic should have advanced it to 0.71, but the stepForceps function may not be receiving the held entity.\n\nThe held entity is correctly identified and the simulation timestep is valid. The hook has a path, so the early return conditions are not blocking the update. The bug must be inside the stepForceps function itself.\n\nThe bot correctly drains pools before switching to forceps. The stuck pulled value likely stems from the snap code or a stale file read.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-49759c28-2bcc-4c60-8e5d-5aa82395da53-74","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":640,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2877,"output_tokens":643,"cache_read_input_tokens":177792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"35577846-1cfc-4c5a-9c42-661815dc91eb"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-49759c28-2bcc-4c60-8e5d-5aa82395da53-74","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"640→    let best = null;\\n    let bestD = 0.45 * sim.config.toolTol;\\n    for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n      if (e.done || e.grabbedBy >= 0 || !sameTable(e, seat, sim)) continue;\\n      if (e.hidden && !e.marked) continue;\\n      const tool = toolFor(e);\\n      if (tool !== 'forceps') continue;\\n      if (e.window === 'diastole' && !sim.diastole) {\\n        nickWindow(sim, seat, e);\\n        continue;\\n650→      }\\n      const d = dist(seat.x, seat.z, e.x, e.z);\\n      if (d <= bestD) {\\n        best = e;\\n        bestD = d;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    if (best) {\\n      if (best.kind === 'clamp' || best.kind === 'unclamp') {\\n        best.hold = (best.hold || 0) + dt;\\n660→        if (best.hold >= 0.35) tryUnclamp(sim, seat, best);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (best.kind === 'tether') {\\n        best.hold = (best.hold || 0) + dt;\\n        const hands = sim.seats.filter((s) => s.use && s.tool === 'forceps' && (dist(s.x, s.z, best.x, best.z) < 0.7 || dist(s.x, s.z, best.x2, best.z2) < 0.7)).length;\\n        if (hands >= best.hands && best.hold >= 0.5) finish(sim, seat, best, 'CLEAN');\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      best.grabbedBy = seat.id;\\n670→      seat.holding = best.id;\\n      held = best;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (!held || held.done) return;\\n  if (held.kind === 'fragment') return;\\n  if (!held.path) return;\\n  if (held.window === 'diastole' && !sim.diastole) {\\n    nickWindow(sim, seat, held);\\n    return;\\n680→  }\\n  const m = pathMetrics(held.path, seat.x, seat.z);\\n  held.devSum += m.dev;\\n  held.devN += 1;\\n  if (m.dev > 1) {\\n    held.grabbedBy = -1;\\n    seat.holding = -1;\\n    held.pulled = Math.max(0, held.pulled - 0.3);\\n    spawn(sim, { kind: 'nick', x: seat.x, z: seat.z, optional: true, table: held.table });\\n    rate(sim, seat, 'MISTAKE', seat.x, seat.z);\\n690→    return;\\n  }\\n  let delta = m.along - held.pulled;\\n  if (held.speedLimit && dt > 0 && delta / dt > held.speedLimit) {\\n    held.pulled = Math.max(0, held.pulled - 0.35);\\n    pushEvent(sim, { type: 'snap', id: held.id });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (delta > 0) held.pulled = m.along;\\n  if (held.pulled >= (held.pull || m.length) - 0.05) {\\n700→    held.free = true;\\n    const mean = held.devN ? held.devSum / held.devN : 0;\\n    const kind = mean <= 0.12 ? 'CLEAN' : mean <= 0.3 ? 'GOOD' : 'SLOPPY';\\n    if (held.kind === 'plate' && held.phase === 'lift') {\\n      held.phase = 'burn';\\n      held.free = false;\\n      held.pulled = 0;\\n      held.path = null;\\n      held.grabbedBy = -1;\\n      seat.holding = -1;\\n710→      held.windowHit = false;\\n      rate(sim, seat, kind, held.x, held.z);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    finish(sim, seat, held, kind);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tryUnclamp(sim, seat, e) {\\n  if (e.kind === 'unclamp' && e.order > 0) {\\n720→    const prev = sim.entities.find((x) => x.kind === 'unclamp' && x.order === e.order - 1);\\n    if (prev && !prev.done) {\\n      e.hold = 0;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (e.kind === 'unclamp' && e.firstClot && !sim.persist.rewound) {\\n    sim.persist.needRewind = true;\\n    sim.persist.clotSeen = true;\\n    const table = sim.tables[sim.active];\",\"content_concise\":\"640→    let best = null;\\n    let bestD = 0.45 * sim.config.toolTol;\\n    for (const e of sim.entities) {\\n      if (e.done || e.grabbedBy >= 0 || !sameTable(e, seat, sim)) continue;\\n      if (e.hidden && !e.marked) continue;\\n      const tool = toolFor(e);\\n      if (tool !== 'forceps') continue;\\n      if (e.window === 'diastole' && !sim.diastole) {\\n        nickWindow(sim, seat, e);\\n        continue;\\n650→      }\\n      const d = dist(seat.x, seat.z, e.x, e.z);\\n      if (d <= bestD) {\\n        best = e;\\n        bestD = d;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  