{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_71","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Frame 27 shows hold h1 at the start position. Pull is zero. Along and malong are both logged as zero.\n\nFrame 28 shows position moved to -2.99, -0.85. Pull remains zero while malong is 0.28. The step failed to update pulled from along even though delta was positive. The step ordering needs review.\n\nThe step runs moveSeats before applyTools. botInput computes the next aim from the current position. After step, position equals aim. The pulled update should follow from that new position.\n\nThe zero speedLimit is ruled out. Only one seat exists, and the forceps tool is unlocked and active. The cause of the skipped pulled update remains unknown.\n\ntickPassive does not reset hooks, so pulled was not cleared afterward. Duplicate entities with id h1 are unlikely. The next step is to inspect the grabbedBy and held entity logic.\n\nThe delta-to-dt ratio is 16.8, which should exceed any speedLimit threshold. The `held.speedLimit &&` guard evaluates to false because the value is undefined.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-5dbcd8bd-82c4-4539-a621-74032e603563-75","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","old_string":"  let delta = m.along - held.pulled;\n  if (held.speedLimit && dt > 0 && delta / dt > held.speedLimit) {","new_string":"  let delta = m.along - held.pulled;\n  if (held.id === 'h1' && sim.t < 1) sim._dbg = { along: m.along, delta, limit: held.speedLimit, dt, pulled: held.pulled };\n  if (held.speedLimit && dt > 0 && delta / dt > held.speedLimit) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1786,"output_tokens":1106,"cache_read_input_tokens":180608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool