{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cfed658a-d2de-404e-a393-15ba3bb50e21-80","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"249→  sim.vitals = sim.tables[sim.active].vitals;\\n250→  sim.shown = sim.lie ? 99 : Math.max(0, Math.round(sim.vitals));\\n}\\n\\nexport function step(sim, inputs = {}, dt = 1 / 60) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return sim;\\n  dt = Math.max(0, Math.min(0.25, dt));\\n  sim.realT += dt;\\n  const quiet = updateQuiet(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  const simDt = dt * (quiet ? sim.config.quietScale : 1) * (sim.devSpeed || 1);\\n  sim.t += simDt;\\n260→  sim.stageT = (sim.stageT || 0) + simDt;\\n  if (sim.heart) {\\n    sim.beatPhase = (sim.beatPhase + simDt * (sim.bpm / 60)) % 1;\\n    sim.diastole = sim.beatPhase >= 0.35;\\n  } else sim.diastole = true;\\n\\n  recordHist(sim);\\n  moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  if (tryLook(sim, inputs)) return sim;\\n\\n270→  if (sim.phase === 'codeblue') {\\n    stepCode(sim, inputs, dt);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  if (sim.phase === 'massage') {\\n    stepMassage(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n    drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n    tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n    checkVitals(sim);\\n    return sim;\\n280→  }\\n\\n  applyTools(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n  if (sim.pendingGhostMistake) {\\n    sim.pendingGhostMistake = false;\\n    rate(sim, sim.seats[0], 'MISTAKE', sim.seats[0].x, sim.seats[0].z);\\n  }\\n  tickPassive(sim, simDt);\\n  tickStrains(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.flags.needFib && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n290→    sim.flags.needFib = false;\\n    beginCode(sim, true, sim.active);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n  tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.cold != null && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n    sim.cold -= simDt;\\n    if (sim.cold <= 0) lose(sim, 'cold');\\n  }\\n300→  checkVitals(sim);\\n  if (sim.vitals < 50 && sim.def?.tools?.includes('syringe')) sim.unlocked.add('syringe');\\n  advanceStage(sim);\\n  return sim;\",\"content_concise\":\"249→  sim.vitals = sim.tables[sim.active].vitals;\\n250→  sim.shown = sim.lie ? 99 : Math.max(0, Math.round(sim.vitals));\\n}\\n\\nexport function step(sim, inputs = {}, dt = 1 / 60) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return sim;\\n  dt = Math.max(0, Math.min(0.25, dt));\\n  sim.realT += dt;\\n  const quiet = updateQuiet(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  const simDt = dt * (quiet ? sim.config.quietScale : 1) * (sim.devSpeed || 1);\\n  sim.t += simDt;\\n260→  sim.stageT = (sim.stageT || 0) + simDt;\\n  if (sim.heart) {\\n    sim.beatPhase = (sim.beatPhase + simDt * (sim.bpm / 60)) % 1;\\n    sim.diastole = sim.beatPhase >= 0.35;\\n  } else sim.diastole = true;\\n\\n  recordHist(sim);\\n  moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  if (tryLook(sim, inputs)) return sim;\\n\\n270→  if (sim.phase === 'codeblue') {\\n    stepCode(sim, inputs, dt);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  if (sim.phase === 'massage') {\\n    stepMassage(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n    drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n    tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n    checkVitals(sim);\\n    return sim;\\n280→  }\\n\\n  applyTools(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n  if (sim.pendingGhostMistake) {\\n    sim.pendingGhostMistake = false;\\n    rate(sim, sim.seats[0], 'MISTAKE', sim.seats[0].x, sim.seats[0].z);\\n  }\\n  tickPassive(sim, simDt);\\n  tickStrains(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.flags.needFib && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n290→    sim.flags.needFib = false;\\n    beginCode(sim, true, sim.active);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n  tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.cold != null && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n    sim.cold -= simDt;\\n    if (sim.cold <= 0) lose(sim, 'cold');\\n  }\\n300→  checkVitals(sim);\\n  if (sim.vitals < 50 && sim.def?.tools?.includes('syringe')) sim.unlocked.add('syringe');\\n  advanceStage(sim);\\n  return sim;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":249,\"limit\":55,\"raw_output\":\"  sim.vitals = sim.tables[sim.active].vitals;\\n  sim.shown = sim.lie ? 99 : Math.max(0, Math.round(sim.vitals));\\n}\\n\\nexport function step(sim, inputs = {}, dt = 1 / 60) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return sim;\\n  dt = Math.max(0, Math.min(0.25, dt));\\n  sim.realT += dt;\\n  const quiet = updateQuiet(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  const simDt = dt * (quiet ? sim.config.quietScale : 1) * (sim.devSpeed || 1);\\n  sim.t += simDt;\\n  sim.stageT = (sim.stageT || 0) + simDt;\\n  if (sim.heart) {\\n    sim.beatPhase = (sim.beatPhase + simDt * (sim.bpm / 60)) % 1;\\n    sim.diastole = sim.beatPhase >= 0.35;\\n  } else sim.diastole = true;\\n\\n  recordHist(sim);\\n  moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt);\\n  if (tryLook(sim, inputs)) return sim;\\n\\n  if (sim.phase === 'codeblue') {\\n    stepCode(sim, inputs, dt);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  if (sim.phase === 'massage') {\\n    stepMassage(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n    drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n    tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n    checkVitals(sim);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  applyTools(sim, inputs, simDt);\\n  if (sim.pendingGhostMistake) {\\n    sim.pendingGhostMistake = false;\\n    rate(sim, sim.seats[0], 'MISTAKE', sim.seats[0].x, sim.seats[0].z);\\n  }\\n  tickPassive(sim, simDt);\\n  tickStrains(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.flags.needFib && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n    sim.flags.needFib = false;\\n    beginCode(sim, true, sim.active);\\n    return sim;\\n  }\\n  drainVitals(sim, simDt, quiet);\\n  tickClock(sim, simDt);\\n  if (sim.cold != null && sim.phase === 'play') {\\n    sim.cold -= simDt;\\n    if (sim.cold <= 0) lose(sim, 'cold');\\n  }\\n  checkVitals(sim);\\n  if (sim.vitals < 50 && sim.def?.tools?.includes('syringe')) sim.unlocked.add('syringe');\\n  advanceStage(sim);\\n  return sim;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1131}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cfed658a-d2de-404e-a393-15ba3bb50e21-81","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"318→  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n320→}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n330→    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIELD.z, input.z));\\n    } else if (input.seek) {\\n      let sp = input.speed || sim.config.cursorSpeed;\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      const dx = (input.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (input.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      const d = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1;\\n340→      const stepLen = Math.min(Math.hypot(dx, dz), sp * dt);\\n      seat.x += (dx / d) * stepLen;\\n      seat.z += (dz / d) * stepLen;\\n    } else if (input.sx || input.sz) {\\n      const mag = Math.min(1, Math.hypot(input.sx || 0, input.sz || 0));\\n      let sp = sim.config.cursorSpeed * Math.pow(mag, 2.2);\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      if (sim.config.aimAssist > 0) {\\n        const near = sim.entities.some((e) => !e.done && !e.hidden && dist(seat.x, seat.z, e.x, e.z) < 0.6 * tol);\\n        if (near) sp *= 0.6;\\n350→      }\\n      const m = mag || 1;\\n      seat.x += ((input.sx || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n      seat.z += ((input.sz || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (input.angle != null && seat.holding >= 0) {\\n      const held = findEnt(sim, seat.holding);\\n      if (held && held.kind === 'fragment') held.ang = input.angle;\\n    }\\n  }\\n360→}\\n\\nfunction tryLook(sim, inputs) {\",\"content_concise\":\"318→  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n320→}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n330→    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIELD.z, input.z));\\n    } else if (input.seek) {\\n      let sp = input.speed || sim.config.cursorSpeed;\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      const dx = (input.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (input.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      const d = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1;\\n340→      const stepLen = Math.min(Math.hypot(dx, dz), sp * dt);\\n      seat.x += (dx / d) * stepLen;\\n      seat.z += (dz / d) * stepLen;\\n    } else if (input.sx || input.sz) {\\n      const mag = Math.min(1, Math.hypot(input.sx || 0, input.sz || 0));\\n      let sp = sim.config.cursorSpeed * Math.pow(mag, 2.2);\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      if (sim.config.aimAssist > 0) {\\n        const near = sim.entities.some((e) => !e.done && !e.hidden && dist(seat.x, seat.z, e.x, e.z) < 0.6 * tol);\\n        if (near) sp *= 0.6;\\n350→      }\\n      const m = mag || 1;\\n      seat.x += ((input.sx || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n      seat.z += ((input.sz || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (input.angle != null && seat.holding >= 0) {\\n      const held = findEnt(sim, seat.holding);\\n      if (held && held.kind === 'fragment') held.ang = input.angle;\\n    }\\n  }\\n360→}\\n\\nfunction tryLook(sim, inputs) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":318,\"limit\":45,\"raw_output\":\"  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIELD.z, input.z));\\n    } else if (input.seek) {\\n      let sp = input.speed || sim.config.cursorSpeed;\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      const dx = (input.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (input.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      const d = Math.hypot(dx, dz) || 1;\\n      const stepLen = Math.min(Math.hypot(dx, dz), sp * dt);\\n      seat.x += (dx / d) * stepLen;\\n      seat.z += (dz / d) * stepLen;\\n    } else if (input.sx || input.sz) {\\n      const mag = Math.min(1, Math.hypot(input.sx || 0, input.sz || 0));\\n      let sp = sim.config.cursorSpeed * Math.pow(mag, 2.2);\\n      if (input.steady) sp *= sim.config.steadyFactor;\\n      if (sim.config.aimAssist > 0) {\\n        const near = sim.entities.some((e) => !e.done && !e.hidden && dist(seat.x, seat.z, e.x, e.z) < 0.6 * tol);\\n        if (near) sp *= 0.6;\\n      }\\n      const m = mag || 1;\\n      seat.x += ((input.sx || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n      seat.z += ((input.sz || 0) / m) * sp * dt;\\n    }\\n    if (input.angle != null && seat.holding >= 0) {\\n      const held = findEnt(sim, seat.holding);\\n      if (held && held.kind === 'fragment') held.ang = input.angle;\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction tryLook(sim, inputs) {\\n\",\"total_lines\":1131}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b831dd49-69ba-4ed1-930e-38ccf391acbb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_77","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"tryLook restores state including seat positions from the snapshot when it returns true.\n\ntryLook returns early before stepForceps. The old seat position debug output is from frame 27 and never overwritten.\n\ntryLook should not fire. The seat gift is quiet, but tryLook requires look. It returns false.\n\nstepForceps is not running on frames 28+. The using flag in applyTools may be false despite the forceps being held and use being true. That would prevent stepForceps from executing.\n\nThe `using` flag is true, so stepForceps does run. The stale debug output is not caused by a missing tool step. The `sim.t < 1.2` condition is also satisfied at frame 28. The real cause of the stale debug remains unknown.\n\nThe early return in stepForceps might occur before the debug line. If held.path is missing, the function exits without updating _dbg.\n\ntryLook restoring entities could also cause this. The restored held.id may point to a different entity in the restored array, making held.path invalid and triggering an early return.\n\nThe history snapshot is captured before moveSeats runs. It stores old entity positions and seat state like holding, but not x or z. If tryLook restores this snapshot every frame, it would overwrite the new seat position with the old one while leaving the tool held.\n\nThe snapshot would overwrite the new seat position each frame while leaving the tool held, which would freeze the pulled count and prevent any further tool updates. This matches the stale debug output from frame 28 onward. The gift-of logic returns only one gift per frame, so tryLook cannot fire on Op1 because its gift is quiet rather than look.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-340db539-20b3-4506-b6b7-4549a2235bbf-82","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { OPS } from './src/content/ops.js';\nimport { createOp, step, drainEvents } from './src/sim/op.js';\nimport { botInput } from './src/sim/bot.js';\nconst sim = createOp(OPS[0], { seed: 1 });\nconsole.log('gift', sim.seats[0].gift, 'look', sim.persist.lookUnlocked, 'quiet', sim.persist.quietUnlocked);\nfor (let i = 0; i < 34; i++) {\n  const input = botInput(sim, 0, 1, 1/60);\n  step(sim, {0: input}, 1/60);\n  if (i>=26 && i<=32) {\n    const ev = drainEvents(sim).map(e=>e.type+':'+(e.rate||e.id||'')).join(',');\n    console.log(i, 'giftIn', input.gift, 'quiet', sim.quietOn, 'comp', sim.composure.toFixed(0), 'looks', sim.persist.lookUses, 'ev', ev, 'hold', sim.seats[0].holding);\n  }\n}\n\"","description":"See if Second Look or Quiet interrupts the pull"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1617,"output_tokens":1464,"cache_read_input_tokens":189824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"d0a14adf-2dc1-4e1f-a9bc-097d0a6117ef"}
