 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 37 doneProps \\n120 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n160 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n200 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n240 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n280 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n320 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n360 stage 2 hold mag mag false 0.00/1.10 snaps 40 doneProps \\n(node:4046877) Warning: The 'NO_COLOR' env is ignored due to the 'FORCE_COLOR' env being set.\\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"command\":\"cd \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040\\\" && node --input-type=module -e \\\"\\nimport { OPS } from './src/content/ops.js';\\nimport { createOp, step, drainEvents } from './src/sim/op.js';\\nimport { botInput } from './src/sim/bot.js';\\nconst sim = createOp(OPS[1], { seed: 1 });\\nlet i = 0;\\nwhile (sim.stageIndex < 2 && i < 5000) { step(sim, {0: botInput(sim,0,1,1/60)}, 1/60); i++; }\\nfor (let k = 0; k < 400; k++) {\\n  step(sim, {0: botInput(sim,0,1,1/60)}, 1/60);\\n  if (k%40===0) {\\n    const m = sim.entities.find(e=>e.id==='mag');\\n    const snaps = drainEvents(sim).filter(e=>e.type==='snap').length;\\n    console.log(k, 'stage', sim.stageIndex, 'hold', sim.seats[0].holding, 'mag', m && (m.done+' '+m.pulled.toFixed(2)+'/'+m.pull.toFixed(2)), 'snaps', snaps, 'doneProps', sim.entities.filter(e=>e.done&&(e.kind==='prop'||e.kind==='magnet')).map(e=>e.id).join(','));\\n  }\\n}\\n\\\"\",\"truncated\":false,\"signal\":null,\"timed_out\":false,\"description\":\"Watch magnet pull and snap events\",\"current_dir\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work\",\"output_file\":\"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3%2Fwork/01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4/terminal/call-99c16a67-8a75-42dd-9c6d-46f8617b38e5-94.log\",\"total_bytes\":1079}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"9c63f308-fef0-419a-b34f-ab174442f1df"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_85","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The progress indicator reaches 0.92/1.10, then snaps back to zero and stays there.\n\nThe finish threshold is 1.05. The snap likely happens because the bot overshoots past the path end, causing the along measurement to jump to 1.10 and exceed the speed limit.\n\nThe overshoot produces a delta of 0.18 over one frame, giving a speed of 10.8, which exceeds the 3.2 limit and triggers the snap. The bot's stored _along value can drift from pathMetrics, so the fix is to move the cursor only a small distance along the freshly measured along value each frame.\n\nThe fix caps movement at the smaller of the skill-based limit or 72% of the entity's speedLimit. The bot will first approach the path start, then advance only by that small cap each frame. If it is far from the path, it will first move to the closest point before continuing.\n\nThe cap is now 70% of the entity's speedLimit. If the bot is more than 0.25 units from the path, it resets to the start. If it is more than 0.15 units away, it moves toward the closest point first. For closed paths, the bot must reach 93% progress before finishing.\n\nThe cap is now 0.037 units per frame, derived from 70% of the speed limit divided by 60. This prevents a single overshoot jump to the path end; instead the bot creeps forward in small steps. When only 0.04 units remain, the speed drops to 2.4, safely below the 3.2 threshold.\n\nThe stored _along value is abandoned entirely to prevent jumps. The creep cap is now 0.27 units per frame, so a 1.6-unit path finishes in about six frames.\n\nFor the first approach, if the bot is more than 0.2 units from the path it moves toward the closest point or the start. A scalpel that has not started yet goes to the start first. A forceps that is not holding an entity also returns to its origin before creeping forward.\n\nMoving toward the closest point while far away risks landing mid-path and grabbing the wrong target.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fec91720-7c6a-49f1-96b5-621fb210e572-95","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/bot.js","old_string":"function pathAim(sim, seat, e, skill, dt) {\n  const path = e.path;\n  if (!path?.length) return { x: e.x, z: e.z };\n  const len = e.pull || pathLength(path);\n  const closed = dist(path[0].x, path[0].z, path[path.length - 1].x, path[path.length - 1].z) < 0.08;\n  let along = 0;\n  if (seat.holding === e.id || e.started || seat._pathId === e.id) {\n    const prev = seat._along || 0;\n    let cap = (5 + 12 * skill) * dt;\n    if (e.speedLimit) cap = Math.min(cap, e.speedLimit * 0.75 * dt);\n    along = Math.min(len, prev + cap);\n    if (closed) along = Math.min(len * 0.94, Math.max(along, len * 0.2));\n    if (!closed && along > len - 0.02) along = len;\n  } else {\n    along = 0;\n  }\n  seat._pathId = e.id;\n  seat._along = along;\n  if ((e.kind === 'incision' || e.kind === 'pore' || e.kind === 'tumor' || (e.kind === 'plate' && e.phase !== 'lift')) && !e.started && along < 0.05) {\n    return { x: path[0].x, z: path[0].z };\n  }\n  return pointAlong(path, along);\n}","new_string":"function pathAim(sim, seat, e, skill, dt) {\n  const path = e.path;\n  if (!path?.length) return { x: e.x, z: e.z };\n  const len = e.pull || pathLength(path);\n  const closed = dist(path[0].x, path[0].z, path[path.length - 1].x, path[path.length - 1].z) < 0.08;\n  const scalpel = e.kind === 'incision' || e.kind === 'pore' || e.kind === 'tumor' || (e.kind === 'plate' && e.phase !== 'lift');\n  if (scalpel && !e.started) return { x: path[0].x, z: path[0].z };\n  if (!scalpel && e.kind !== 'dressing' && seat.holding !== e.id) return { x: path[0].x, z: path[0].z };\n  const here = pathMetrics(path, seat.x, seat.z);\n  if (here.dev > 0.2) return pointAlong(path, here.along);\n  let cap = (6 + 12 * skill) * dt;\n  if (e.speedLimit) cap = Math.min(cap, e.speedLimit * 0.65 * dt);\n  let along = Math.min(len, here.along + cap);\n  if (closed) along = Math.min(len * 0.93, along);\n  return pointAlong(path, along);\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1041,"output_tokens":2022,"cache_read_input_tokens":200064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"15d75bfd-ad09-4e00-99c0-00e7ad97a7d9"}
