{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_87","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Almost everything won. Op5 lost because wounds from the introit were not sutured before time ran out.\n\nIntroit's long waits and missed knocks created many wounds. The bot was too slow to suture them all before the 360-second limit expired.\n\nSuturing should take only about 27 seconds for twenty wounds, so the bot likely stalled. The strain phase probably consumed most of the time due to misses and long waits. The suture stage may be stuck because overlapping wounds cause oscillating nearest-wound logic, or because side signs fail to cross properly for certain orientations. I will log suture progress during stage two to diagnose the freeze.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1a355f5c-164f-4e75-a920-346747638415-98","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd \"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040\" && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { OPS } from './src/content/ops.js';\nimport { createOp, step } from './src/sim/op.js';\nimport { botInput } from './src/sim/bot.js';\nconst sim = createOp(OPS.find(o=>o.id==='op5'), { seed: 1 });\nlet i=0;\nwhile (sim.stageIndex < 2 && sim.phase==='play' && i<30000) { step(sim,{0:botInput(sim,0,1,1/60)},1/60); i++; }\nconst wounds = sim.entities.filter(e=>e.kind==='wound' && !e.done);\nconsole.log('at suture', i, 't', sim.t.toFixed(1), 'wounds', wounds.length, 'phase', sim.phase, 'knocked', sim.flags.knocked);\nfor (let k=0;k<180;k++) step(sim,{0:botInput(sim,0,1,1/60)},1/60);\nconst left = sim.entities.filter(e=>e.kind==='wound' && !e.done);\nconsole.log('after 3s', 'left', left.length, 'sample', left.slice(0,3).map(e=>e.id+' slot '+e.nextSlot+'/'+e.slots.length+' side '+e.sideSign));\nconsole.log('tool', sim.seats[0].tool, 'pos', sim.seats[0].x.toFixed(2), sim.seats[0].z.toFixed(2));\n\"","description":"See why Op 5 wound suture stalls"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1002,"output_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":203136,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"4f06c8c5-fb5c-4cee-9ba7-e4461f4af3b4"}
