{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_99","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Op 5 won with a score of 7290, 338 seconds remaining, zero mistakes, and a knocked status.\n\nSuture spacing and lock fixes are in place. I will replay all operations at skills 1, 0.7, 0.4, and idle to remeasure scores before setting par. A full sweep of 11 operations at skill 0 could be slow.\n\nSkill 0 idle runs will take a few seconds to a minute. I will run the sweep in one script, starting with skill 1, then 0.7, then 0.4 on ops 1-3, and finally skill 0. Codec peak and criterion flags are also noted.\n\nI will print a compact table of play return fields: finalScore, rank, timeLeft, mistakes, flags, persist, pain, tables vitals, and phase.\n\nOp 9 is correct. The partner seat is driven by the balance bot, and skill 0 passes no input.\n\nI am checking whether op 9 needs two seats to pull the tether.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Op 5 clears at skill 1 (score 7290, 338s left). Next I’ll remeasure every operation, because the suture lock can change those scores."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bd44a04c-27a2-4a2e-8d5d-63e24105fd07-21","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { ALL_OPS } from './src/content/ops.js';\nimport { play } from './src/sim/run.js';\nconst ids = ALL_OPS.map(o => o.id);\nfunction beat(sim, id) {\n  const hooks = sim.entities.filter(e => e.kind==='hook');\n  const h1 = hooks.find(e => e.id==='h1');\n  const h12 = hooks.find(e => e.id==='h12');\n  const bits = [];\n  if (id==='op1') bits.push('h12', !!h12?.done, 'h1done', !!h1?.done);\n  if (id==='op5') bits.push('knocked', !!sim.flags.knocked);\n  if (id==='op6') bits.push('rewound', !!sim.persist.rewound, 'clot', !!sim.persist.clotSeen, 'pink', !!sim.flags.pink);\n  if (id==='op7') bits.push('sobs', sim.strain?.sobs, 'stalk', sim.entities.some(e => e.kind==='stalk' && e.done));\n  if (id==='op8') bits.push('blue', !!sim.flags.blueDone, 'mass', !!sim.flags.massaged);\n  if (id==='op9') bits.push('copied', !!sim.flags.copied, 'blue', !!sim.flags.blueDone, 'tether', sim.entities.some(e => e.kind==='tether' && e.done));\n  if (id==='op10') bits.push('pain', sim.pain, 'vit', sim.tables.map(t=>Math.round(t.vitals)).join(','));\n  if (id==='op3') bits.push('tables', sim.tables.length, 'quiet', !!sim.persist.quietUnlocked);\n  if (id==='op4') bits.push('frags', sim.entities.filter(e=>e.kind==='fragment' && e.done).length);\n  return bits.join(' ');\n}\nfor (const skill of [1, 0.7]) {\n  console.log('--- skill', skill);\n  for (const def of ALL_OPS) {\n    const sim = play(def, skill, { seed: 1, codec: skill===1 });\n    const left = sim.timeLeft / sim.timeMax;\n    console.log(def.id, sim.phase, 'left', Math.floor(sim.timeLeft), (left*100).toFixed(0)+'%', 'mis', sim.mistakes, 'sc', sim.finalScore, sim.rank, 'par', def.par, 'pk', sim._peakFast+'/'+sim._peakKey, beat(sim, def.id));\n  }\n}\n\"","description":"Measure skill 1.0 and 0.7 scores for every op"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":412,"output_tokens":1353,"cache_read_input_tokens":58752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"35f3ef54-2a70-4a1f-830b-5140672d2498"}
