{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c295b4fe-2d91-4e99-ab8b-389b629fcf7e-38","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→  applyRank(sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction lose(sim, reason) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n  sim.phase = 'lost';\\n  sim.reason = reason;\\n  sim.rank = 'C';\\n  sim.finalScore = 0;\\n}\\n210→\\nfunction pushEvent(sim, ev) {\\n  sim.events.push(ev);\\n  if (sim.events.length > 48) sim.events.shift();\\n}\\n\\nexport function drainEvents(sim) {\\n  const e = sim.events;\\n  sim.events = [];\\n  return e;\\n220→}\\n\\nfunction rate(sim, seat, kind, x, z) {\\n  if (kind === 'CLEAN') {\\n    sim.streak += 1;\\n    seat.cleans += 1;\\n    sim.composure = Math.min(100, sim.composure + sim.config.composureGain);\\n  } else {\\n    sim.streak = 0;\\n    if (kind === 'SLOPPY' || kind === 'MISTAKE') seat.sloppies += 1;\\n230→  }\\n  const pts = ratePoints(kind, sim.streak);\\n  sim.score += pts;\\n  seat.score += pts;\\n  pushEvent(sim, { type: 'rate', rate: kind, seat: seat?.id ?? 0, x, z, pts });\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') addMistake(sim, seat);\\n}\\n\\nfunction addMistake(sim, seat) {\\n  if (sim.god) return;\",\"content_concise\":\"200→  applyRank(sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction lose(sim, reason) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n  sim.phase = 'lost';\\n  sim.reason = reason;\\n  sim.rank = 'C';\\n  sim.finalScore = 0;\\n}\\n210→\\nfunction pushEvent(sim, ev) {\\n  sim.events.push(ev);\\n  if (sim.events.length > 48) sim.events.shift();\\n}\\n\\nexport function drainEvents(sim) {\\n  const e = sim.events;\\n  sim.events = [];\\n  return e;\\n220→}\\n\\nfunction rate(sim, seat, kind, x, z) {\\n  if (kind === 'CLEAN') {\\n    sim.streak += 1;\\n    seat.cleans += 1;\\n    sim.composure = Math.min(100, sim.composure + sim.config.composureGain);\\n  } else {\\n    sim.streak = 0;\\n    if (kind === 'SLOPPY' || kind === 'MISTAKE') seat.sloppies += 1;\\n230→  }\\n  const pts = ratePoints(kind, sim.streak);\\n  sim.score += pts;\\n  seat.score += pts;\\n  pushEvent(sim, { type: 'rate', rate: kind, seat: seat?.id ?? 0, x, z, pts });\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') addMistake(sim, seat);\\n}\\n\\nfunction addMistake(sim, seat) {\\n  if (sim.god) return;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":200,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"  applyRank(sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction lose(sim, reason) {\\n  if (sim.phase === 'won' || sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n  sim.phase = 'lost';\\n  sim.reason = reason;\\n  sim.rank = 'C';\\n  sim.finalScore = 0;\\n}\\n\\nfunction pushEvent(sim, ev) {\\n  sim.events.push(ev);\\n  if (sim.events.length > 48) sim.events.shift();\\n}\\n\\nexport function drainEvents(sim) {\\n  const e = sim.events;\\n  sim.events = [];\\n  return e;\\n}\\n\\nfunction rate(sim, seat, kind, x, z) {\\n  if (kind === 'CLEAN') {\\n    sim.streak += 1;\\n    seat.cleans += 1;\\n    sim.composure = Math.min(100, sim.composure + sim.config.composureGain);\\n  } else {\\n    sim.streak = 0;\\n    if (kind === 'SLOPPY' || kind === 'MISTAKE') seat.sloppies += 1;\\n  }\\n  const pts = ratePoints(kind, sim.streak);\\n  sim.score += pts;\\n  seat.score += pts;\\n  pushEvent(sim, { type: 'rate', rate: kind, seat: seat?.id ?? 0, x, z, pts });\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') addMistake(sim, seat);\\n}\\n\\nfunction addMistake(sim, seat) {\\n  if (sim.god) return;\\n\",\"total_lines\":1130}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"29df7d9b-ce05-45de-8ad5-bb5a473b4312"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_110","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Skill 1 will have plenty of composure.\n\nRewind will work once firstClot is wired. The look penalty multiplies final score by 0.95. A failed attempt loses roughly 4 seconds of clock time, but the bot regains that time via the snapshot and can redo unclamps cleanly.\n\nThe bot loses roughly 20 points from the 4-second idle wait plus the 5% look penalty. The score lands near 5514, which should still clear the stage. A new concern is whether the bot will drain the pool spawned by the clot in the same frame before rewind.\n\nThe bot looks before draining the pool. tryLook runs before tools, so it sees needRewind is still false on frame N and only sets it. On frame N+1, it restores the snapshot and returns early before tools fire. The look action requires composure of at least 60 and a history record.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-39","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/score.js","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-40","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/geom.js","old_string":"    order: spec.order ?? 0,","new_string":"    order: spec.order ?? 0,\n    firstClot: !!spec.firstClot,"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-41","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/strains.js","old_string":"  if (cuts.length && cuts.every((e) => e.done) && !sim.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'tether')) {\n    add(sim, { kind: 'tether', x: -0.45, z: 0.3, x2: 0.55, z2: 0.3, hands: 2, r: 0.5 });\n  }\n  if (sim.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'tether' && e.done)) die(sim, s);","new_string":"  if (cuts.length && cuts.every((e) => e.done) && !sim.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'tether')) {\n    add(sim, { kind: 'tether', x: -0.45, z: 0.3, x2: 0.55, z2: 0.3, hands: 2, r: 0.5 });\n  }\n  // The copy-hand arrives three seconds after the cut. The strain stays until that replay lands.\n  if (sim.flags.copied && sim.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'tether' && e.done)) die(sim, s);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":593,"output_tokens":1518,"cache_read_input_tokens":79744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"eb6906e8-d726-4269-b86e-c12f862daf56"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-39","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→const RANK_ORDER = ['C', 'B', 'A', 'S'];\\n\\nexport function ratePoints(kind, streak) {\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') return -150;\\n  if (kind === 'SLOPPY') return 20;\\n  if (kind === 'GOOD') return 60;\\n  const mult = Math.min(2, 1 + 0.1 * Math.max(0, streak - 1));\\n  return Math.round(100 * mult);\\n}\\n10→\\nexport function finalScore(sim) {\\n  const timePts = 5 * Math.max(0, Math.floor(sim.timeLeft));\\n  let vit = 0;\\n  for (const t of sim.tables) vit += Math.max(0, Math.floor(t.vitals));\\n  let s = sim.score + timePts + 10 * vit;\\n  if (sim.persist.lookUses > 0) s = Math.round(s * 0.95);\\n  return s;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const pct = par > 0 ? score / par : 0;\\n  let rank = pct >= 0.85 ? 'S' : pct >= 0.7 ? 'A' : pct >= 0.5 ? 'B' : 'C';\\n  if (cap && RANK_ORDER.indexOf(rank) > RANK_ORDER.indexOf(cap)) rank = cap;\\n  return rank;\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyRank(sim) {\\n  sim.finalScore = finalScore(sim);\\n  const cap = sim.persist.rankCap || (sim.persist.unscriptedBlue ? 'A' : null);\\n30→  sim.rank = rankFor(sim.finalScore, sim.par, cap);\\n  sim.pristine = sim.rank === 'S' && sim.mistakes === 0 && !sim.persist.unscriptedBlue;\\n  return sim.rank;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→const RANK_ORDER = ['C', 'B', 'A', 'S'];\\n\\nexport function ratePoints(kind, streak) {\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') return -150;\\n  if (kind === 'SLOPPY') return 20;\\n  if (kind === 'GOOD') return 60;\\n  const mult = Math.min(2, 1 + 0.1 * Math.max(0, streak - 1));\\n  return Math.round(100 * mult);\\n}\\n10→\\nexport function finalScore(sim) {\\n  const timePts = 5 * Math.max(0, Math.floor(sim.timeLeft));\\n  let vit = 0;\\n  for (const t of sim.tables) vit += Math.max(0, Math.floor(t.vitals));\\n  let s = sim.score + timePts + 10 * vit;\\n  if (sim.persist.lookUses > 0) s = Math.round(s * 0.95);\\n  return s;\\n}\\n\\n20→export function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const pct = par > 0 ? score / par : 0;\\n  let rank = pct >= 0.85 ? 'S' : pct >= 0.7 ? 'A' : pct >= 0.5 ? 'B' : 'C';\\n  if (cap && RANK_ORDER.indexOf(rank) > RANK_ORDER.indexOf(cap)) rank = cap;\\n  return rank;\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyRank(sim) {\\n  sim.finalScore = finalScore(sim);\\n  const cap = sim.persist.rankCap || (sim.persist.unscriptedBlue ? 'A' : null);\\n30→  sim.rank = rankFor(sim.finalScore, sim.par, cap);\\n  sim.pristine = sim.rank === 'S' && sim.mistakes === 0 && !sim.persist.unscriptedBlue;\\n  return sim.rank;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/score.js\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"const RANK_ORDER = ['C', 'B', 'A', 'S'];\\n\\nexport function ratePoints(kind, streak) {\\n  if (kind === 'MISTAKE') return -150;\\n  if (kind === 'SLOPPY') return 20;\\n  if (kind === 'GOOD') return 60;\\n  const mult = Math.min(2, 1 + 0.1 * Math.max(0, streak - 1));\\n  return Math.round(100 * mult);\\n}\\n\\nexport function finalScore(sim) {\\n  const timePts = 5 * Math.max(0, Math.floor(sim.timeLeft));\\n  let vit = 0;\\n  for (const t of sim.tables) vit += Math.max(0, Math.floor(t.vitals));\\n  let s = sim.score + timePts + 10 * vit;\\n  if (sim.persist.lookUses > 0) s = Math.round(s * 0.95);\\n  return s;\\n}\\n\\nexport function rankFor(score, par, cap) {\\n  const pct = par > 0 ? score / par : 0;\\n  let rank = pct >= 0.85 ? 'S' : pct >= 0.7 ? 'A' : pct >= 0.5 ? 'B' : 'C';\\n  if (cap && RANK_ORDER.indexOf(rank) > RANK_ORDER.indexOf(cap)) rank = cap;\\n  return rank;\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyRank(sim) {\\n  sim.finalScore = finalScore(sim);\\n  const cap = sim.persist.rankCap || (sim.persist.unscriptedBlue ? 'A' : null);\\n  sim.rank = rankFor(sim.finalScore, sim.par, cap);\\n  sim.pristine = sim.rank === 'S' && sim.mistakes === 0 && !sim.persist.unscriptedBlue;\\n  return sim.rank;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":33}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-40","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"    order: spec.order ?? 0,\",\"new_string\":\"    order: spec.order ?? 0,\\n    firstClot: !!spec.firstClot,\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/geom.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/geom.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/geom.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    order: spec.order ?? 0,\",\"old_line\":171,\"new_string\":\"    order: spec.order ?? 0,\\n    firstClot: !!spec.firstClot,\",\"new_line\":171,\"context_before\":\"    vitalOnDone: spec.vitalOnDone || 0,\\n    painOnDone: spec.painOnDone || 0,\\n    side: spec.side || '',\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    burn: spec.burn || 0,\\n    hold: 0,\\n    openT: 0,\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-03e9a4c6-6c6d-4843-b535-206b985b9357-41","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"  if (cuts.length && cuts.every((e) => e.done) && !sim.entities.some((e) => e.kind === 'tether')) {\\n    add(sim, { kind: 'tether', x: -0.45, z: 0.3, x2: 0.55, z2: 0.3, hands: 2, r: 0.5 });\\n  }\\n  if (