{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_113","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Operation 6 scored 5505 points after a rewind, down from 5805.\n\nThe 4-second idle was refunded by the rewind, leaving time at 353.\n\nOperation 9 scored 7310 with zero mistakes and left 530 time. The ghost wait was 2 seconds and the lie was seen.\n\nAll non-boss operations have over 94% clock coverage. Skill 0.4 must clear operations 1-3. Skill 0 must lose all.\n\nCodec peaks were under 1100, peaking at operation 7 with 955. Now running skill 0.4 and skill 0.\n\nFinal par scores are set. Operations 6 and 9 changed after the suture lock. The remaining operations stayed stable.\n\nSkill 1 will be re-run once more with a deterministic seed to confirm stability. Skill 0.7 will be checked against the new par. If skill 1 matches the par exactly, it is S-level.\n\nOperation 4 is 99.9% S-level. Operation 7 is 6005 versus par 6010. Pile is 4280 versus par 4285.\n\nSkill 0.7 must be remeasured for operations 6 and 9. It may lose operation 6 if the look fails composure or timing.\n\nSkill 0 runs to timeout. Operation 1 has a 14400 frame limit. Operation 2 has a 18000 frame limit.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9938ef4a-19bd-429d-a23f-2fa9b648d27c-45","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && node --input-type=module -e \"\nimport { ALL_OPS } from './src/content/ops.js';\nimport { play } from './src/sim/run.js';\nfunction row(def, skill) {\n  const sim = play(def, skill, { seed: 1, codec: skill===1 });\n  const pct = (sim.timeLeft / sim.timeMax * 100).toFixed(0);\n  console.log('s'+skill, def.id, sim.phase, sim.reason||'', 'left', Math.floor(sim.timeLeft), pct+'%', 'mis', sim.mistakes, 'sc', sim.finalScore, sim.rank, 'pk', sim._peakFast);\n}\nconsole.log('--- 0.7');\nfor (const def of ALL_OPS) row(def, 0.7);\nconsole.log('--- 0.4 first three');\nfor (const def of ALL_OPS.filter(o => ['op1','op2','op3'].includes(o.id))) row(def, 0.4);\nconsole.log('--- idle');\nfor (const def of ALL_OPS) row(def, 0);\n\"","description":"Balance sweep at skill 0.7, 0.4, and idle"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":922,"output_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":84608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"e5dfe01d-eaa4-4764-9ce9-f5806e878e6b"}
