er\":763,\"content\":\"## 13. Testing\"},{\"line_number\":765,\"content\":\"One command: `node tests/run.mjs` prints only failures and one count line. An optional filter (`sim`, `content`, `browser`, `hub`) lets you rerun only what you changed.\"},{\"line_number\":780,\"content\":\"- No `TODO` or placeholder strings; About has every field.\"},{\"line_number\":822,\"content\":\"## 14. Build and packaging\"},{\"line_number\":848,\"content\":\"## 15. Order of work\"},{\"line_number\":872,\"content\":\"## 16. Done means\"},{\"line_number\":892,\"content\":\"| No TODOs or placeholders | §13 lint |\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"ca8d84e3-e754-4401-a788-21ebb40c80d9"}
