{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d214c62a-ef1b-47dc-86c5-845e8173c830-84","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\\n\\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\\n\\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\\n  const list = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\\n10→  }\\n  return list;\\n}\\n\\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\\n}\\n\\nexport const OPS = [\\n  {\\n20→    id: 'op1',\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\\n\\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\\n\\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\\n  const list = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\\n10→  }\\n  return list;\\n}\\n\\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\\n}\\n\\nexport const OPS = [\\n  {\\n20→    id: 'op1',\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":20,\"raw_output\":\"/** Operation data. Add a new op by pushing another object: stages spawn entities, and the bot plays whatever toolFor understands. */\\n\\nconst line = (id, kind, x, z, extra = {}) => ({ id, kind, x, z, ...extra });\\n\\nfunction hooks(n, y = -1.1) {\\n  const list = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const x = -3.1 + i * 0.62;\\n    list.push(line(`h${i + 1}`, 'hook', x, y, { pull: 1.05, curve: 0.45 + (i % 3) * 0.15, dx: 0.1, dz: 1 }));\\n  }\\n  return list;\\n}\\n\\nfunction follow(rank, text) {\\n  return { S: text, A: text, B: text, C: text, ...rank };\\n}\\n\\nexport const OPS = [\\n  {\\n    id: 'op1',\\n\",\"total_lines\":573}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"4bc2de30-d68e-4f6f-8feb-3d66d59fd64d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_135","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"h1 is in hooks(11) likely for stage 1. h12 is separate.\n\nh12 is correctly ordered after h1. Sim tests will run next, with potential failures fixed afterward. Gel cells cover cleanly in one frame. Syringe dose of 18 plus vitals yields 98. Fragment grab range is 0.45 and seat starts at (-1.2, 1.4).\n\nPlace sets position before tools. Scalpel incision at (0,0) reaches length 0.7 within the step limit. Off-path checks for scalpel and forceps correctly trigger mistakes. Magnet pull may fail if creep is too slow or grab does not stick.\n\nSuture loop traces show the first slot ties at z=+0.48, then flips side to -1. The second slot at z=-0.48 matches the current side sign, so no flip occurs.\n\nSlot 1 ties at z=+0.48 after the side flip and wait. The 29-frame interval is within bounds. The 28-frame wait does not accidentally flip the side. After the first tie, the tool jumps to slot 1 on the negative side.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d3d05390-6cb1-4458-a674-7ba63d972136-85","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && node tests/run.mjs sim","description":"Run the shipped sim test suite"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":449,"output_tokens":1004,"cache_read_input_tokens":131328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"724bf641-d733-43e6-b888-cec2b9229a9c"}
