{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-676e6aed-25bd-461d-aa7d-5236620a3753-86","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"930→    if (e.done || e.kind !== 'dressing' || !e.path || !sameTable(e, seat, sim)) continue;\\n    const m = pathMetrics(e.path, seat.x, seat.z);\\n    if (m.dev < 0.5) e.pulled = Math.max(e.pulled, m.along);\\n    if (e.pulled >= (e.pull || m.length) - 0.08) finish(sim, seat, e, 'CLEAN');\\n  }\\n  void dt;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepSyringe(sim, seat, input, dt) {\\n  const using = !!input.use && seat.tool === 'syringe' && sim.unlocked.has('syringe');\\n940→  if (using) {\\n    seat.draw += dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (seat.draw >= sim.config.syringeDraw && sim.doses > 0) {\\n    const ring = sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done && sameTable(e, seat, sim)) || sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done);\\n    const inside = ring && dist(seat.x, seat.z, ring.x, ring.z) <= ring.r;\\n    sim.doses -= 1;\\n    if (inside) {\\n      const table = sim.tables[ring.table || sim.active];\\n950→      table.vitals = Math.min(99, table.vitals + sim.config.syringeDose);\\n      mirrorVitals(sim);\\n      if (sim.heart) sim.bpm = Math.max(48, sim.bpm - 12);\\n      rate(sim, seat, 'CLEAN', ring.x, ring.z);\\n      pushEvent(sim, { type: 'inject' });\\n    } else rate(sim, seat, 'SLOPPY', seat.x, seat.z);\\n  }\\n  seat.draw = 0;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"930→    if (e.done || e.kind !== 'dressing' || !e.path || !sameTable(e, seat, sim)) continue;\\n    const m = pathMetrics(e.path, seat.x, seat.z);\\n    if (m.dev < 0.5) e.pulled = Math.max(e.pulled, m.along);\\n    if (e.pulled >= (e.pull || m.length) - 0.08) finish(sim, seat, e, 'CLEAN');\\n  }\\n  void dt;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepSyringe(sim, seat, input, dt) {\\n  const using = !!input.use && seat.tool === 'syringe' && sim.unlocked.has('syringe');\\n940→  if (using) {\\n    seat.draw += dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (seat.draw >= sim.config.syringeDraw && sim.doses > 0) {\\n    const ring = sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done && sameTable(e, seat, sim)) || sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done);\\n    const inside = ring && dist(seat.x, seat.z, ring.x, ring.z) <= ring.r;\\n    sim.doses -= 1;\\n    if (inside) {\\n      const table = sim.tables[ring.table || sim.active];\\n950→      table.vitals = Math.min(99, table.vitals + sim.config.syringeDose);\\n      mirrorVitals(sim);\\n      if (sim.heart) sim.bpm = Math.max(48, sim.bpm - 12);\\n      rate(sim, seat, 'CLEAN', ring.x, ring.z);\\n      pushEvent(sim, { type: 'inject' });\\n    } else rate(sim, seat, 'SLOPPY', seat.x, seat.z);\\n  }\\n  seat.draw = 0;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":930,\"limit\":30,\"raw_output\":\"    if (e.done || e.kind !== 'dressing' || !e.path || !sameTable(e, seat, sim)) continue;\\n    const m = pathMetrics(e.path, seat.x, seat.z);\\n    if (m.dev < 0.5) e.pulled = Math.max(e.pulled, m.along);\\n    if (e.pulled >= (e.pull || m.length) - 0.08) finish(sim, seat, e, 'CLEAN');\\n  }\\n  void dt;\\n}\\n\\nfunction stepSyringe(sim, seat, input, dt) {\\n  const using = !!input.use && seat.tool === 'syringe' && sim.unlocked.has('syringe');\\n  if (using) {\\n    seat.draw += dt;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (seat.draw >= sim.config.syringeDraw && sim.doses > 0) {\\n    const ring = sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done && sameTable(e, seat, sim)) || sim.entities.find((e) => e.kind === 'ring' && !e.done);\\n    const inside = ring && dist(seat.x, seat.z, ring.x, ring.z) <= ring.r;\\n    sim.doses -= 1;\\n    if (inside) {\\n      const table = sim.tables[ring.table || sim.active];\\n      table.vitals = Math.min(99, table.vitals + sim.config.syringeDose);\\n      mirrorVitals(sim);\\n      if (sim.heart) sim.bpm = Math.max(48, sim.bpm - 12);\\n      rate(sim, seat, 'CLEAN', ring.x, ring.z);\\n      pushEvent(sim, { type: 'inject' });\\n    } else rate(sim, seat, 'SLOPPY', seat.x, seat.z);\\n  }\\n  seat.draw = 0;\\n}\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":1130}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"63f37e3b-87ac-4015-8bf3-9376616de36d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_137","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"stepSyringe is being called, but the seat is not responding.\n\nThe syringe tool is properly set on the seat. The issue is that stepSyringe returns early when `using` is true, which prevents applyTools from reaching the release logic.\n\nThe syringe falls through the tool chain correctly. The real issue may be that `seat.tool` never gets set to syringe, perhaps because `input.tool` is not applied in `moveSeats`. Another possibility is that the injection did not execute, leaving doses at 3 instead of 2.\n\nEvents are not drained. The gel and other tests passed, so the step function itself works. I will log which of the three required conditions fails for the syringe test. On release, moveSeats sets seat.tool to syringe again, and stepSyringe should fire because use is false and draw time meets the threshold.\n\nThe draw timing is correct. The input format and tool chain are also fine. Now I am checking whether the `mini()` function handles multiple spawns properly.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a0db2a85-a119-472f-a58e-69371edb4191-87","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":310,"limit":25}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":656,"output_tokens":911,"cache_read_input_tokens":132736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"d5c09f21-a3b1-4635-8031-0d9b8998c227"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-a0db2a85-a119-472f-a58e-69371edb4191-87","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"310→    if (seat.gift === 'quiet' && input.gift && sim.persist.quietUnlocked) want = true;\\n  }\\n  if (want && !sim.quietOn && sim.composure < 20) want = false;\\n  if (want && sim.phase === 'codeblue') want = false;\\n  sim.quietOn = want && sim.composure > 0 && sim.phase === 'play';\\n  if (sim.quietOn && !sim.god) {\\n    sim.composure = Math.max(0, sim.composure - sim.config.quietDrain * dt);\\n    if (sim.composure <= 0) sim.quietOn = false;\\n  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n320→}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n330→    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIELD.z, input.z));\\n    } else if (input.seek) {\",\"content_concise\":\"310→    if (seat.gift === 'quiet' && input.gift && sim.persist.quietUnlocked) want = true;\\n  }\\n  if (want && !sim.quietOn && sim.composure < 20) want = false;\\n  if (want && sim.phase === 'codeblue') want = false;\\n  sim.quietOn = want && sim.composure > 0 && sim.phase === 'play';\\n  if (sim.quietOn && !sim.god) {\\n    sim.composure = Math.max(0, sim.composure - sim.config.quietDrain * dt);\\n    if (sim.composure <= 0) sim.quietOn = false;\\n  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n320→}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n330→    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIELD.z, input.z));\\n    } else if (input.seek) {\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":310,\"limit\":25,\"raw_output\":\"    if (seat.gift === 'quiet' && input.gift && sim.persist.quietUnlocked) want = true;\\n  }\\n  if (want && !sim.quietOn && sim.composure < 20) want = false;\\n  if (want && sim.phase === 'codeblue') want = false;\\n  sim.quietOn = want && sim.composure > 0 && sim.phase === 'play';\\n  if (sim.quietOn && !sim.god) {\\n    sim.composure = Math.max(0, sim.composure - sim.config.quietDrain * dt);\\n    if (sim.composure <= 0) sim.quietOn = false;\\n  }\\n  return sim.quietOn;\\n}\\n\\nfunction moveSeats(sim, inputs, dt) {\\n  const tol = sim.config.toolTol;\\n  for (const seat of sim.seats) {\\n    const input = inputs[seat.id] || inputs[String(seat.id)] || {};\\n    if (input.tool && sim.unlocked.has(input.tool)) seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    else if (input.tool === 'dressing' || input.tool === 'syringe') seat.tool = input.tool;\\n    seat.use = !!input.use;\\n    seat.giftDown = !!input.gift;\\n    if (input.table != null && input.table !== sim.active) sim.active = input.table | 0;\\n    if (input.place) {\\n      seat.x = Math.max(-FIELD.x, Math.min(FIELD.x, input.x));\\n      seat.z = Math.max(-FIELD.z, Math.min(FIEL