{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_138","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tool is set. I will debug with a small script.\n\nThe stage logic is sound. The pool counts as a bleeder, so vitals drain. BaseDrain is zero in the mini default.\n\nThe pool bleeds 0.35 vitals per second. Over 31 frames that drains roughly 0.18, so the final vitals are about 97.82 instead of exactly 98. The test's strict equality check is the bug, not the simulation. A hook or incision would avoid bleeding and keep vitals exact.\n\nThe outside test has the same vitals-drain bug. I will switch the keeper to a hook so it does not bleed, and make the vitals assertion approximate. The outside position z=3 is within the field bounds.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f0b34126-9988-4f7d-b0e9-1f80ba594e9c-88","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/run.mjs","old_string":"  const ringKeep = [\n    { id: 'ring', kind: 'ring', x: 0, z: 0, optional: true },\n    { id: 'keep2', kind: 'pool', x: 3.5, z: 0, r: 0.4 },\n  ];\n  sim = createOp(mini(ringKeep));\n  const v0 = sim.tables[0].vitals;\n  run(sim, { place: true, x: 0, z: 0, tool: 'syringe', use: true }, 30);\n  step(sim, { 0: { place: true, x: 0, z: 0, tool: 'syringe', use: false } }, DT);\n  check('syringe inside', sim.doses === 2 && sim.tables[0].vitals === v0 + getConfig().syringeDose && rated(sim, 'CLEAN'));\n\n  sim = createOp(mini(ringKeep));\n  const v1 = sim.tables[0].vitals;\n  run(sim, { place: true, x: 3.2, z: 3, tool: 'syringe', use: true }, 30);\n  step(sim, { 0: { place: true, x: 3.2, z: 3, tool: 'syringe', use: false } }, DT);\n  check('syringe outside', sim.doses === 2 && sim.tables[0].vitals === v1 && rated(sim, 'SLOPPY'));","new_string":"  const ringKeep = [\n    { id: 'ring', kind: 'ring', x: 0, z: 0, optional: true },\n    { id: 'keep2', kind: 'hook', x: 4, z: 0, pull: 1.2, dx: 0, dz: 1 },\n  ];\n  sim = createOp(mini(ringKeep));\n  const v0 = sim.tables[0].vitals;\n  run(sim, { place: true, x: 0, z: 0, tool: 'syringe', use: true }, 30);\n  step(sim, { 0: { place: true, x: 0, z: 0, tool: 'syringe', use: false } }, DT);\n  check('syringe inside', sim.doses === 2 && approx(sim.tables[0].vitals, v0 + getConfig().syringeDose, 0.02) && rated(sim, 'CLEAN'));\n\n  sim = createOp(mini(ringKeep));\n  const v1 = sim.tables[0].vitals;\n  run(sim, { place: true, x: 3.2, z: 3, tool: 'syringe', use: true }, 30);\n  step(sim, { 0: { place: true, x: 3.2, z: 3, tool: 'syringe', use: false } }, DT);\n  check('syringe outside', sim.doses === 2 && approx(sim.tables[0].vitals, v1, 0.02) && rated(sim, 'SLOPPY'));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1314,"output_tokens":1331,"cache_read_input_tokens":133376,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"4b9c1b54-d844-4e24-93ca-c874f1bcd43a"}
