{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_205","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The gear icon is in the file. The button likely uses text content.\n\nI'll verify the settings button by checking its text content or aria-label. Then I'll fix songs and write multiple files. The clinic.js results will use big clear HUD text, visible tissue and bust images, and a rank stamp. I'll also display follow and reyes lines on the results.\n\nResults will show TIME, VITALS, SCORE, and MISTAKES before the rank stamp. The reyes and follow lines will appear below. Text stays within the font charset. Campaign imports are safe because playCampaign is a function. Audio test warnings are acceptable since only failures and counts print.\n\nI'll change into the dev folder before running tests. parseSong errors will be caught. I'll verify fanfare step counts by running node after writing the fix. Now I'm writing the songs fix and all source files.\n\nopenSession now returns a shared state object. Clinic will write to state.silence and state.local each frame. clinic.sim will point to that same state object.\n\nThe start callback assigns the simulation to `state.sim`, which the clinic reads each frame. This prevents a race condition where the start event fires before the clinic exists. Both client and host generate the simulation with the same seed inside `openSession`.\n\nThe host is the server when present, otherwise player 0. The `inputsFor` function merges local inputs into the network state for the host's own seat to reduce latency.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f17fcce2-83a3-492b-8df0-d1f3600e728b-85","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"emit\\('message'|type === 'message'|data:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/vendor/session.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":704,"output_tokens":1104,"cache_read_input_tokens":148992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"352698b4-b28b-4994-8e79-9a6f0249166e"}
