{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_237","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Poke dispatches keydown on the body or active element.\n\nKeyboard events bubble from body to window, so the engine and Clinic.onKey listeners both receive Enter. Both should fire AIHub.answer('ready').\n\nClinic.readCard also checks wasPressed('Enter'). The window listener answers immediately, so the engine's beginFrame does not need to consume the key. Arrow keys during play move the cursor via seat inputs without finishing the operation. Client sends use state.me, which is set on the start event.\n\nopenSession runs after connect resolves, so state.me is already set when the client first sends. Both clients and the host send messages during the card phase, and the harness counts this traffic as part of the cumulative stats. The server copy also sends pings.\n\nThe server scenario includes a play period where the host steps the simulation and sends snapshots. Clients receive these during play. After the host leaves, remaining clients should already have both sent inputs and received host snapshots, so the test must not finish.\n\nfinishRound exits early for non-hosts, so clients cannot finish the round. The hub voids the round on host leave before any client can call finish, preventing a protocol problem.\n\nThe harness only calls timeUp when state.record is missing. After host-leave, the record is void, so timeUp is skipped. Remaining copies receive an 'end' event and set ended. The timing of time-up versus end is uncertain. If time-up fires before end on a promoted host, that copy could finish and spoil the void.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-a1ff6e90-b8fc-421c-bc5f-0cab755e80db-52","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"host-left|hostLeft|leave\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/vendor","glob":"*.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":963,"output_tokens":1015,"cache_read_input_tokens":108800,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"40a928bc-9ee4-4fba-b4e4-a81d754828e5"}
