{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_245","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"MeshToonNodeMaterial needs a clone() method.\n\nFingerprint stability depends on hashSim only when a simulation exists. Title mode without simulation is stable. The default `*90` key input likely means 90 idle frames rather than pressing every key. This prevents attract mode from starting and keeps the fingerprint deterministic.\n\nlocalStorage is guarded against Node errors. The story line uses three periods, which the charset includes. I will add a test to enforce 57-character limits on story lines and scene lines between 8 and 16.\n\nFont highlighting like `*word*` is allowed in the story. About page lines may exceed 57 characters because the HUD slices them for display, but the content test only checks that every field is present.\n\nWriting game.js, docs/AUTHORING.md, tools/build.mjs, and a browser test module imported by tests/run.mjs. Also fixing clinic.ready retry logic for AIHub, adding a host-left guard, and correcting sampleAll memory to use pad.index instead of array index.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-80d340e4-5255-4ebb-a88d-de7371ef95a3-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"playMusic\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/types/engine/audio/AudioManager.d.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-80d340e4-5255-4ebb-a88d-de7371ef95a3-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"sprite\\(","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/types/engine/hud/Hud.d.ts"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-80d340e4-5255-4ebb-a88d-de7371ef95a3-65","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"setLookLayer","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__2026