The net missed the rest of him.'),\"},{\"line_number\":36,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({ S: 'I would let you near my own arm.', C: 'He still has an arm. Barely a compliment.' }, 'Count slower next time.'),\"},{\"line_number\":88,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'The coin turned up in the laundry.'),\"},{\"line_number\":89,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'That one was not a prop.'),\"},{\"line_number\":152,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'All three made the morning paper. Alive.'),\"},{\"line_number\":153,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'You went quiet. I noticed.'),\"},{\"line_number\":206,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if the scar could look like a lightning bolt.'),\"},{\"line_number\":207,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'Adequate. Sabine said it first.'),\"},{\"line_number\":256,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'He asked if it could knock on the way out.'),\"},{\"line_number\":257,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'Get it out.'),\"},{\"line_number\":303,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'The new kidney took. The sample did not stay dormant.'),\"},{\"line_number\":304,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'Again. Then it pinks.'),\"},{\"line_number\":364,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'She thanked them for the pain.'),\"},{\"line_number\":365,\"content\":\"    reyes: follow({}, 'I will be in the hall.'),\"},{\"line_number\":396,\"content\":\"    follow: follow({}, 'He gave Ilya the old scalpel.'),\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"38015467-c35e-40fe-b90b-e941748db7cd"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_251","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will now write all the required files.\n\nI'll update clinic.ready to retry readiness and add a session leave guard. Tests will become async with audio and content checks, and browser/hub imports will be dynamic to avoid loading Playwright in the default suite. A content test campaign is required. Story lines must fit a strict character set, stay under 57 characters, and contain 8–16 lines per scene.\n\nI will count story lines after writing and fix any scenes that exceed the limits. I will also scan game.js in the content walk and ban placeholder comments.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-65f0236e-443e-404a-8cea-d26763fa2534-74","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Copy Op|AUTHORING|add an operation","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1571,"output_tokens":501,"cache_read_input_tokens":124288,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"20b5cbf0-c4cf-446b-a408-fe6ff00d32b7"}
