{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_252","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A Copy Op JSON action should be added to the console.\n\nThe 'copy' action will be added to the clinic dev actions list. In pickDev, selecting it will stringify and log the op definition, then store it in this.copied.\n\nThe copy action will also be added to the HUD menu. The next steps are updating clinic.ready, the ACTIONS array, and session leave handling. Then game.js, authoring, build, and patch tests will be written.\n\nCampaign tests will run inside testContent. New imports include playCampaign, SCENES, about fields, buildStandings, parseSong, and voice. The buildStandings test will verify two players with a higher score first and ties grouped.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ad3bcf3b-1d84-42e2-8255-513427b3f5b3-75","name":"list_dir","input":{"target_directory":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/packs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":768,"output_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":125824,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"5575ccc6-8fa4-40d0-adb8-1910d4784891"}
