, syringe) with the tissue view, hand, and HUD; test those tools.\"},{\"line_number\":45,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add scalpel, laser, scanner, operations 2 and 3, Code Blue, The Quiet, and the bot; assert idle-fail and skill-0.7 clear.\"},{\"line_number\":46,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add story scenes, gibberish voices, music, results, and saves so episodes 1–3 play through.\"},{\"line_number\":47,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add title, menus, last-device prompts, settings, pause, Dev Mode sliders, attract mode, the touch gate, and About pages.\"},{\"line_number\":48,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add the remaining operations, The Second Look, all strains, and the campaign playthrough test.\"},{\"line_number\":49,\"content\":\"- [ ] Add couch Consult, then the hub session, card, and net code; run all five harness scenarios.\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"- [ ] Tune to the balance table, write the authoring note, fill About and `exit-interview.json`, emit the root HTML, and save a green `node tests/run.mjs` log plus the two launch captures under `{SCRATCH}`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"2d1715ab-50a0-4bb5-9d3a-a2e5b0f8fd00"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_256","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Tasks 1 through 3 are already verified. Task 4 needs a story playthrough. Task 5 needs browser tests. Task 6 needs campaign tests. Task 7 needs hub work. Task 8 needs everything. I will fix HUD colors and clinic next. Then I will write files. The test runner must become async. The process.exit call should move into main(). Campaign is synchronous and blocks. That is acceptable. I will check story line length during the first test. I will look at the continueShift bug later if tests do not cover it.\n\nI checked the pad indexing logic. The engine maps pads by list order rather than by their native index, so a null entry in getGamepads does not shift the memory slot. I also need to verify whether the engine synthesizes key events when gamepadButtons is empty but a button is actually pressed.\n\nThe gamepad button map is cleared before the engine reads it, so no default keyboard mapping occurs. I am now planning the browser tests: mouse hover will use page.mouse.move, menu focus will be checked by pressing Enter and arrowing down to index 1, and clicking row 3 requires calculating art y 152 from rowTop(3). I still need to figure out how the engine maps CSS coordinates to NDC.\n\nI derived the CSS-to-art coordinate mapping. To hit artY 152, the test must move the mouse to cssY = 152 / artH * cssH. I also realized the settings prompt will show ENTER instead of A because the hover leaves the last device as mouse, and the Xbox glyph swap is handled separately.\n\nI will test the prompt glyph swap by setting the Xbox option in settings, then pressing a pad button to confirm the prompt shows A. Pressing a key afterward should restore ENTER, and moving the mouse should also show ENTER.\n\nI am designing the attract mode tests. A fresh page will wait eleven seconds to enter attract mode, then verify that localStorage soc:save remains null after a key press returns to title. A pad button press on a second load will do the same. I will also test a Pixel 7 touch context and check whether matchMedia fine pointer detection works there.\n\nI need to export PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 before running Playwright, since the tool may not source bashrc. I am also designing a dev mode test: load the game with ?op=op1&hold=1&bot=0, pause with Escape, navigate to the Dev tab via ArrowDown and Enter, change vitalsDrainMul to 1.1 with ArrowRight, verify the config value, then reset with End and Enter.\n\nI confirmed the config is a live singleton that applySlider mutates directly. I am designing the two-pad test: load with seats=2 and bot=0, set pad0 axes[0] to 1 and pad1 axes[0] to -1, wait 500ms, and compare seat x positions. Both players will be human because consult is true and forceBot is false. With deadzone 0.28 and default cursorSpeed 10, the cursors should separate within half a second.\n\nI confirmed that padInputs takes precedence over keyboard input for human seats, so each seat binds to its assigned pad. I will test the drain-by-mouse feature by using __GAME__.act to change the aimed tool and verify the entity update, rather than moving the mouse to the pool position.\n\nI realized the drain-by-mouse test must not use hold, because fixedUpdate skips stepping and the place input never applies. I will let the simulation run normally, move the pointer to aim at the pool, and click so the ray changes the aimed entity. If the ray misses, I will adjust the aim.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4316380b-450d-4e1e-b05c-2b9807f4e22b-80","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":1,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2682,"output_tokens":2321,"cache_read_input_tokens":130944,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"7ac11d27-8810-46a3-9424-5ea4a23c06c7"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4316380b-450d-4e1e-b05c-2b9807f4e22b-80","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { DIFFICULTY, getConfig } from '../core/config.js';\\nimport { makeRng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { angDiff, coverage, dist, makeEntity, pathMetrics, toolFor, woundFrame } from './geom.js';\\nimport { applyRank, ratePoints } from './score.js';\\nimport { noteEyeLaser, notePlate, noteSob, startStrain, tickStrains } from './strains.js';\\n\\nconst FIELD = { x: 8, z: 4.5 };\\n\\nexport function createOp(def, opts = {}) {\\n10→  const config = opts.config || getConfig();\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty || 'resident';\\n  const diff = DIFFICULTY[difficulty] || DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  const rng = makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n  const human = Math.max(1, opts.seats || 1);\\n  const consult = !!opts.consult;\\n  const partner = !!def.partner && !consult;\\n  const seatCount = partner ? Math.max(2, human) : human;\\n  const seats = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seatCount; i++) {\\n20→    const gift = giftOf(def, i, consult);\\n    seats.push({\\n      id: i,\\n      x: -1.2 + i * 0.8,\\n      z: 1.4,\\n      tool: (def.tools && def.tools[0]) || 'forceps',\\n      use: false,\\n      score: 0,\\n      holding: -1,\\n      draw: 0,\\n30→      dry: 0,\\n      bruised: false,\\n      gift,\\n      human: consult ? true : i === 0,\\n      pref: def.partner ? (i === 0 ? 'R' : 'L') : '',\\n      stitches: 0,\\n      cleans: 0,\\n      sloppies: 0,\\n      botSkill: i === 0 ? 1 : 0.85,\\n    });\\n40→  }\\n  const starts = Array.isArray(def.vitals?.start) ? def.vitals.start : [def.vitals?.start ?? 80];\\n  const tables = starts.map((v, i) => ({ id: i, vitals: v }));\\n  const coop = 1 + config.coopScale * Math.max(0, (consult ? human : 1) - 1);\\n  const sim = {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    arena: def.arena || 'forearm',\\n    def,\\n    config,\\n50→    difficulty,\\n    diff,\\n    rng,\\n    seed: opts.seed ?? 1,\\n    seats,\\n    tables,\\n    active: 0,\\n    vitals: tables[0].vitals,\\n    baseDrain: (def.vitals?.drain ?? 0.1) * diff.drain * coop,\\n    timeLeft: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n60→    timeMax: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n    doses: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    doseMax: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    mistakes: 0,\\n    score: 0,\\n    streak: 0,\\n    composure: 40,\\n    entities: [],\\n    stages: (def.stages || []).map((s) => ({ ...s, spawned: [], entered: false })),\\n    stageIndex: 0,\\n70→    flags: {},\\n    persist: {\\n      quietUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('quiet') || consult,\\n      lookUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('look') || consult,\\n      lookUses: 0,\\n      rewound: false,\\n      needRewind: false,\\n      rankCap: opts.cap || null,\\n      unscriptedBlue: false,\\n      bluesLeft: diff.blues,\\n80→      clotSeen: false,\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { DIFFICULTY, getConfig } from '../core/config.js';\\nimport { makeRng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { angDiff, coverage, dist, makeEntity, pathMetrics, toolFor, woundFrame } from './geom.js';\\nimport { applyRank, ratePoints } from './score.js';\\nimport { noteEyeLaser, notePlate, noteSob, startStrain, tickStrains } from './strains.js';\\n\\nconst FIELD = { x: 8, z: 4.5 };\\n\\nexport function createOp(def, opts = {}) {\\n10→  const config = opts.config || getConfig();\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty || 'resident';\\n  const diff = DIFFICULTY[difficulty] || DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  const rng = makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n  const human = Math.max(1, opts.seats || 1);\\n  const consult = !!opts.consult;\\n  const partner = !!def.partner && !consult;\\n  const seatCount = partner ? Math.max(2, human) : human;\\n  const seats = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seatCount; i++) {\\n20→    const gift = giftOf(def, i, consult);\\n    seats.push({\\n      id: i,\\n      x: -1.2 + i * 0.8,\\n      z: 1.4,\\n      tool: (def.tools && def.tools[0]) || 'forceps',\\n      use: false,\\n      score: 0,\\n      holding: -1,\\n      draw: 0,\\n30→      dry: 0,\\n      bruised: false,\\n      gift,\\n      human: consult ? true : i === 0,\\n      pref: def.partner ? (i === 0 ? 'R' : 'L') : '',\\n      stitches: 0,\\n      cleans: 0,\\n      sloppies: 0,\\n      botSkill: i === 0 ? 1 : 0.85,\\n    });\\n40→  }\\n  const starts = Array.isArray(def.vitals?.start) ? def.vitals.start : [def.vitals?.start ?? 80];\\n  const tables = starts.map((v, i) => ({ id: i, vitals: v }));\\n  const coop = 1 + config.coopScale * Math.max(0, (consult ? human : 1) - 1);\\n  const sim = {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    arena: def.arena || 'forearm',\\n    def,\\n    config,\\n50→    difficulty,\\n    diff,\\n    rng,\\n    seed: opts.seed ?? 1,\\n    seats,\\n    tables,\\n    active: 0,\\n    vitals: tables[0].vitals,\\n    baseDrain: (def.vitals?.drain ?? 0.1) * diff.drain * coop,\\n    timeLeft: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n60→    timeMax: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n    doses: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    doseMax: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    mistakes: 0,\\n    score: 0,\\n    streak: 0,\\n    composure: 40,\\n    entities: [],\\n    stages: (def.stages || []).map((s) => ({ ...s, spawned: [], entered: false })),\\n    stageIndex: 0,\\n70→    flags: {},\\n    persist: {\\n      quietUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('quiet') || consult,\\n      lookUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('look') || consult,\\n      lookUses: 0,\\n      rewound: false,\\n      needRewind: false,\\n      rankCap: opts.cap || null,\\n      unscriptedBlue: false,\\n      bluesLeft: diff.blues,\\n80→      clotSeen: false,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":80,\"raw_output\":\"import { DIFFICULTY, getConfig } from '../core/config.js';\\nimport { makeRng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { angDiff, coverage, dist, makeEntity, pathMetrics, toolFor, woundFrame } from './geom.js';\\nimport { applyRank, ratePoints } from './score.js';\\nimport { noteEyeLaser, notePlate, noteSob, startStrain, tickStrains } from './strains.js';\\n\\nconst FIELD = { x: 8, z: 4.5 };\\n\\nexport function createOp(def, opts = {}) {\\n  const config = opts.config || getConfig();\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty || 'resident';\\n  const diff = DIFFICULTY[difficulty] || DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  const rng = makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n  const human = Math.max(1, opts.seats || 1);\\n  const consult = !!opts.consult;\\n  const partner = !!def.partner && !consult;\\n  const seatCount = partner ? Math.max(2, human) : human;\\n  const seats = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seatCount; i++) {\\n    const gift = giftOf(def, i, consult);\\n    seats.push({\\n      id: i,\\n      x: -1.2 + i * 0.8,\\n      z: 1.4,\\n      tool: (def.tools && def.tools[0]) || 'forceps',\\n      use: false,\\n      score: 0,\\n      holding: -1,\\n      draw: 0,\\n      dry: 0,\\n      bruised: false,\\n      gift,\\n      human: consult ? true : i === 0,\\n      pref: def.partner ? (i === 0 ? 'R' : 'L') : '',\\n      stitches: 0,\\n      cleans: 0,\\n      sloppies: 0,\\n      botSkill: i === 0 ? 1 : 0.85,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  const starts = Array.isArray(def.vitals?.start) ? def.vitals.start : [def.vitals?.start ?? 80];\\n  const tables = starts.map((v, i) => ({ id: i, vitals: v }));\\n  const coop = 1 + config.coopScale * Math.max(0, (consult ? human : 1) - 1);\\n  const sim = {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    arena: def.arena || 'forearm',\\n    def,\\n    config,\\n    difficulty,\\n    diff,\\n    rng,\\n    seed: opts.seed ?? 1,\\n    seats,\\n    tables,\\n    active: 0,\\n    vitals: tables[0].vitals,\\n    baseDrain: (def.vitals?.drain ?? 0.1) * diff.drain * coop,\\n    timeLeft: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n    timeMax: (def.time ?? 180) * diff.time * config.timeLimitMul,\\n    doses: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    doseMax: def.doses ?? 3,\\n    mistakes: 0,\\n    score: 0,\\n    streak: 0,\\n    composure: 40,\\n    entities: [],\\n    stages: (def.stages || []).map((s) => ({ ...s, spawned: [], entered: false })),\\n    stageIndex: 0,\\n    flags: {},\\n    persist: {\\n      quietUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('quiet') || consult,\\n      lookUnlocked: !!(def.gifts || []).includes('look') || consult,\\n      lookUses: 0,\\n      rewound: false,\\n      needRewind: false,\\n      rankCap: opts.cap || null,\\n      unscriptedBlue: false,\\n      bluesLeft: diff.blues,\\n      clotSeen: false,\\n\",\"total_lines\":1130}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"1ca554cb-a418-4f78-bc62-0c8bb7078a1b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_257","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pad test starts at coordinates (-1.2, 1).\n\nThe pool is at (-3.1, -1.1). Direct stick input risks overshooting the 0.7 drain radius. The test will instead poll seat position frame by frame, stop when close, and press R2.\n\nThe pad axes will be driven directly via `window.__pads[0]`. The test waits for the seat to come within 0.5 units of the drain. Then it presses R2 and selects the drain tool by flicking the right stick.\n\nThe seat already defaults to the drain tool, so no tool switch is needed for the first action. To select forceps, the right stick must be flicked at a 45-degree angle.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-62a29469-211d-4a9f-8be8-a1e87f31f1ba-81","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"counts","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/types/engine/audio/AudioManager.d.ts"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3325,"output_tokens":840,"cache_read_input_tokens":133504,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"48e98b21-7894-435a-a95a-d0b386974765"}
