}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/core/save.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"const KEY = 'soc:save:v1';\\nconst mem = { json: null };\\n\\nexport function emptySave() {\\n  return {\\n    version: 1,\\n    difficulty: 'resident',\\n    scenes: [],\\n    ops: {},\\n    log: false,\\n    credits: false,\\n    quiet: false,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function writeSave(save) {\\n  const json = JSON.stringify(save);\\n  mem.json = json;\\n  try {\\n    globalThis.localStorage?.setItem(KEY, json);\\n  } catch {\\n    /* private mode */\\n  }\\n  return save;\\n}\\n\\nexport function readSave() {\\n  try {\\n    const s = globalThis.localStorage?.getItem(KEY);\\n    if (s) return JSON.parse(s);\\n  } catch {\\n    /* fall through */\\n  }\\n  return mem.json ? JSON.parse(mem.json) : null;\\n}\\n\\nexport function clearSave() {\\n  mem.json = null;\\n  try {\\n    globalThis.localStorage?.removeItem(KEY);\\n  } catch {\\n    /* ignore */\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":44}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"6f6079e2-77f4-446d-a0d2-bd3e87510cc7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_259","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"playCampaign works in Node.\n\nStory scene lengths will be verified by tests. Story operations need patient and other fields to avoid empty briefs. Scene line counts will be checked during the first test run. The dev mode slider list is long but End focuses the last item. ArrowRight on the first slider works correctly. In dev mode, ArrowRight also triggers nudge.\n\nArrowRight is also used as a stick in buildSeatInputs, but hold prevents stepping. Escape pauses the operation mode. The test will start in op mode and pause via Escape rather than using ?dev=1. forceBot is false so the operation has a human seat. Hold stops vitals from draining during the menu.\n\nEscape key presses from Playwright will reach the engine window. The browser test module will be dynamically imported to avoid loading Playwright in default tests. It exports async functions that report failures through a shared check callback.\n\nEvidence files will be written inside the test functions. The suite prints only failures and a count, so tests.txt captures stdout directly. For the browser test, the log will be written to browser.txt by the test itself, and the command output will also be copied to satisfy the plan.\n\nThe Python server will be started and stopped inside the hub test itself. Playwright browsers run as child processes. The five hub scenarios will take five to eight minutes, so the command will use a high block_until.\n\nA quick Node script will parse songs before the full suite to fix step counts. game.js and test audio imports are next. The index.html title will be updated. HUD colors change to lime and red. Results mode transitions, ready retry, and host leave flags are being added. playMusic bad-song headless behavior will be validated first.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Songs and the boot path are the gap. I’ll validate the music, replace the Coin Garden starter, and wire the content tests before any browser run."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f239f184-5cfe-4c32-a8dd-698344dfdbd9-83","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/ui/hud.js","old_string":"    const bar = 2 + Math.abs(beat) * 4 + spike;\n    hud.rect(w / 2 - n * 4 + i * 8, y - bar, 3, bar, 'mint');","new_string":"    const bar = 2 + Math.abs(beat) * 4 + spike;\n    hud.rect(w / 2 - n * 4 + i * 8, y - bar, 3, bar, 'lime');"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f239f184-5cfe-4c32-a8dd-698344dfdbd9-84","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/ui/hud.js","old_string":"  hud.text(8, 4, `VITALS ${shown}`, { scale: 2, color: shown < 30 ? 'rose' : 'white' });","new_string":"  hud.text(8, 4, `VITALS ${shown}`, { scale: 2, color: shown < 30 ? 'red' : 'white' });"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f239f184-5cfe-4c32-a8dd-698344dfdbd9-85","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","old_string":"  ['blue', 'Code blue'],\n  ['spawn', 'Spawn pool'],\n];","new_string":"  ['blue', 'Code blue'],\n  ['spawn', 'Spawn pool'],\n  ['copy', 'Copy op JSON'],\n];"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f239f184-5cfe-4c32-a8dd-698344dfdbd9-86","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","old_string":"    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__