{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_286","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug was found in the `waitForFunction` call for `window.__GAME__`.\n\nThe `waitForFunction` call passes the timeout as its third argument, so the predicate function never receives the loop index. The comparison `window.__GAME__.app.focus === n` therefore always fails because `n` is undefined.\n\nThe fix is to pass the expected focus value as the third argument to `waitForFunction`, since Playwright runs the predicate in the browser and cannot access Node.js closures. The `poke` function signature must be updated to accept this argument.\n\nThe `poke` function now accepts an `arg` parameter. It passes this value as the third argument to `waitForFunction`, which is required because Playwright runs the predicate in the browser and cannot access Node.js closures. The `Enter` call checks for menu mode, while the `ArrowDown` call checks for focus level 1.\n\nThe `ArrowRight` call checks for the 'xbox' glyph setting. When a predicate does not need an argument, `undefined` should be passed as the third argument to `waitForFunction`. The current code incorrectly passes the timeout object as that argument.\n\nThe timeout object is being passed as the predicate argument, so the default 30-second timeout applies instead of the intended 800 milliseconds. Mode checks likely still pass because their predicates ignore arguments, but focus checks remain broken.\n\nThe prior test finished in 75 seconds, so the broken focus check likely had not been reached yet. I will fix the `poke` function before running the new code.\n\nThe `poke` function now hardcodes a 700 ms timeout and passes the expected value as the third argument to `waitForFunction`. The call sites are being updated to match this new signature.\n\nThe `ArrowDown` call is broken because its predicate expects a parameter that Playwright never supplies. The `Enter` call works because it uses a literal value in the source, which Playwright serializes directly.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f353520c-21a9-4ab8-a5d9-866184c69c12-137","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs","old_string":"async function poke(page, key, ready, timeout = 800) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n    await page.keyboard.press(key);\n    if (!ready) {\n      await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n      return true;\n    }\n    try {\n      await page.waitForFunction(ready, { timeout });\n      return true;\n    } catch {\n      /* the frame may have missed a short press */\n    }\n  }\n  return false;\n}","new_string":"async function poke(page, key, ready, arg) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n    await page.keyboard.press(key);\n    if (!ready) {\n      await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n      return true;\n    }\n    try {\n      await page.waitForFunction(ready, arg, { timeout: 700 });\n      return true;\n    } catch {\n      /* the frame may have missed a short press */\n    }\n  }\n  return false;\n}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f353520c-21a9-4ab8-a5d9-866184c69c12-138","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs","old_string":"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(devPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n, 800);","new_string":"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(devPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n, i);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-f353520c-21a9-4ab8-a5d9-866184c69c12-139","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs","old_string":"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n);\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'dev');\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.devTab === n);","new_string":"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n, i);\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'dev');\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.devTab === n, i);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1252,"output_tokens":2130,"cache_read_input_tokens":189952,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"48ba9c54-b201-4c9d-9cdd-1b673ff8dee2"}
