\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n);\\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'dev');\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.devTab === n);\",\"old_line\":303,\"new_string\":\"    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n, i);\\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'dev');\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 3; i++) await poke(shotPage.page, 'e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.devTab === n, i);\",\"new_line\":303,\"context_before\":\"    await shotPage.page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    await shotPage.page.screenshot({ path: join(SCRATCH, 'hud.png') });\\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Escape', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'pause');\\n\",\"context_after\":\"    await poke(shotPage.page, 'ArrowDown', () => window.__GAME__.app.focus === 1);\\n    await poke(shotPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'results');\\n    await shotPage.page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"6a9b4f92-d09c-4a8c-9d41-ef10dea2248e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_287","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"ArrowDown on the menu might be processed twice. The bump logic uses wasPressed.\n\nRetry logic risks overshooting the target. Five presses before focus updates could push the value past the intended position, causing the wait to never match.\n\nPress once and wait for focus to advance by exactly one. Retries are cut to two with a 1000ms timeout. The End key will be poked until focus reaches the last row.\n\nArrowRight on the slider retries could compound the value if the wait fails. Glyphs ArrowRight risks toggling back to ps. holdOff waits 300ms after pressing the attract button. clinic.js changed so a rebuild is needed.\n\nThe browser test loads the compiled HTML, so a rebuild is required before running it. If the device fails to become mouse, the pointer state will be logged to diagnose the issue. The title Enter and Space key presses are confirmed safe because Playwright releases keys after pressing. The full run should take roughly two to three minutes.\n\nThe End predicate correctly references `Clinic.devRows` inside the page context. The 'e' key is included in the global keys list, so pressing it sets the device to key input in dev mode. The tab logic checks for KeyE or pad presses before advancing the dev tab.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-ce3b2951-530f-4e14-8d2b-ae44fc05f02b-140","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && node tools/build.mjs && PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 node tests/run.mjs browser","description":"Rebuild and rerun the browser checks","block_until_ms":0}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2495,"output_tokens":1047,"cache_read_input_tokens":191104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b5749f0c-7491-4f18-ae6f-a40a3eb6d5b2"}
