roller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"stick\\\":false,\\\"buttons\\\":[\\\"✕\\\",\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"Done\\\",\\\"⚙\\\"]} mode attract\\nresults mode results\\npage errors \\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/browser.txt\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"alone {\\\"active\\\":false,\\\"seeded\\\":false,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\"}\\nafter keys {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"call\\\",\\\"focus\\\":0,\\\"canvas\\\":true}\\nhover {\\\"focus\\\":1,\\\"device\\\":\\\"key\\\",\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"ENTER\\\",\\\"pointer\\\":{\\\"x\\\":-0.19999999999999996,\\\"y\\\":0.06666666666666665,\\\"over\\\":true,\\\"touch\\\":false}} point 384,252\\nxbox {\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"CROSS\\\",\\\"device\\\":\\\"pad\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"ps\\\"}\\nattract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"attract\\\",\\\"save\\\":null,\\\"settings\\\":null}\\npad attract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"save\\\":null}\\nslider 1.1 reset 1\\nseats -1.2,-0.6121271354118106 -> 2.7999999999999994,-4.61212713541181\\nmouse drain 0.7 -> {\\\"r\\\":0.18666666666666698,\\\"done\\\":true}\\ntouch {\\\"text\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"stick\\\":false,\\\"buttons\\\":[\\\"✕\\\",\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"Done\\\",\\\"⚙\\\"]} mode attract\\nresults mode results\\npage errors \\n\",\"total_lines\":12}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"775a5e00-44bc-43bc-92fd-c5335f6cbb8f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_290","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The pointer is over the element. Y is zero.\n\nThe pointer coordinates match the calculated position. Hover did not change focus or device because mouseDelta was zero, so the device remained key.\n\nThe root cause is now clear. Playwright mouse moves often set the pointer position absolutely with zero movementX. The engine records this as a delta of zero. Because the delta never exceeds 0.4, the code never switches the device from key to mouse.\n\nA fix is proposed: track pointer position changes to detect mouse activity even when movementX is zero. Hover is also gated behind the same mouseDelta threshold, so it never runs on a zero-delta move.\n\nHover should run whenever the pointer is over the element, not only when mouseDelta exceeds 0.4.\n\nIdle reset should count pointer movement as activity, so a zero-delta Playwright move no longer keeps the session idle.\n\nThe fix uses a combined `pointed` flag for device switching, idle reset, and hover. Hover will run every frame while the pointer is over an element. This keeps focus on the hovered row even after keyboard navigation. The xbox test already presses ArrowDown after hover to reach the next focus.\n\nHover should only run when the pointer actually moves, not every frame it is over. Otherwise keyboard navigation would be interrupted by hover resetting focus back to the hovered row. The last pointer coordinates will initialize to null so the first frame does not register as a movement.\n\nThe xbox test failed because hover never advanced focus to row 2. The test then pressed ArrowDown from focus 1, which should reach row 2 but not row 3. The glyphs never updated and the pad device was set with ps glyphs.\n\nThe fix sequence is now clear: hover advances focus to row 2, ArrowDown reaches row 3, Enter opens settings, ArrowRight selects the xbox pad, and the pad device maps A. The pointer must move away from row 3 afterward so the next ArrowDown does not re-trigger hover. Rebuilding and rerunning the browser test is next; the attract and screenshot phases will take most of the two minutes.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b207611-8859-4b9b-b7d8-de67e589ffd2-143","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","old_string":"    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\n    else if (click || right || moved) this.device = 'mouse';","new_string":"    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\n    if (px != null) {\n      this.lastPx = px;\n      this.lastPy = py;\n    }\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b207611-8859-4b9b-b7d8-de67e589ffd2-144","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","old_string":"    if (button || moved) this.idleAt = now();","new_string":"    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7b207611-8859-4b9b-b7d8-de67e589ffd2-145","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/