{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fa42b271-cb38-4295-84a7-635ac8fe4369-149","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→alone {\\\"active\\\":false,\\\"seeded\\\":false,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\"}\\nafter keys {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"call\\\",\\\"focus\\\":0,\\\"canvas\\\":true}\\nhover {\\\"focus\\\":2,\\\"device\\\":\\\"mouse\\\",\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"ENTER\\\"} point 384,252\\nxbox {\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"CROSS\\\",\\\"device\\\":\\\"pad\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"ps\\\"}\\nattract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"attract\\\",\\\"save\\\":null,\\\"settings\\\":null}\\npad attract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"save\\\":null}\\nslider 1.1 reset 1\\nseats -1.2,-0.6121271354118106 -> 0.46666666666666656,-2.2787938020784773\\nmouse drain 0.7 -> {\\\"r\\\":0.18666666666666698,\\\"done\\\":true}\\n10→touch {\\\"text\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"stick\\\":false,\\\"buttons\\\":[\\\"✕\\\",\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"Done\\\",\\\"⚙\\\"]} mode attract\\nresults mode results\\npage errors \\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→alone {\\\"active\\\":false,\\\"seeded\\\":false,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\"}\\nafter keys {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"call\\\",\\\"focus\\\":0,\\\"canvas\\\":true}\\nhover {\\\"focus\\\":2,\\\"device\\\":\\\"mouse\\\",\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"ENTER\\\"} point 384,252\\nxbox {\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"CROSS\\\",\\\"device\\\":\\\"pad\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"ps\\\"}\\nattract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"attract\\\",\\\"save\\\":null,\\\"settings\\\":null}\\npad attract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"save\\\":null}\\nslider 1.1 reset 1\\nseats -1.2,-0.6121271354118106 -> 0.46666666666666656,-2.2787938020784773\\nmouse drain 0.7 -> {\\\"r\\\":0.18666666666666698,\\\"done\\\":true}\\n10→touch {\\\"text\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"stick\\\":false,\\\"buttons\\\":[\\\"✕\\\",\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"Done\\\",\\\"⚙\\\"]} mode attract\\nresults mode results\\npage errors \\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/browser.txt\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":15,\"raw_output\":\"alone {\\\"active\\\":false,\\\"seeded\\\":false,\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\"}\\nafter keys {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"call\\\",\\\"focus\\\":0,\\\"canvas\\\":true}\\nhover {\\\"focus\\\":2,\\\"device\\\":\\\"mouse\\\",\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"ENTER\\\"} point 384,252\\nxbox {\\\"confirm\\\":\\\"CROSS\\\",\\\"device\\\":\\\"pad\\\",\\\"glyphs\\\":\\\"ps\\\"}\\nattract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"attract\\\",\\\"save\\\":null,\\\"settings\\\":null}\\npad attract {\\\"mode\\\":\\\"title\\\",\\\"save\\\":null}\\nslider 1.1 reset 1\\nseats -1.2,-0.6121271354118106 -> 0.46666666666666656,-2.2787938020784773\\nmouse drain 0.7 -> {\\\"r\\\":0.18666666666666698,\\\"done\\\":true}\\ntouch {\\\"text\\\":\\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\",\\\"stick\\\":false,\\\"buttons\\\":[\\\"✕\\\",\\\"Reset\\\",\\\"Done\\\",\\\"⚙\\\"]} mode attract\\nresults mode results\\npage errors \\n\",\"total_lines\":12}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"5b658551-0d08-4f08-86b3-bb58bf76b646"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_294","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Hovering worked. Focus moved to element 2. The device mouse was active. ENTER was pressed.\n\nThe pad button press worked, but the glyphs stayed 'ps'. ArrowRight failed to toggle settings. The flow likely broke at ArrowDown or Enter. ArrowDown retries up to five times.\n\nPointer jitter may be the real culprit. If the pointer value flickers every frame, hover could reset focus to row 2 and revert the device back to mouse each cycle. That would explain why the pad press worked but the glyphs never changed.\n\nThe bug is now clear. If hover resets focus to row 2 before Enter, the game opens CONSULT instead of SETTINGS. ArrowRight then has no effect on glyphs. The pointerMoved flag likely fires every frame due to coordinate jitter or float noise in the lastPx comparison.\n\nThe engine likely updates pointer coordinates every frame with tiny differences. A 0.002 threshold is too small to catch real movement. The fix is to require a larger delta, around 0.01, or to debounce hover triggers so a stationary pointer does not keep retriggering.\n\nThe pointer coordinates appear stable after the move. If the engine updates them with a new object each frame, pointerMoved would only fire once and hover would not loop. ArrowDown should then work normally. The earlier theory about pointer jitter may be wrong. The real cause of the settings failure is still unclear.\n\nArrowDown should correctly reach focus 3. The real failure is likely that Enter never opened settings. If the mode stayed menu, ArrowRight would call nudge and return early, leaving glyphs as 'ps'.\n\nThe pad result matches the log. The test will be updated to record mode and focus after each poke, and to log glyphs before the pad press. The device switch from mouse to key happens before hover, so if the pointer is stationary, focus changes via bump instead.\n\nArrowDown works in the dev slider menu, so the key itself is not broken. The failure is specific to the main pause menu after hover switches the device to mouse. The next step is to check whether pointerMoved stays true on the following frames, but logging inside the game is difficult.\n\nI will add debug logging to check lastPx and mode after each input. I also plan to make hover skip when a key is pressed this frame, so the two do not fight. If pointerMoved fires every frame, hover will still reset focus back to row 2 on the next frame after a key press.\n\nThe focus briefly reached 3 before hover reset it to 2. Enter then confirmed CONSULT instead of SETTINGS. ArrowRight on CONSULT does nothing, so glyphs stayed ps and the pad press followed. This matches the log exactly.\n\nThe dev slider test avoids this conflict because it never moves the mouse. The menu test does move the pointer once, which triggers hover and causes the focus fight. The fix is to ignore stationary pointers or require a real mouseDelta before hovering.\n\nThe simplest fix is to require a real mouseDelta or a larger pointer jump before hover fires, then ignore the pointer until it moves again by more than 0.02. This prevents jitter from retriggering hover and keeps focus stable.\n\nA 0.015 deadzone will prevent hover from repeating. Enter does not trigger a click, so confirming settings is safe. The installed pad has axes at zero.\n\nI will rerun the full test rather than adding a filter, since the two-minute runtime is acceptable. I also verified that entering settings resets focus to zero via goto(), so ArrowRight should correctly toggle glyphs.\n\nThe hover fix now requires a 0.02 pixel jump before firing, and it only triggers when the pointer moved or jumped while no key was pressed. This prevents jitter from retriggering hover and keeps focus stable. The device also stays on key during that frame, so a key press cannot be overridden by pointer noise.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e5e825c3-d12d-4945-805b-24d23831fa7d-150","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","offset":382,"limit":50}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":345,"output_tokens":3054,"cache_read_input_tokens":199424,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"ae6f2599-e433-4e85-aa9e-4ff2ead8ad2d"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-e5e825c3-d12d-4945-805b-24d23831fa7d-150","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"382→      x: seat?.x || 0,\\n      z: seat?.z || 0,\\n      tool: this.humanInput?.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n    };\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n390→    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n400→      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n410→      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n420→      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n430→    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\",\"content_concise\":\"382→      x: seat?.x || 0,\\n      z: seat?.z || 0,\\n      tool: this.humanInput?.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n    };\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n390→    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n400→      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n410→      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n420→      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n430→    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js\",\"offset\":382,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"      x: seat?.x || 0,\\n      z: seat?.z || 0,\\n      tool: this.humanInput?.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n    };\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n\",\"total_lines\":872}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"3a72971f-4770-4ed0-9f10-ce04a4a7a644"}
