... truncated (1031 chars total)]\"},{\"line_number\":17,\"content\":\"## Verification plan\"},{\"line_number\":23,\"content\":\"6. **gating:** Hash `pixel-engine.js` against the zip and the embedded session client against the fetched file; both equal. `exit-interview.json` parses and matches criterion 1. Record hashes and `python3 -m json.tool` output in `{SCRATCH}/package.txt`.\"},{\"line_number\":33,\"content\":\"- Work root: `/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work` (PLAN.md, STAGE.md, TASK.md already there). New dev subfolder, root HTML, `PROGRESS.md`, `exit-interview.json` only.\"},{\"line_number\":42,\"content\":\"## Task checklist\"},{\"line_number\":50,\"content\":\"- [ ] Tune to the balance table, write the authoring note, fill About and `exit-interview.json`, emit the root HTML, and save a green `node tests/run.mjs` log plus the two launch captures under `{SCRATCH}`.\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"aeb71734-2d00-415e-8a95-9c008f4d06e1"}
