, so expose the most important gameplay variables as live sliders, with a reset to defaults.\"},{\"line_number\":103,\"content\":\"- Testing: testing parameters allowed\"},{\"line_number\":107,\"content\":\"- Usage: write \\\"added on import\\\". You can't see your own cost, so don't estimate it: the runner records the real cost, tokens and time, and the agent that imports the game into AI Hub puts them on your About/Credits screen.\"},{\"line_number\":109,\"content\":\"Exit interview: before you finish, also save these answers as exit-interview.json in this folder's root, beside the game's .html: one JSON object in exactly the shape below, every value filled in (\\\"unknown\\\" for anything you can't confirm). Tools read it (the game's run record and the AI Hub catalogue), so write plain text, and check that the file parses as JSON.\"},{\"line_number\":111,\"content\":\"  \\\"sourceInformation\\\": {\\\"date\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"plan\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"genre\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"perspective\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"tech\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"artDirection\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"animation\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"audio\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"online\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"testing\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"research\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"environment\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"model\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"usage\\\": \\\"added on import\\\"},\"},{\"line_number\":112,\"content\":\"  \\\"testingFeedback\\\": [\\\"your answer to each Testing Feedback question, in order\\\"],\"},{\"line_number\":115,\"content\":\"  \\\"aiHub\\\": {\"},{\"line_number\":132,\"content\":\"- How many issues did testing catch?\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/about.js\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":3,\"content\":\"export const SOURCE_INFORMATION = {\"},{\"line_number\":14,\"content\":\"  testing: 'Node sim suite, Playwright on software WebGPU, hub harness on 127.0.0.1. No physical pad, no second person, no iOS Safari, no TV.',\"},{\"line_number\":41,\"content\":\"  'Ask for the exit-interview counts after the suite has run, and name one file as the only source of the balance numbers.',\"},{\"line_number\":57,\"content\":\"export const ABOUT_FIELDS = [\"},{\"line_number\":58,\"content\":\"  ['Date', SOURCE_INFORMATION.date],\"},{\"line_number\":59,\"content\":\"  ['Source', SOURCE_INFORMATION.source],\"},{\"line_number\":60,\"content\":\"  ['Plan', SOURCE_INFORMATION.plan],\"},{\"line_number\":61,\"content\":\"  ['Genre and Perspective', `${SOURCE_INFORMATION.genre}; ${SOURCE_INFORMATION.perspective}`],\"},{\"line_number\":62,\"content\":\"  ['Tech', SOURCE_INFORMATION.tech],\"},{\"line_number\":63,\"content\":\"  ['Art Direction', SOURCE_INFORMATION.artDirection],\"},{\"line_number\":64,\"content\":\"  ['Animation', SOURCE_INFORMATION.animation],\"},{\"line_number\":65,\"content\":\"  ['Audio', SOURCE_INFORMATION.audio],\"},{\"line_number\":66,\"content\":\"  ['Online', SOURCE_INFORMATION.online],\"},{\"line_number\":67,\"content\":\"  ['Testing', SOURCE_INFORMATION.testing],\"},{\"line_number\":68,\"content\":\"  ['Research', SOURCE_INFORMATION.research],\"},{\"line_number\":69,\"content\":\"  ['Environment', SOURCE_INFORMATION.environment],\"},{\"line_number\":70,\"content\":\"  ['Model', SOURCE_INFORMATION.model],\"},{\"line_number\":71,\"content\":\"  ['Usage', SOURCE_INFORMATION.usage],\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md\",\"matches\":[{\"line_number\":844,\"content\":\"- For the exit-interview file your brief asks for, `aiHub.genre` is `Simulation`, `players` `1–4`, `series` `Trauma Center`. Good tags: `3d`, `pixel art`, `story`, `co-op`, `boss fights`, `comedy`.\"},{\"line_number\":860,\"content\":\"9. **Finish.** Fill in About and your chat reply and exit-interview file as your brief says.\"}]},{\"path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xh