{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_308","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A potential bug exists in the client send path.\n\nThe client return only exits the interval callback, which is harmless. Host and client send paths use separate token buckets.\n\nThe hub harness calls ready() without a key before the card check. The server path calls it immediately, while the client path retries via Clinic.ready every 250ms. Need to verify Clinic.ready is wired to the engine ready hook. The server copy opens a session and starts the interval immediately, sending pings and inputs before Engine.start. This timing looks correct.\n\nNeed to verify that Engine calls ready() so Clinic.ready() can retry AIHub.ready(). The Enter key on the card frame must bubble to the window and trigger AIHub.answer('ready'). Host finish logic correctly skips time-up when hostGone. Standings use hub.players at finish time.\n\nHost traffic totals roughly 13 sends per second, safely under the 16/s token bucket limit. The catch-all error handler may silently swallow encodeFast failures, causing snaps to fail and clients to miss updates.\n\nClient traffic is roughly 15 sends per second, near the host's burst limit but should still work. The interval's try/catch prevents uncaught page errors from breaking the hub check. Need to verify that game.html includes the required head tags. If AIHub.rng('deal') is unavailable before start, beginOp throws and triggers hub.fail.\n\nThe server copy correctly skips Engine.start. The client allow() function refills tokens from the last refill timestamp, so the early return when tokens are low may reset the refill timer and stall recovery.\n\nThe client input accumulator resets even when `allow()` rejects a send, so the next packet is delayed by 66 ms. A swallowed error in `step()` could prevent the round from finishing.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-809a6936-d7e7-465e-9718-30fbba5fc4ba-22","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","offset":100,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-809a6936-d7e7-465e-9718-30fbba5fc4ba-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub:session|meta name","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tools/build.mjs"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3680,"output_tokens":1440,"cache_read_input_tokens":65664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"674df673-3d72-4645-9c08-56688a12977b"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-809a6936-d7e7-465e-9718-30fbba5fc4ba-22","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"100→\\n  async setup(ctx) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n    ctx.input.preventKeys.add('Tab');\\n    this.view = createView(ctx);\\n    ctx.audio.register('bark', { wave: 'square', freq: 220, decay: 0.12, volume: 0.35, duty: 0.25 });\\n    ctx.audio.register('ui', { wave: 'square', freq: 740, freqEnd: 180, decay: 0.07, volume: 0.3, duty: 0.25 });\\n    let fresh = true;\\n    try {\\n110→      fresh = globalThis.localStorage?.getItem('pixel-engine:audio') == null;\\n    } catch {\\n      fresh = true;\\n    }\\n    if (fresh) ctx.audio.setVolume('music', 0.1);\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\\n      window.addEventListener('keydown', (ev) => this.onKey(ev));\\n      window.addEventListener('gamepadconnected', () => this.dropGate());\\n    }\\n    if (this.session) {\\n120→      this.session.onSim = (sim) => { this.sim = sim; };\\n      this.session.silence = () => {\\n        ctx.audio.playMusic(null);\\n        ctx.audio.stopLoops();\\n      };\\n      this.mode = 'card';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.applyUrl();\\n  }\\n130→\\n  ready(ctx) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n140→      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n150→      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n160→    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) {\\n      const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n      const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n      if (human && this.padInputs[i]) inputs[i] = this.padInputs[i];\\n      else if (human && i === this.drive) inputs[i] = this.humanInput || {};\\n      else inputs[i] = botInput(this.sim, i, this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill), dt);\\n    }\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (this.session) this.pullSession();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n190→    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n200→    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n210→  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n220→\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n230→    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n240→\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n250→    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\",\"content_concise\":\"100→\\n  async setup(ctx) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n    ctx.input.preventKeys.add('Tab');\\n    this.view = createView(ctx);\\n    ctx.audio.register('bark', { wave: 'square', freq: 220, decay: 0.12, volume: 0.35, duty: 0.25 });\\n    ctx.audio.register('ui', { wave: 'square', freq: 740, freqEnd: 180, decay: 0.07, volume: 0.3, duty: 0.25 });\\n    let fresh = true;\\n    try {\\n110→      fresh = globalThis.localStorage?.getItem('pixel-engine:audio') == null;\\n    } catch {\\n      fresh = true;\\n    }\\n    if (fresh) ctx.audio.setVolume('music', 0.1);\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\\n      window.addEventListener('keydown', (ev) => this.onKey(ev));\\n      window.addEventListener('gamepadconnected', () => this.dropGate());\\n    }\\n    if (this.session) {\\n120→      this.session.onSim = (sim) => { this.sim = sim; };\\n      this.session.silence = () => {\\n        ctx.audio.playMusic(null);\\n        ctx.audio.stopLoops();\\n      };\\n      this.mode = 'card';\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.applyUrl();\\n  }\\n130→\\n  ready(ctx) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n140→      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n150→      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n160→    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) {\\n      const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n      const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n      if (human && this.padInputs[i]) inputs[i] = this.padInputs[i];\\n      else if (human && i === this.drive) inputs[i] = this.humanInput || {};\\n      else inputs[i] = botInput(this.sim, i, this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill), dt);\\n    }\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (this.session) this.pullSession();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n190→    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n200→    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n 