{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_326","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The engine maps gamepad buttons to keys via the gamepadButtons variable, which defaults to QJ.\n\nClearing gamepadButtons to an empty object should disable all key presses. The glyph flip from Xbox to PS4 confirms that nudgeSetting was triggered by the pad button press.\n\nThe glyph flip may be caused by the default gamepad mapping still being active, an incorrect rising edge detection in samplePad, or persistSettings and loadSettings resetting glyphs. The test waits for the prompt state to match the expected pad configuration.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2629dd9f-e837-47ee-a57b-fa7e33a5cdb5-49","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/API.md","offset":2260,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-2629dd9f-e837-47ee-a57b-fa7e33a5cdb5-50","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\ntext = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/pixel-engine.js\").read_text()\ni = text.find(\"gamepadButtons={...QJ}\")\nprint(\"assign\", i)\n# find QJ=\nj = text.rfind(\"QJ=\", 0, i)\nprint(\"QJ def near\", j)\nprint(text[j:j+800])\nprint(\"---\")\n# also search GAMEPAD\nk = text.find(\"ArrowLeft\")\nprint(\"first ArrowLeft\", k)\nprint(text[k-200:k+200])\nPY","description":"Find default gamepad button map"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1460,"output_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":95872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b2603b13-a2e4-4dee-a51a-