{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_333","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Center anchors use x and y offsets from the screen center.\n\nThe title bug comes from adding half the screen width to x while using a center anchor. That pushes the text half a screen to the right of center.\n\nThe clock text is also mispositioned. It is placed at center plus half the screen width, which pushes it completely off the right edge. The HUD description mentions a small \"10\" clipped to the left of VITALS, suggesting the clock may be wrapping or clipped rather than fully visible.\n\nThe composure text is also off-screen. It uses a top-right anchor at x = w - 8, which places it almost entirely outside the right edge. The VITALS text at (8, 4) is correctly positioned. The rank stamp sits near the right edge with scale 6.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77916c97-5e04-498a-83cf-7657064b6089-66","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"anchor:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-77916c97-5e04-498a-83cf-7657064b6089-67","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/ui/hud.js","offset":210,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1246,"output_tokens":810,"cache_read_input_tokens":117760,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"1d5bf4a2-e907-4a38-998c-48560fd27da8"}
