{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_345","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HUD fallback only triggers when `shown` is null, but it is currently 0, so the fallback never runs.\n\nA display-only fix is being considered: treat `shown` as real vitals when it is 0 or negative. This would show live vitals before the first mirrorVitals tick, while still displaying 0 correctly if the patient dies.\n\nThe proposed fix handles all edge cases correctly. It shows live vitals before the first tick, respects lies, and falls back to real vitals when shown is zero. A potential race condition with lie state and a brief mismatch between shown and live vitals was noted but deemed unlikely.\n\nThe preferred fix is to initialize `shown` and call `mirrorVitals` at the end of `createOp`. This keeps the HUD field accurate for node tests without changing simulation initialization. A subtle edge case where `enterStage` might set `lie` was noted but deemed unlikely.\n\nThe fix will call `mirrorVitals` immediately after `enterStage` in `createOp`. This keeps the initial `shown` value at 0 while ensuring the HUD field is overwritten with real vitals. The simulation hash and launch fingerprint remain unchanged because `hashSim` does not include `shown`. The HUD color logic also works correctly: starting vitals around 80 display as white, and the red threshold only triggers once vitals drop below 30.\n\nThe yellow \"10\" fragment on the left of VITALS is likely the clock drawn at center+w/2, which lands at the right edge. After the HUD fix, the clock will be centered correctly. I will add the mirrorVitals call and check that enterStage does not depend on shown. The browser test is still running, so I will not start another one.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f0a14a5-b246-4175-9044-8bbf03508a4d-87","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","old_string":"  if (def.heart) sim.heart = true;\n  enterStage(sim);\n  return sim;","new_string":"  if (def.heart) sim.heart = true;\n  enterStage(sim);\n  mirrorVitals(sim);\n  return sim;"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3f0a14a5-b246-4175-9044-8bbf03508a4d-88","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && node tests/run.mjs","description":"Re-run default sim and content suite"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1648,"output_tokens":1136,"cache_read_input_tokens":138496,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"359cb531-78cd-4870-8c19-81ef6ff85893"}
