{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_353","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HUD looks good. Vitals, timer, and tool list are all readable.\n\nTitle and tagline look good. The EKG overlaps characters slightly but remains readable. The prompt sits on their heads. The cross glyph is clear. Launch will take 30 to 60 seconds. The hub will take several minutes.\n\nLaunch will run first, then hub. The commands will be chained so hub only starts if launch succeeds. While hub runs, I'll prepare the exit interview and package hashes.\n\nI'll hold off on writing final files until hub passes, since a hub failure would require rebuilding launch. I can prepare the JSON content in memory and check audio.txt while the jobs run. Launch plus hub should take roughly four minutes total.\n\nI'll write a draft of PROGRESS.md with the current state rather than leaving it empty. The hub command will run with an eight-minute timeout.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2fb1952-6e28-4788-a7af-468a67b38d95-101","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040 && PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 node tests/run.mjs launch && PLAYWRIGHT_HOST_PLATFORM_OVERRIDE=ubuntu24.04-x64 node tests/run.mjs hub","description":"Run launch twice, then five hub harnesses","block_until_ms":0}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2fb1952-6e28-4788-a7af-468a67b38d95-102","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"pixel-engine.zip|audio.txt","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040","glob":"*.{mjs,md,json,txt}"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e2fb1952-6e28-4788-a7af-468a67b38d95-103","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/hom