{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_367","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Line 30 is a waitForFunction for __GAME__ or about mode.\n\nThe 30-second timeout on line 30 is the menu wait. Enter failed to open the menu. The page may not have booted. The game may not have been focused.\n\nThe first wait passed, so __GAME__ exists but Enter failed to change mode. The live test worked without pads. WebGPU may have failed silently. I will read the script and add logging to capture the page state.\n\nThe live test retries Enter up to five times. The current script only presses it once. The key press may have missed the input listener.\n\nThe engine likely attached listeners before the key press, so a single Enter should register. The failure probably stems from page focus or an unexpected mode change. I will log the current mode before the wait fails and retry the Enter press.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7f8bf480-53b6-44f9-babf-31af2b823e06-121","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/about-shot.mjs","old_string":"await page.goto(pathToFileURL(html).href, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 60000 });\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__, { timeout: 45000 });\nawait page.keyboard.press('Enter');\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'menu');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) await page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');\nawait page.waitForTimeout(200);\nawait page.keyboard.press('Enter');\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'about', { timeout: 4000 });","new_string":"const errors = [];\npage.on('pageerror', (err) => errors.push(String(err)));\nawait page.goto(pathToFileURL(html).href, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 60000 });\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__, { timeout: 45000 });\nfor (let i = 0; i < 6 && await page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode !== 'menu'); i++) {\n  await page.keyboard.press('Enter');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(200);\n}\nconst atMenu = await page.evaluate(() => ({ mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode, focus: window.__GAME__.app.focus, errors }));\nconsole.log('menu', JSON.stringify(atMenu));\nfor (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n  const focus = await page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.app.focus);\n  if (focus === 4) break;\n  await page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');\n  await page.waitForTimeout(150);\n}\nawait page.keyboard.press('Enter');\nawait page.waitForTimeout(400);\nconst atAbout = await page.evaluate(() => ({ mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode, focus: window.__GAME__.app.focus, page: window.__GAME__.app.aboutPage }));\nconsole.log('about', JSON.stringify(atAbout));"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":580,"output_tokens":1084,"cache_read_input_tokens":166912,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"60626520-a91d-4c0b-9b46-2aee43d118d4"}
