{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_383","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tests look reasonable. They import the shipped simulator and step through it.\n\nBalance tests play every operation with the bot. I am now hunting for real bugs by comparing the large PLAN.md against the code. I am checking mouse raycast, pad buttons, attract mode saves, touch gates, dev mode sliders, hub head tags, HTML module imports, code blue behavior, and story line length.\n\nThe story line length requirement is stricter than the plan. The test enforces 57 characters per line, while the plan allows 60. It also expects scenes to contain 8–16 lines, which conflicts with the plan's \"at most two lines\" wording.\n\nThe story line limit wording is ambiguous. PLAN.md likely defines the exact rules. \"At most two lines\" may refer to wrapped text lines rather than scene beats. Eight to sixteen dialogue beats per scene would fit if each beat is a short line.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bd658f65-eb10-4104-91a1-77aeddabb904-23","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"^## |^### |at most|60 char|two line|slider|forbidden|head tag|shared-world|music","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md","head_limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bd658f65-eb10-4104-91a1-77aeddabb904-24","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/about-0.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bd658f65-eb10-4104-91a1-77aeddabb904-25","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/arena-heart.png"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-bd658f65-eb10-4104-91a1-77aeddabb904-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20