{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_385","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to hunt for real bugs more carefully.\n\nChecking nine specific areas for bugs: slider visibility in Dev Mode, HTML hub tags, mouse raycast to tissue, op.js test gaps, bundled HTML inclusion, authoring notes, About page feedback, story line wrapping, and whether check.mjs --sheets is incorrectly gating.\n\nI will examine clinic.js for screen flow bugs, devices.js for pad and keyboard double-presses, aim.js for mouse hit accuracy, and the HTML head. I am checking whether dense About pages violate the eight-row limit. I will also review live.mjs browser tests, input paths, and surgery view logic. I plan to spot-check op.js operations for obvious defects.\n\nI am checking root HTML for module script type, hub meta tags, and embedded session.js. pixel-engine.js matches its zip hash. The title \"The Second Opinion Clinic\" risks violating the no-\"Second Opinion\" rule; I will flag it but not reject unless clearly broken.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f5037f6-de2a-43b6-826a-1af8461f414b-32","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hub:session|hub:type|hub:source|meta name","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tools/build.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f5037f6-de2a-43b6-826a-1af8461f414b-33","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"slider|devMode|DEV|xbox|attract|touchOnly|Controller or keyboard","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src","glob":"*.js","head_limit":60}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-8f5037f6-de2a-43b6-826a-1af8461f414b-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-