.45 of an object to grab it, then pull along its marked path for its `pull` length. On release when free, it flicks into the steel dish. Fishhooks pull along a **curved arrow**. Magnets have a **speed limit** (too fast snaps back). Strain cores fight back on a **tether** | Path deviation | More than 1 unit off path tears tissue: spawns a nick |\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"| **Scalpel** | Follow a dotted guide | Start within 0.5 of its start, hold, trace to the end. Mean deviation ≤ 0.12 is CLEAN, ≤ 0.3 is GOOD. Letting go resumes from the last point. Closed paths encircle tumours | Deviation | More than 0.8 off cuts healthy tissue: spawns a pool |\"},{\"line_number\":378,\"content\":\"- **Scaling:** vitals drain and spawn rates ×`(1 + 0.25 · (N − 1))`. Composure is shared. Seats 1 and 3 have The Quiet, seats 2 and 4 The Second Look. Each seat scores its own points.\"},{\"line_number\":496,\"content\":\"- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\"},{\"line_number\":497,\"content\":\"- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\"},{\"line_number\":498,\"content\":\"- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\"},{\"line_number\":716,\"content\":\"      spawn:[{ k:'pool', id:'p1', at:[-3,.6], r:1.6 }, { k:'hook', id:'h1', at:[-3,.9], hiddenBy:'p1', arc:.8, pull:1.2 }],\"},{\"line_number\":724,\"content\":\"- `until` takes `clear`, `flag`, `all` or `time`. Commands: `say, spawn, remove, unlock, setDrain, music, camera, flag, codeBlue`.\"},{\"line_number\":886,\"content\":\"| Dev mode from pause, live sliders, reset | §8, §12 |\"},{\"line_number\":887,\"content\":\"| Attract after 10 s, any input exits | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":888,\"content\":\"| Controller-first at 10 feet, native keyboard and mouse, prompts by last input, Xbox option | §4, §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":889,\"content\":\"| No dense data screens | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":890,\"content\":\"| Touch-only gate, settings button, attract runs | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":893,\"content\":\"| Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback in chat and About; exit interview | §8, §14, your brief |\"}]}]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"212be34a-a58e-4f42-acec-d3ca8a9e5525"}
