arked path for its `pull` length. On release when free, it flicks into the steel dish. Fishhooks pull along a **curved arrow**. Magnets have a **speed limit** (too fast snaps back). Strain cores fight back on a **tether** | Path deviation | More than 1 unit off path tears tissue: spawns a nick |\"},{\"line_number\":149,\"content\":\"| **Scalpel** | Follow a dotted guide | Start within 0.5 of its start, hold, trace to the end. Mean deviation ≤ 0.12 is CLEAN, ≤ 0.3 is GOOD. Letting go resumes from the last point. Closed paths encircle tumours | Deviation | More than 0.8 off cuts healthy tissue: spawns a pool |\"},{\"line_number\":169,\"content\":\"- **Mistakes:** 5 mistakes fail the op (0 in Dev Mode means unlimited).\"},{\"line_number\":378,\"content\":\"- **Scaling:** vitals drain and spawn rates ×`(1 + 0.25 · (N − 1))`. Composure is shared. Seats 1 and 3 have The Quiet, seats 2 and 4 The Second Look. Each seat scores its own points.\"},{\"line_number\":408,\"content\":\"- **Session rules:** no title, menus, pause, saves, attract or dev mode. Options does nothing. No alert/confirm/prompt, no new tabs, no sockets, no chat. Names come only from `info.players` and are drawn with `hud.text`. Don't use `Math.random` for gameplay; seed the sim with `AIHub.rng('deal')`.\"},{\"line_number\":472,\"content\":\"- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\"},{\"line_number\":492,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\"},{\"line_number\":496,\"content\":\"- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\"},{\"line_number\":498,\"content\":\"- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\"},{\"line_number\":716,\"content\":\"      spawn:[{ k:'pool', id:'p1', at:[-3,.6