{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b88ffe31-f38e-4210-92b5-9a7dee7eb5e2-9","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n490→- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n500→---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n510→| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\",\"content_concise\":\"480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n490→- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n500→---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n510→| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":480,\"limit\":40,\"raw_output\":\"\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\\n\",\"total_lines\":893}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-b88ffe31-f38e-4210-92b5-9a7dee7eb5e2-10","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"160→function drawCard(hud, app, w, h) {\\n  const title = 'THE SECOND OPINION CLINIC';\\n  const tw = hud.measure(title, 2).width;\\n  hud.text((w - tw) / 2, 12, title, { scale: 2, color: 'sand' });\\n  hud.text(20, 58, 'KEEP THE PATIENT ALIVE AND TOP THE TEAM SCORE', { scale: 1 });\\n  hud.text(20, 78, 'STICK OR MOUSE MOVES. R2 OR CLICK USES.', { scale: 1 });\\n  const players = app.session?.infoPlayers?.() || app.cardPlayers || [];\\n  players.forEach((p, i) => {\\n    const ready = app.session?.card?.ready || [];\\n    const mark = ready.includes(p.id) ? 'READY' : 'WAIT';\\n170→    hud.text(24, 110 + i * 18, clean(`${p.name || 'SEAT'}  ${mark}`), { scale: 1, color: 'white' });\\n  });\\n  const left = app.session?.card?.left;\\n  if (left != null) hud.text(24, h - 36, clean(`TIME ${Math.ceil(left / 1000)}`), { scale: 1 });\\n  glyphBox(hud, 24, h - 24, 'CROSS');\\n  hud.text(56, h - 20, 'READY    M MORE TIME', { scale: 1 });\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawResults(hud, app, w, h) {\\n  const sim = app.sim;\\n180→  if (!sim) return;\\n  hud.rect(24, 20, w - 48, h - 40, 'ink');\\n  hud.text(40, 36, clean(sim.title || 'CHART'), { scale: 2, color: 'sand' });\\n  const rows = [\\n    `TIME ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)}`,\\n    `VITALS ${Math.floor(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals || 0)}`,\\n    `SCORE ${Math.floor(sim.finalScore || sim.score || 0)}`,\\n    `MISTAKES ${sim.mistakes}`,\\n  ];\\n  rows.forEach((row, i) => hud.text(40, 72 + i * 18, row, { scale: 1 }));\\n190→  hud.text(w - 70, 90, clean(sim.rank || 'C'), { scale: 6, color: 'sand' });\\n  const note = app.followLine();\\n  hud.text(40, h - 70, clean(note).slice(0, 57), { scale: 1 });\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawPause(hud, app, w, h) {\\n  hud.rect(16, 16, Math.min(360, w - 32), h - 32, 'ink');\\n  if (app.mode === 'pause') {\\n    hud.text(28, 28, 'PAUSED', { scale: 2, color: 'sand' });\\n    app.pauseItems().forEach((label, i) => {\\n200→      const y = 64 + i * 22;\\n      if (i === app.focus) hud.rect(24, y - 3, 220, 18, 'slate');\\n      hud.text(32, y, clean(label), { scale: 1 });\\n    });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const tabs = ['BALANCE', 'CHEATS', 'JUMP', 'ACTIONS', 'VIEW'];\\n  hud.text(28, 24, `DEV  ${tabs[app.devTab] || ''}`, { scale: 2, color: 'sand' });\\n  app.devRows().forEach((label, i) => {\\n    const y = 58 + i * 16;\\n210→    if (y > h - 16) return;\\n    if (i === app.focus) hud.rect(24, y - 2, 300, 14, 'slate');\\n    hud.text(30, y, clean(label).slice(0, 42), { scale: 1 });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawOp(hud, app, w, h) {\\n  const sim = app.sim;\\n  if (!sim) return;\\n  hud.rect(0, 0, w, 22, 'ink');\\n220→  const shown = sim.shown != null ? sim.shown : Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals || 0);\\n  hud.text(8, 4, `VITALS ${shown}`, { scale: 2, color: shown < 30 ? 'red' : 'white' });\\n  const clock = clockText(sim.timeLeft);\\n  const cw = hud.measure(clock, 2).width;\\n  hud.text((w - cw) / 2, 4, clock, { scale: 2 });\\n  hud.text(8, 4, `COMP ${Math.floor(sim.composure)}`, { anchor: 'top-right', scale: 1, color: 'sand' });\\n  const say = sim.say || app.lineText || '';\\n  if (say) {\\n    hud.rect(0, h - 36, w, 36, 'ink');\\n    hud.text(8, h - 28, clean(say).slice(0, 57), { scale: 1 });\\n230→  }\\n  drawWheel(hud, w, h, sim);\\n  if (app.hitbox) {\\n    sim.entities.filter((e) => !e.done && !e.hidden).slice(0, 8).forEach((e, i) => {\\n      hud.text(8, 28 + i * 12, clean(`${e.id} ${e.kind}`), { scale: 1 });\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction clockText(seconds) {\\n240→  const s = Math.max(0, Math.floor(seconds || 0));\\n  const m = Math.floor(s / 60);\\n  const r = s % 60;\\n  return `${m}:${r < 10 ? '0' : ''}${r}`;\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawWheel(hud, w, h, sim) {\\n  const labels = ['SCL', 'FRC', 'SUT', 'DRN', 'SYR', 'GEL', 'LSR', 'SCN'];\\n  const tool = sim.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain';\\n  const idx = Math.max(0, TOOLS.indexOf(tool));\\n250→  const top = h - 172;\\n  hud.rect(w - 56, top - 16, 52, 148, 'ink');\\n  hud.text(w - 52, top - 14, `DOSE ${sim.doses}`, { scale: 1 });\\n  labels.forEach((label, i) => {\\n    hud.text(w - 50, top + 4 + i * 16, label, { scale: 1, color: i === idx ? 'sand' : 'white' });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nexport function aboutPageLines(page) {\\n  if (page === 0) return ABOUT_FIELDS.map(([k, v]) => `${k}: ${v}`);\\n260→  if (page === 1) return TESTING_FEEDBACK;\\n  if (page === 2) return ENGINE_FEEDBACK;\\n  if (page === 3) return PROMPT_FEEDBACK;\\n  return [\\n    'Pixel Engine MIT',\\n    'three.js and Rapier',\\n    'Kenney furniture CC0',\\n    'All art and audio written in code',\\n    SOURCE_INFORMATION.source,\\n  ];