{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_417","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to check makeEntity to find the spawn fields for bleeder, laceration, and hook.\n\nI need to check how tests filter in run.mjs for the shell test. I also need to verify FIELD bounds and cursor speed so the drain test works. I'm drafting a node test that compares pad and mouse inputs on the clinic.\n\nI need to find op1 spawn coordinates to verify the drain pool location. I'm designing a WASD pad test that should move the seat forward. I'm also planning a fake hub session test to drive the 34ms timer.\n\nI'm reconsidering the fake hub session test. Advancing time manually is flaky, and exporting a tick function would re-implement logic instead of testing the real path. I'm weighing whether to use fake timers or async waits in run.mjs, or simply test the specific buggy pieces directly.\n\nThe clinic bug is that pullSession overwrites x and z with the seat position. I will test this by creating a Clinic with a session from openSession, setting mouse input to aim at a different spot, calling update, and asserting that session.local.x keeps the aimed value while the seat moves.\n\nI will pass a stub context to readInput during the test. Client movement happens in update via predictSeat, not fixedUpdate. The host path is inside the timer interval, so I must drive it for real. I also need to check how run.mjs invokes tests and review live.mjs to avoid breaking the two-pad browser test. For FPS tracking, I can derive it from dt inside update.\n\nThe VIEW tab will display FPS and simulation stats. A FRAME STEP row lets the user advance one frame while dev mode holds the simulation. The frameStep method uses the last human or pad inputs.\n\nFrame step will call `step` with the last inputs or empty input, advancing the clock even when dev mode skips fixedUpdate. The PLAN also requires a \"Bot Plays\" toggle in VIEW that activates the bot using the skill slider.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd85a651-6db2-401c-b00d-dae6a697d82c-20","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/live.mjs","offset":180,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd85a651-6db2-401c-b00d-dae6a697d82c-21","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"function main|filter|testShell|async function","glob":"tests/run.mjs"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd85a651-6db2-401c-b00d-dae6a697d82c-22","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"id: 'p1'|kind: 'pool'","glob":"**/ops.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fd85a651-6db2-401c-b00d-dae6a697d82c-23","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/geom.js","limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7007,"output_tokens":1462,"cache_read_input_tokens":56448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b23f03a1-d807-47a7-bddf-3a8f047e1557"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fd85a651-6db2-401c-b00d-dae6a697d82c-20","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"180→      }, { timeout: 2000 });\\n    } catch { /* recorded below */ }\\n    const xbox = await menu.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.prompts);\\n    check('xbox glyphs', xbox.glyphs === 'xbox' && xbox.device === 'pad' && xbox.confirm === 'A');\\n    note(`xbox ${JSON.stringify(xbox)}`);\\n    await pressPad(menu.page, 0, 8, false);\\n    await poke(menu.page, 'ArrowLeft', () => window.__GAME__.prompts.device === 'key' && window.__GAME__.prompts.confirm === 'ENTER');\\n    const keyed = await menu.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.prompts);\\n    check('key prompt', keyed.device === 'key' && keyed.confirm === 'ENTER');\\n    await menuCtx.close();\\n190→\\n    const attract = await browser.newContext({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n    await installPads(attract, 1);\\n    const idle = await openPage(attract, fileUrl(root));\\n    await idle.page.waitForTimeout(11000);\\n    const started = await idle.page.evaluate(() => ({\\n      mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode,\\n      save: localStorage.getItem('soc:save:v1'),\\n      settings: localStorage.getItem('soc:settings'),\\n    }));\\n200→    check('attract after idle', started.mode === 'attract' && started.save == null);\\n    note(`attract ${JSON.stringify(started)}`);\\n    await idle.page.keyboard.press('Escape');\\n    await idle.page.waitForTimeout(200);\\n    const left = await idle.page.evaluate(() => ({\\n      mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode,\\n      save: localStorage.getItem('soc:save:v1'),\\n    }));\\n    check('key exits attract', left.mode === 'title' && left.save == null);\\n    await attract.close();\\n210→\\n    const attractPad = await browser.newContext({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n    await installPads(attractPad, 1);\\n    const idlePad = await openPage(attractPad, fileUrl(root));\\n    await idlePad.page.waitForTimeout(11000);\\n    await pressPad(idlePad.page, 0, 0, true);\\n    await idlePad.page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    const padLeft = await idlePad.page.evaluate(() => ({\\n      mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode,\\n      save: localStorage.getItem('soc:save:v1'),\\n220→    }));\\n    check('pad exits attract', padLeft.mode === 'title' && padLeft.save == null);\\n    note(`pad attract ${JSON.stringify(padLeft)}`);\\n    await attractPad.close();\\n\\n    const dev = await browser.newContext({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n    await installPads(dev, 1);\\n    const devPage = await openPage(dev, fileUrl(root, 'op=op1&seed=1&bot=0&hold=1'));\\n    await poke(devPage.page, 'Escape', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'pause');\\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 4; i++) await poke(devPage.page, 'ArrowDown', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === n, i);\\n230→    await poke(devPage.page, 'Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'dev');\\n    await poke(devPage.page, 'ArrowRight', () => Math.abs(window.__GAME__.config.vitalsDrainMul - 1.1) < 0.001);\\n    const slid = await devPage.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.config.vitalsDrainMul);\\n    await poke(devPage.page, 'End', () => window.__GAME__.app.focus === window.__GAME__.app.devRows().length - 1);\\n    await poke(devPage.page, 'Enter', () => Math.abs(window.__GAME__.config.vitalsDrainMul - 1) < 0.001);\\n    const reset = await devPage.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.config.vitalsDrainMul);\\n    check('dev slider live', Math.abs(slid - 1.1) < 0.001 && Math.abs(reset - 1) < 0.001);\\n    note(`slider ${slid} reset ${reset}`);\\n    await dev.close();\\n\\n240→    const coop = await browser.newContext({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n    await installPads(coop, 2);\\n    const coopPage = await openPage(coop, fileUrl(root, 'op=op1&seed=1&bot=0&seats=2'));\\n    const beforeSeats = await coopPage.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.sim.seats.map((s) => s.x));\\n    await coopPage.page.evaluate(() => {\\n      window.__pads[0].axes[0] = 1;\\n      window.__pads[1].axes[0] = -1;\\n    });\\n    await coopPage.page.waitForTimeout(700);\\n    const seats = await coopPage.page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.sim.seats.map((s) => s.x));\\n250→    check('two pads two tips', seats[0] > beforeSeats[0] + 0.2 && seats[1] < beforeSeats[1] - 0.2);\\n    note(`seats ${beforeSeats.join(',')} -> ${seats.join(',')}`);\\n    await coop.close();\\n\\n    const aim = await browser.newContext({ viewport: { width: 960, height: 540 } });\\n    const aimPage = await openPage(aim, fileUrl(root, 'op=op1&seed=1&bot=0'));\\n    await aimPage.page.waitForTimeout(300);\\n    const aimed = await aimPage.page.evaluate(async () => {\\n      const g = window.__GAME__;\\n      const cam = g.app.ctx.camera.camera;\\n260→      const v = cam.position.clone();\\n      v.set(-3.1, 0.3, -1.1);\\n      v.project(cam);\\n      const box = document.querySelector('canvas').getBoundingClientRect();\\n      const x = box.left + ((v.x + 1) / 2) * box.width;\\n      const y = box.top + ((1 - v.y) / 2) * box.height;\\n      return { x, y, r: g.sim.entities.find((e) => e.id === 'p1').r };\\n    });\\n    await aimPage.page.mouse.move(aimed.x, aimed.y);\\n    await aimPage.page.mouse.down();\\n270→    await aimPage.page.waitForTimeout(800);\\n    await aimPage.page.mouse.up();\\n    const drained = await aimPage.page.evaluate(() => {\\n      const pool = window.__GAME__.sim.entities.find((e) => e.id === 'p1');\\n      return { r: pool.r, done: pool.done };\\n    });\\n    check('mouse drain', drained.done === true || drained.r < aimed.r - 0.05);\\n    note(`mouse drain ${aimed.r} -> ${JSON.stringify(drained)}`);\\n    await aim.close();\\n\\n280→    const phone = devices['Pixel 7'];\\n    const touch = await browser.newContext({ ...phone });\\n    const touchPage = await openPage(touch, fileUrl(root));\\n    await touchPage.page.waitForTimeout(500);\\n    const gate