{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_444","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The client key test shows seat x is approximately 1 after the large drift ease.\n\nKeyD correctly sets the device to key. Predict uses local.sx=1. The seat sits near 1.43, possibly due to nearby pile entities.\n\nKey movement may be too small to pass the 0.05 threshold depending on cursorSpeed. The host place test still returns valid surface coordinates. Now running the test in the dev folder.\n\nThe default test suite is slow because the balance test plays through all operations. I cannot filter for hands only, and the functions are not exported for direct node calls. I will run the full suite anyway.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-df84d906-926a-4aef-b7ed-3db637269ca0-85","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"cursorSpeed","glob":"**/config.js"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1732,"output_tokens":602,"cache_read_input_tokens":136832,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"fda5f246-a6cc-43ef-8545-31b56a23d89d"}
