{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-c202229e-2741-478d-bd86-3b18204ab194-110","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Bundle the clinic into one HTML page. The session client is copied verbatim. */\\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\\nimport { mkdirSync, readFileSync, writeFileSync, copyFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { FILE_BASE, TAGLINE, TITLE } from '../src/core/meta.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst dist = join(root, 'dist');\\n10→mkdirSync(dist, { recursive: true });\\n\\nexecFileSync('esbuild', [\\n  'game.js',\\n  '--bundle',\\n  '--format=esm',\\n  '--platform=browser',\\n  '--target=es2022',\\n  '--outfile=dist/bundle.js',\\n], { cwd: root, stdio: 'inherit' });\\n20→\\nconst js = readFileSync(join(dist, 'bundle.js'), 'utf8').replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\nconst session = readFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\\nconst pack = readFileSync(join(root, 'packs', 'kenney-furniture.json')).toString('base64');\\nconst icon = 'data:image/svg+xml,' + encodeURIComponent(\\n  '<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 16 16\\\"><rect fill=\\\"#1a1218\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\"/><path stroke=\\\"#e8443a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 2v12M2 8h12\\\"/></svg>',\\n);\\nconst description = 'A rainy harbour hospital where telling the truth is the first cut. Keep the patient alive, close the strain, and top the team score.';\\n\\nconst html = `<!doctype html>\\n30→<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>\\n${session}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>${TITLE} — ${TAGLINE}</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"${description}\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#1a1218\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"icon\\\" href=\\\"${icon}\\\">\\n40→<meta name=\\\"hub:type\\\" content=\\\"Game\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:source\\\" content=\\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Keep the patient alive and top the team score\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/mouse: move tool. R2/click: use. Right stick/1-8: pick tool.\\\">\\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#1a1218}#app{position:fixed;inset:0}</style>\\n50→</head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"app\\\"></div>\\n<script>window.__PIXEL_ASSETS__={'packs/kenney-furniture.json':'data:application/json;base64,${pack}'};</script>\\n<script type=\\\"module\\\">\\n${js}\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n`;\\n60→\\nwriteFileSync(join(dist, 'game.html'), html);\\nconst handed = join(root, '..', `${FILE_BASE}.html`);\\nwriteFileSync(handed, html);\\nfor (const name of ['harness.html', 'bridge.js', 'round.js']) {\\n  copyFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', name), join(dist, name));\\n}\\nconsole.log(handed);\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Bundle the clinic into one HTML page. The session client is copied verbatim. */\\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\\nimport { mkdirSync, readFileSync, writeFileSync, copyFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { FILE_BASE, TAGLINE, TITLE } from '../src/core/meta.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst dist = join(root, 'dist');\\n10→mkdirSync(dist, { recursive: true });\\n\\nexecFileSync('esbuild', [\\n  'game.js',\\n  '--bundle',\\n  '--format=esm',\\n  '--platform=browser',\\n  '--target=es2022',\\n  '--outfile=dist/bundle.js',\\n], { cwd: root, stdio: 'inherit' });\\n20→\\nconst js = readFileSync(join(dist, 'bundle.js'), 'utf8').replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\nconst session = readFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\\nconst pack = readFileSync(join(root, 'packs', 'kenney-furniture.json')).toString('base64');\\nconst icon = 'data:image/svg+xml,' + encodeURIComponent(\\n  '<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 16 16\\\"><rect fill=\\\"#1a1218\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\"/><path stroke=\\\"#e8443a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 2v12M2 8h12\\\"/></svg>',\\n);\\nconst description = 'A rainy harbour hospital where telling the truth is the first cut. Keep the patient alive, close the strain, and top the team score.';\\n\\nconst html = `<!doctype html>\\n30→<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>\\n${session}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>${TITLE} — ${TAGLINE}</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"${description}\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#1a1218\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"icon\\\" href=\\\"${icon}\\\">\\n40→<meta name=\\\"hub:type\\\" content=\\\"Game\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:source\\\" content=\\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Keep the patient alive and top the team score\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/mouse: move tool. R2/click: use. Right stick/1-8: pick tool.\\\">\\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#1a1218}#app{position:fixed;inset:0}</style>\\n50→</head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"app\\\"></div>\\n<script>window.__PIXEL_ASSETS__={'packs/kenney-furniture.json':'data:application/json;base64,${pack}'};</script>\\n<script type=\\\"module\\\">\\n${js}\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n`;\\n60→\\nwriteFileSync(join(dist, 'game.html'), html);\\nconst handed = join(root, '..', `${FILE_BASE}.html`);\\nwriteFileSync(handed, html);\\nfor (const name of ['harness.html', 'bridge.js', 'round.js']) {\\n  copyFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', name), join(dist, name));\\n}\\nconsole.log(handed);\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tools/build.mjs\",\"offset\":null,\"limit\":200,\"raw_output\":\"/** Bundle the clinic into one HTML page. The session client is copied verbatim. */\\nimport { execFileSync } from 'node:child_process';\\nimport { mkdirSync, readFileSync, writeFileSync, copyFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { dirname, join } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { FILE_BASE, TAGLINE, TITLE } from '../src/core/meta.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst dist = join(root, 'dist');\\nmkdirSync(dist, { recursive: true });\\n\\nexecFileSync('esbuild', [\\n  'game.js',\\n  '--bundle',\\n  '--format=esm',\\n  '--platform=browser',\\n  '--target=es2022',\\n  '--outfile=dist/bundle.js',\\n], { cwd: root, stdio: 'inherit' });\\n\\nconst js = readFileSync(join(dist, 'bundle.js'), 'utf8').replace(/<\\\\/script/gi, '<\\\\\\\\/script');\\nconst session = readFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', 'session.js'), 'utf8');\\nconst pack = readFileSync(join(root, 'packs', 'kenney-furniture.json')).toString('base64');\\nconst icon = 'data:image/svg+xml,' + encodeURIComponent(\\n  '<svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 16 16\\\"><rect fill=\\\"#1a1218\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\"/><path stroke=\\\"#e8443a\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 2v12M2 8h12\\\"/></svg>',\\n);\\nconst description = 'A rainy harbour hospital where telling the truth is the first cut. Keep the patient alive, close the strain, and top the team score.';\\n\\nconst html = `<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<script>\\n${session}</script>\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\">\\n<title>${TITLE} — ${TAGLINE}</title>\\n<meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"${description}\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"theme-color\\\" content=\\\"#1a1218\\\">\\n<link rel=\\\"icon\\\" href=\\\"${icon}\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:type\\\" content=\\\"Game\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:source\\\" content=\\\"Trauma Center: Second Opinion\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session\\\" content=\\\"1\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-players\\\" content=\\\"1-4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-mode\\\" content=\\\"shared-world\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-minutes\\\" content=\\\"4\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:webgpu\\\" content=\\\"required\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-goal\\\" content=\\\"Keep the patient alive and top the team score\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"hub:session-howto\\\" content=\\\"Stick/mouse: move tool. R2/click: use. Right stick/1-8: pick tool.\\\">\\n<style>html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:#1a1218}#app{position:fixed;inset:0}</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div id=\\\"app\\\"></div>\\n<script>window.__PIXEL_ASSETS__={'packs/kenney-furniture.json':'data:application/json;base64,${pack}'};</script>\\n<script type=\\\"module\\\">\\n${js}\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n`;\\n\\nwriteFileSync(join(dist, 'game.html'), html);\\nconst handed = join(root, '..', `${FILE_BASE}.html`);\\nwriteFileSync(handed, html);\\nfor (const name of ['harness.html', 'bridge.js', 'round.js']) {\\n  copyFileSync(join(root, 'vendor', name), join(dist, name));\\n}\\nconsole.log(handed);\\n\",\"total_lines\":67}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b98d11ac-1a5d-4391-b9e8-0ef998311aac"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_461","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The template is a script tag containing the session variable.\n\nThe template literal adds a newline after `<script>`. If the session file ends with a newline, another appears before `</script>`. The previous fix removed the gap between session bytes and the closing tag. The earlier measurements were identical, so the cause is still unclear.\n\nThe regex captured a leading newline before the session content, yielding 16708 bytes. The vendor file is 16707 bytes. The extra byte is likely that leading newline.\n\nThe previous build matched the vendor hash exactly, so the earlier extraction must have stripped the template newline. The current template still contains that newline.\n\nThe earlier identical measurement likely compared raw file bytes directly, omitting the template's leading newline. The key rule is to place `</script>` immediately after the file bytes with no intervening newline.\n\nThe template's leading newline is not part of the vendor file. The script tag should be `<script>${session}</script>` with no extra whitespace around the interpolation, only the file's own trailing newline.\n\nThe template will be changed to `<script>${session}</script>` with no newline. The browser test is already running against the current HTML, and a leading newline does not affect gameplay. The hub test hashes the script bytes, so a rebuild is needed before launching.\n\nRebuilding after the browser test would leave the verifier with a file that still contains the extra newline. The browser snapshot is already fixed by the time the page loads, so the template must be corrected now.\n\nRebuilding mid-test is risky because pages may be mid-load. The safer path is to finish the browser test first, then fix the template and rebuild. This avoids extra screenshots but still leaves the current HTML with the extra newline. Another option is to fix now and only re-run browser if the current run fails.\n\nThe template will be fixed now. The browser test should be re-run afterward so the evidence matches the rebuilt HTML exactly. Later navigations might load the new file if the browser is still early.\n\nThe browser test will be killed now. The template will be fixed and rebuilt immediately, then the test restarted. This avoids a wasted run on a file that would be replaced.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9c530dab-1aa4-418f-97aa-123ea467fab5-111","name":"run_terminal_command","input":{"command":"python3 - << 'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/vendor/session.js\")\nb = p.read_bytes()\nprint(len(b), b[:20], b[-20:])\nPY","description":"Show vendor session.js start and end bytes"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-9c530dab-1aa4-418f-97aa-123ea467fab5-112","name":"kill_command_or_subagent","input":{"task_id":"207681db-b452-45bf-bbe9-8085aa33aa45"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1126,"output_tokens":1538,"cache_read_input_tokens":155776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"bbd871b6-83dd-4469-ab19-0faa89decc4d"}
