{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_482","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Line 20 contains a waitForFunction call related to mode.\n\nMenu navigation failed. I'll add debug logging for mode and focus, use page.evaluate as a fallback if keys miss, and wait longer after load.\n\nThe game engine is ready. Enter and arrow presses likely missed because the frame-based input system dropped a single keypress. I'll retry the keyboard navigation or use the public goto method instead.\n\nI'll implement a `poke` helper that retries keyboard presses up to six times until the game reports the expected mode or focus. I'll also move the mouse to the corner first to prevent hover from interfering with focus.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0f3130ef-41e7-48ca-9e2f-d9b5934a69a8-138","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/about-shot.mjs","old_string":"await page.goto(html, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 60000 });\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__);\nawait page.keyboard.press('Enter');\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'menu');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) await page.keyboard.press('ArrowDown');\nawait page.keyboard.press('Enter');\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'about');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  if (i) await page.keyboard.press('e');\n  await page.waitForFunction((n) => window.__GAME__.app.aboutPage === n, i);\n  await page.screenshot({ path: join(out, `about-${i}.png`) });\n}","new_string":"await page.goto(html, { waitUntil: 'load', timeout: 60000 });\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__);\nawait page.mouse.move(20, 20);\nasync function poke(key, ready, arg) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n    await page.keyboard.press(key);\n    try {\n      await page.waitForFunction(ready, arg, { timeout: 700 });\n      return;\n    } catch { /* the frame can miss a short press */ }\n  }\n  const state = await page.evaluate(() => ({ mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode, focus: window.__GAME__.app.focus }));\n  throw new Error(`${key} left ${JSON.stringify(state)}`);\n}\nawait poke('Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'menu');\nfor (let n = 1; n <= 4; n++) await poke('ArrowDown', (focus) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === focus, n);\nawait poke('Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'about');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  if (i) await poke('e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.aboutPage === n, i);\n  await page.screenshot({ path: join(out, `about-${i}.png`) });\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":357,"output_tokens":1014,"cache_read_input_tokens":178560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"799ebefc-bd62-4379-821e-b93d0624c421"}
