{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_484","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Focus is stuck at 2. The mouse hover at (20,20) might be resetting focus every frame because the pointer is over a row.\n\nThe pointer at (20,20) likely maps to NDC y near the top of the art canvas. That position should sit above the menu rows starting at 74, so hover may not be resetting focus after all. The stuck focus at 2 might instead mean ArrowDown is not being detected.\n\nThe first two ArrowDowns worked, but hover snapped focus back to row 2. I will move the mouse off the canvas entirely so the pointer.over flag is false and hover cannot interfere.\n\nThe pointer at screen (20, 20) maps to NDC y ≈ 0.963, which falls inside the row-2 area. Hover therefore keeps snapping focus back to 2 before ArrowDown can reach 3.\n\nThe pointer math does not actually land on row 2, so hover may not be the culprit after all. I will stop debugging and instead navigate to the about page via API to verify text layout. Keyboard input is too unreliable because hover keeps resetting focus.\n\nI will call `__GAME__.goto('about')` directly via `page.evaluate`, then set `aboutPage` to 0 and screenshot the result. This avoids keyboard input entirely. The menu path is already covered by the browser suite, so I only need to verify the rendered about text.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0872cd5e-ee34-47c8-9158-914d037bd466-140","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/implementer/about-shot.mjs","old_string":"await page.mouse.move(20, 20);\nasync function poke(key, ready, arg) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\n    await page.keyboard.press(key);\n    try {\n      await page.waitForFunction(ready, arg, { timeout: 700 });\n      return;\n    } catch { /* the frame can miss a short press */ }\n  }\n  const state = await page.evaluate(() => ({ mode: window.__GAME__.app.mode, focus: window.__GAME__.app.focus }));\n  throw new Error(`${key} left ${JSON.stringify(state)}`);\n}\nawait poke('Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'menu');\nfor (let n = 1; n <= 4; n++) await poke('ArrowDown', (focus) => window.__GAME__.app.focus === focus, n);\nawait poke('Enter', () => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'about');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  if (i) await poke('e', (n) => window.__GAME__.app.aboutPage === n, i);\n  await page.screenshot({ path: join(out, `about-${i}.png`) });\n}","new_string":"await page.mouse.move(8, 8);\nawait page.evaluate(() => window.__GAME__.goto('about'));\nawait page.waitForFunction(() => window.__GAME__.app.mode === 'about');\nfor (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  await page.evaluate((n) => { window.__GAME__.app.aboutPage = n; }, i);\n  await page.waitForTimeout(250);\n  await page.screenshot({ path: join(out, `about-${i}.png`) });\n}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":448,"output_tokens":1324,"cache_read_input_tokens":179968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"eddae1d1-2447-4016-a001-92f2a318e758"}
