{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6566c2b7-18aa-4a63-a905-30d9f61f481b-62","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"890→    if (typeof document === 'undefined') return;\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    const idleScreens = new Set(['title', 'menu', 'call', 'log', 'consult', 'picks', 'settings', 'about']);\\n    if (!idleScreens.has(this.mode)) return;\\n    if (now() - this.idleAt >= 10000) this.startAttract();\\n  }\\n\\n  playScore(ctx) {\\n    const name = trackFor(this.mode, this.sim);\\n    if (name === this.track) return;\\n900→    this.track = name;\\n    ctx.audio.playMusic(name ? SONGS[name] : null, name || undefined);\\n  }\\n\\n  speak(ctx) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'story') return;\\n    if (this.spoken === this.line) return;\\n    this.spoken = this.line;\\n    const line = this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line];\\n    if (!line) return;\\n910→    const pitch = CAST[line.who]?.pitch || 1;\\n    const semis = Math.round(12 * Math.log2(pitch));\\n    ctx.audio.play('bark', { pitch: semis, volume: 0.4 * (this.settings.voices || 1) });\\n  }\\n\\n  speakerId() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'story') return this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line]?.who || 'ilya';\\n    if (this.mode === 'brief') return 'reyes';\\n    if (this.mode === 'card') return 'reyes';\\n    return 'ilya';\\n920→  }\\n\\n  persistSettings() {\\n    if (!this.allowStore || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    try {\\n      globalThis.localStorage?.setItem(SETTINGS_KEY, JSON.stringify(this.settings));\\n    } catch {\\n      /* private mode */\\n    }\\n  }\\n930→\\n  placeCamera(ctx) {\\n    const cam = ctx.camera?.camera;\\n    if (!cam) return;\\n    let x = 0.6;\\n    let y = 2.2;\\n    let z = 5.2;\\n    if (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'attract' || this.mode === 'session' || this.mode === 'pause' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'results') {\\n      x = 0; y = 9.6; z = 3.1;\\n      this.look.set(0, 0, 0.1);\\n940→    } else if (this.mode === 'story' || this.mode === 'brief') {\\n      x = 0; y = 1.7; z = 2.6;\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.25, -0.2);\\n    } else {\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.2, -0.5);\\n    }\\n    cam.position.set(x, y, z);\\n    cam.lookAt(this.look);\\n  }\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"890→    if (typeof document === 'undefined') return;\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    const idleScreens = new Set(['title', 'menu', 'call', 'log', 'consult', 'picks', 'settings', 'about']);\\n    if (!idleScreens.has(this.mode)) return;\\n    if (now() - this.idleAt >= 10000) this.startAttract();\\n  }\\n\\n  playScore(ctx) {\\n    const name = trackFor(this.mode, this.sim);\\n    if (name === this.track) return;\\n900→    this.track = name;\\n    ctx.audio.playMusic(name ? SONGS[name] : null, name || undefined);\\n  }\\n\\n  speak(ctx) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'story') return;\\n    if (this.spoken === this.line) return;\\n    this.spoken = this.line;\\n    const line = this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line];\\n    if (!line) return;\\n910→    const pitch = CAST[line.who]?.pitch || 1;\\n    const semis = Math.round(12 * Math.log2(pitch));\\n    ctx.audio.play('bark', { pitch: semis, volume: 0.4 * (this.settings.voices || 1) });\\n  }\\n\\n  speakerId() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'story') return this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line]?.who || 'ilya';\\n    if (this.mode === 'brief') return 'reyes';\\n    if (this.mode === 'card') return 'reyes';\\n    return 'ilya';\\n920→  }\\n\\n  persistSettings() {\\n    if (!this.allowStore || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    try {\\n      globalThis.localStorage?.setItem(SETTINGS_KEY, JSON.stringify(this.settings));\\n    } catch {\\n      /* private mode */\\n    }\\n  }\\n930→\\n  placeCamera(ctx) {\\n    const cam = ctx.camera?.camera;\\n    if (!cam) return;\\n    let x = 0.6;\\n    let y = 2.2;\\n    let z = 5.2;\\n    if (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'attract' || this.mode === 'session' || this.mode === 'pause' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'results') {\\n      x = 0; y = 9.6; z = 3.1;\\n      this.look.set(0, 0, 0.1);\\n940→    } else if (this.mode === 'story' || this.mode === 'brief') {\\n      x = 0; y = 1.7; z = 2.6;\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.25, -0.2);\\n    } else {\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.2, -0.5);\\n    }\\n    cam.position.set(x, y, z);\\n    cam.lookAt(this.look);\\n  }\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js\",\"offset\":890,\"limit\":60,\"raw_output\":\"    if (typeof document === 'undefined') return;\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    const idleScreens = new Set(['title', 'menu', 'call', 'log', 'consult', 'picks', 'settings', 'about']);\\n    if (!idleScreens.has(this.mode)) return;\\n    if (now() - this.idleAt >= 10000) this.startAttract();\\n  }\\n\\n  playScore(ctx) {\\n    const name = trackFor(this.mode, this.sim);\\n    if (name === this.track) return;\\n    this.track = name;\\n    ctx.audio.playMusic(name ? SONGS[name] : null, name || undefined);\\n  }\\n\\n  speak(ctx) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'story') return;\\n    if (this.spoken === this.line) return;\\n    this.spoken = this.line;\\n    const line = this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line];\\n    if (!line) return;\\n    const pitch = CAST[line.who]?.pitch || 1;\\n    const semis = Math.round(12 * Math.log2(pitch));\\n    ctx.audio.play('bark', { pitch: semis, volume: 0.4 * (this.settings.voices || 1) });\\n  }\\n\\n  speakerId() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'story') return this.scene()?.lines?.[this.line]?.who || 'ilya';\\n    if (this.mode === 'brief') return 'reyes';\\n    if (this.mode === 'card') return 'reyes';\\n    return 'ilya';\\n  }\\n\\n  persistSettings() {\\n    if (!this.allowStore || this.mode === 'attract') return;\\n    try {\\n      globalThis.localStorage?.setItem(SETTINGS_KEY, JSON.stringify(this.settings));\\n    } catch {\\n      /* private mode */\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  placeCamera(ctx) {\\n    const cam = ctx.camera?.camera;\\n    if (!cam) return;\\n    let x = 0.6;\\n    let y = 2.2;\\n    let z = 5.2;\\n    if (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'attract' || this.mode === 'session' || this.mode === 'pause' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'results') {\\n      x = 0; y = 9.6; z = 3.1;\\n      this.look.set(0, 0, 0.1);\\n    } else if (this.mode === 'story' || this.mode === 'brief') {\\n      x = 0; y = 1.7; z = 2.6;\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.25, -0.2);\\n    } else {\\n      this.look.set(0, 1.2, -0.5);\\n    }\\n    cam.position.set(x, y, z);\\n    cam.lookAt(this.look);\\n  }\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":975}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"a5041021-9e61-4224-97ea-385c869a67cb"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_529","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Camera position and lookAt calls are no-ops in shellCtx.\n\nplayMusic is also a no-op. I will edit seatInput, applySnap, and pullSession for clarity and behavior, then add tests to testHands. I also spotted a potential ordering bug in readInput where humanInput might be built for the wrong device.\n\nThe readInput ordering is safe because fixedUpdate uses the previous frame. The couch test correctly routes humanInput to drive 0 and pad inputs to drives 1 and 2. I will now write the code changes.\n\nI will update PROGRESS.md after the run to reflect the new test count. I am adding four checks for pad-to-mouse and pad-to-key input draining, plus dev menu and spawn actions via keys. I will also add a test covering dev frame stepping through Enter on the view tab.\n\nI am designing a single clinic flow that covers all three dev actions: jumping stages, spawning the pool, and frame stepping. The test will begin in pause mode, enter dev mode, jump to stage 2, then return to dev mode after the jump.\n\nThe clinic flow now includes the full sequence: after jumping stages, it returns to dev mode, switches to Actions to spawn the pool, then to View to frame step. I am carefully verifying focus and list lengths at each step.\n\nThe clinic flow now has exact indices. Stage jump targets index 1. Spawn pool is at list index 4. View tab rows are HITBOXES, BOT PLAYS, BOT SKILL, SIM SPEED, FRAME STEP. I will also verify sim speed with ArrowRight.\n\nI am designing a test to verify the \"last device sticks\" behavior. The test will simulate a mouse input with movement on the first frame, then hold an idle pad across many frames. It checks that the device remains mouse and does not flip back to pad because of pad activity.\n\nThe \"last device sticks\" test is confirmed correct. Pointer coordinates remain identical across frames, so pointerMoved stays false and pads.any stays false, keeping the device as mouse. The getGamepads stub must remain active for all frames. I will override camera.rayAt to ensure the ray hits the pool. I am trusting the existing session test's aimOnSurface logic.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85f97ed2-124e-4820-b959-9a2e69ba2c23-63","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"tool: 'drain'|unlocked|startTool|seats:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","head_limit":30}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-85f97ed2-124e-4820-b959-9a2e69ba2c23-64","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"id: 'p1'|tool:","path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js","head_limit":20}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":895,"output_tokens":1574,"cache_read_input_tokens":115072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"b9f79bd0-56f8-4a67-937e-aca9e9a2f9b0"}
