{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_556","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The rebuilt page passed the launch, hub, and package checks.\n\nTwo `file://` loads of the root HTML agree. Music is 0.1, the canvas fills 960×540 with no offset, and a scripted drain takes the same pool from radius 0.7 to done. Both frames show VITALS 85, the clock at 3:59, and DRN on the forearm. There were no page or GPU errors. `AIHub.active` is false.\n\nAll five hub harness URLs passed with zero page errors: 2 players, 3 players with latency, jitter, and loss, 4 players with loss, host-leave, and the server copy. The test server on port 34741 was stopped.\n\n`pixel-engine.js` matches the zip, and the embedded session client matches `vendor/session.js` (16707 bytes, same sha256) in both the root HTML and `dist/game.html`. `sourceInformation.usage` is `added on import`, and `python3 -m json.tool` matches the dump in `package.txt`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":891,"output_tokens":243,"cache_read_input_tokens":148480,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"f0f5d882-81c6-4783-97f8-8b1e4e8ced12"}
