ut, session applySnap/pullSession, and Dev Mode against the three skeptic gaps\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"2\":{\"content\":\"No remaining last-device, session-hand, or Dev Mode gaps in shipped code\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"3\":{\"content\":\"Shipped hand and session tests passed; scratch evidence is present\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"4\":{\"content\":\"Story, voices, music, results, saves for episodes 1-3\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"5\":{\"content\":\"Fix pad vs last-device aim in fixedUpdate\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"6\":{\"content\":\"Remaining ops, Second Look, strains, campaign playthrough\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"7\":{\"content\":\"Fix session client/host hand movement\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"8\":{\"content\":\"Add Dev Mode stage, scene, frame step, FPS, spawn tools\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"9\":{\"content\":\"Rebuild, retest browser/launch/hub, refresh evidence\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"10\":{\"content\":\"Confirm scratch evidence matches the current HTML\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"11\":{\"content\":\"Match exit-interview.json usage field to the TASK.md schema path\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"12\":{\"content\":\"Package check prints sourceInformation.usage as added on import\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"13\":{\"content\":\"Rebuilt HTML; node suite 149 passed; browser 16 passed\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"14\":{\"content\":\"Re-run two file:// launches and save launch.txt plus screenshots\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"15\":{\"content\":\"Re-run the five hub harness URLs and save hub.txt\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"completed\"},\"16\":{\"content\":\"package.txt hashes match and 