{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_561","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Those three bugs are not in the current source. `node tests/run.mjs hands` passed again: **32 passed, 0 failed**.\n\n`fixedUpdate` builds each seat with `seatInput`. The drive seat uses the mouse or the keys unless the pad was the last device, so an idle connected pad does not take the aim. The same path, through `readInput` with a live pad stub, drains the pool and moves on WASD.\n\nIn a session, `update` reads input, `pullSession` keeps an aimed `x` and `z`, and `predictLocal` moves the client tip with `predictSeat`. `applySnap` eases that seat only when the snapshot is more than 1 unit away. The host timer steps `state.local`, so a host place-aim reaches the sim.\n\nDev Mode’s jump list cycles operations, stages, and story scenes. Actions include complete, win, fail, Code Blue, and spawns for a pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, and strain. View has hitboxes, Bot Plays, skill, sim speed, frame step, FPS, and the sim line. Opening Dev Mode from pause and stepping those rows through the keyboard is part of the 32."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":571,"output_tokens":277,"cache_read_input_tokens":158208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"bf5ce536-b88b-492e-94d3-24112324e190"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_562","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I will read STAGE.md and follow its instructions to complete the remaining tasks.\n\nThe evaluator requires tests for clinic.js and session.js that assert rejected behaviors and Dev Mode features. These tests already pass. The next step is to rebuild the root HTML and run the full test suite into scratch tests.txt.\n\nI am auditing the existing tests to confirm they cover all seven required behaviors. The Dev Mode spawn test uses pickDev to create bleeder, laceration, hook, and strain individually rather than just a pool.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The three behaviors are already in the shipped clinic and session code. I’ll check the tests cover every rejected case, then rebuild and save a full `node tests/run.mjs` log."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44cad6b2-6501-4c29-8469-d1892124696b-115","name":"todo_write","input":{"todos":[{"id":"19","content":"Confirm tests assert idle-pad aim, session hands, and Dev Mode tools","status":"in_progress"},{"id":"20","content":"Rebuild root HTML and save full node tests/run.mjs to tests.txt","status":"pending"}],"merge":true}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-44cad6b2-6501-4c29-8469-d1892124696b-116","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/run.mjs","offset":491,"limit":220}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26100,"output_tokens":1170,"cache_read_input_tokens":132992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"adf07f4a-1eda-452b-b419-f9332585fdcb"}
