{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_578","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"34 new tests passed. Prior gaps are fixed.\n\nIdle pad yields to mouse and keyboard input. Client tip follows mouse and keyboard with the same integrator as sticks. Host place-aim reaches the simulation. applySnap eases large drift while preserving small drift. pullSession no longer overwrites aimed x/z. Dev mode from pause supports stage jumps, scene jumps, frame stepping, FPS, sim stats, and spawning pools, bleaders, lacerations, hooks, and strains through the real confirm path. The HTML bundle contains identical logic. No regressions were found.\n\nThe full suite reports 151 passed tests. The prior gaps are fixed and not refuted. I will write the JSON and markdown files with a brief explanation, an empty findings array, and high confidence.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-e45c2305-7f3e-4b35-b045-9045ed0b9d06-102","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/tmp/grok-goal-9c48352445aa/goal-verdict-9c48352445aa-2-0.json","content":"{\n  \"refuted\": false,\n  \"findings\": [],\n  \"evidence\": \"clinic.js:320 seatInput yields to mouse/key; session.js:76 eases only drift > 1 and clinic.js:455 keeps aimed x/z; pickDev jumps stage/scene, frame-steps, and spawns five kinds. node tests/run.mjs hands → 34 passed; tests.txt 151 passed. Root HTML contains predictSeat and FRAME STEP.\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"blocking\": \"none\",\n  \"details_md\": \"Not refuted. All three prior gaps are fixed in the shipped source and the root HTML, and the new tests drive those paths.\\n\\n**Idle pad no longer steals the tool.** `seatInput` (`clinic.js:327`) returns `humanInput` when the last device is not the pad. `testHandsOnInput` installs a connected idle `getGamepads` stub, then `update` + `fixedUpdate` drain a pool with the mouse and move the seat 