gs, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\"},{\"line_number\":492,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\"},{\"line_number\":743,\"content\":\"**Dev Mode sliders (live, with Reset to Defaults).** All in `config.js`:\"},{\"line_number\":796,\"content\":\"- Prompts switch with the last device; the Xbox option swaps glyphs.\"},{\"line_number\":800,\"content\":\"- Pause, then Dev Mode: a slider changes live config; reset restores it.\"},{\"line_number\":856,\"content\":\"5. **The shell.** Title, menus, prompts, settings, pause, Dev Mode, attract, touch gate, About.\"},{\"line_number\":870,\"content\":\"Never cut: Ops 1, 2, 5, 8, 9; both gifts; Code Blue; attract; Dev Mode; hub conformance; couch co-op.\"},{\"line_number\":885,\"content\":\"| Infrastructure for more content with normal tools | §11, `docs/AUTHORING.md`, Dev Mode's Copy Op JSON |\"},{\"line_number\":886,\"content\":\"| Dev mode from pause, live sliders, reset | §8, §12 |\"},{\"line_number\":887,\"content\":\"| Attract after 10 s, any input exits | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":888,\"content\":\"| Controller-first at 10 feet, native keyboard and mouse, prompts by last input, Xbox option | §4, §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":889,\"content\":\"| No dense data screens | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":890,\"content\":\"| Touch-only gate, settings button, attract runs | §8 |\"},{\"line_number\":893,\"content\":\"| Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback in chat and About; exit interview | §8, §14, your brief |\"}]}]}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-906811e3-5916-46f9-8e7c-3ca511559ca8-2","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99