{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_583","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-3","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js","offset":140,"limit":450}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e29b7cf-ab32-4ca9-b1a5-d5d129eea4b8-4","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/net/session.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-4","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/net/session.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3e29b7cf-ab32-4ca9-b1a5-d5d129eea4b8-5","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md","offset":470,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-5","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md","offset":470,"limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3328,"output_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":31744,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"886d4a7f-adcc-4f5f-a2ed-c0546833881c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e29b7cf-ab32-4ca9-b1a5-d5d129eea4b8-3","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"140→    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n150→      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n160→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n190→    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n200→  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n210→  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n220→    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n230→    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n240→  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n250→    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n260→    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n270→      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n280→    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n290→        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n300→    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n310→    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n320→  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n330→    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n340→  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n350→      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n360→    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n370→    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n380→    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n390→    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n400→    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n410→      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n420→\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n430→    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n440→    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n450→      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n460→    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n470→  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n480→    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n490→    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n500→    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n510→    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n520→    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n530→    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n540→    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n550→    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n560→    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n570→      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n580→    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\",\"content_concise\":\"140→    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n150→      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n160→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n190→    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n200→  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n210→  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n220→    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n230→    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n240→  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n250→    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n260→    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n270→      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n280→    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n290→        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n300→    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n310→    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n320→  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n330→    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n340→  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n350→      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n360→    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n370→    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n380→    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n390→    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n400→    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n410→      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n420→\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n430→    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n440→    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n450→      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n460→    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n470→  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n480→    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n490→    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n500→    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n510→    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n520→    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n530→    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n540→    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n550→    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n560→    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n570→      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n580→    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js\",\"offset\":140,\"limit\":450,\"raw_output\":\"    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n\",\"total_lines\":981}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-3","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"140→    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n150→      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n160→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n190→    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n200→  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n210→  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n220→    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n230→    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n240→  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n250→    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n260→    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n270→      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n280→    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n290→        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n300→    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n310→    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n320→  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n330→    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n340→  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n350→      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n360→    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n370→    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n380→    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n390→    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n400→    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n410→      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n420→\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n430→    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n440→    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n450→      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n460→    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n470→  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n480→    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n490→    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n500→    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n510→    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n520→    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n530→    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n540→    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n550→    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n560→    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n570→      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n580→    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\",\"content_concise\":\"140→    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n150→      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n160→\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n170→    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n180→    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n190→    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n200→  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n210→  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n220→    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n230→    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n240→  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n250→    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n260→    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n270→      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n280→    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n290→        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n300→    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n310→    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n320→  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n330→    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n340→  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n350→      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n360→    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n370→    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n380→    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n390→    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n400→    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n410→      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n420→\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n430→    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n440→    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n450→      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n460→    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n470→  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n480→    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n490→    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n500→    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n510→    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n520→    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n530→    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n540→    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n550→    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n560→    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n570→      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n580→    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/game/clinic.js\",\"offset\":140,\"limit\":450,\"raw_output\":\"    const game = this;\\n    const api = {\\n      app: game,\\n      get sim() { return game.sim; },\\n      goto: (mode) => game.goto(mode),\\n      config: getConfig(),\\n      act: (input) => game.act(input),\\n      get prompts() { return game.promptState(); },\\n      get music() { return ctx.audio.volume.music; },\\n      get art() { return { w: ctx.hud.width, h: ctx.hud.height }; },\\n      engine: ctx.engine,\\n    };\\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') window.__GAME__ = api;\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      const poke = () => globalThis.AIHub?.ready?.();\\n      poke();\\n      this.readyTimer = setInterval(poke, 250);\\n      setTimeout(() => clearInterval(this.readyTimer), 18000);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  fixedUpdate(ctx, dt) {\\n    if (this.session) return;\\n    if (this.simHold) return;\\n    if (this.mode !== 'op' && this.mode !== 'attract') return;\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    const speed = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : this.simSpeed;\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, dt);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, dt * speed);\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract') {\\n      this.reelT += dt;\\n      if (this.reelT > 12 || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') this.nextReel();\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  update(ctx, dt) {\\n    this.ctx = ctx;\\n    this.pulse += dt;\\n    this.swallowed = false;\\n    if (dt > 0) this.fps = this.fps ? this.fps * 0.85 + (1 / dt) * 0.15 : 1 / dt;\\n    if (this.session) this.syncSessionMode();\\n    this.readInput(ctx);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.pullSession();\\n      this.predictLocal(dt);\\n    }\\n    if ((this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'dev' || this.mode === 'pause') && this.sim && (this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost')) this.mode = 'results';\\n    this.maybeAttract();\\n    this.playScore(ctx);\\n    this.speak(ctx);\\n    this.speaker = this.speakerId();\\n    if (this.view) syncView(this.view, this, this.pulse);\\n    this.placeCamera(ctx);\\n    drawHud(ctx, this);\\n    ctx.input.gamepadButtons = {};\\n  }\\n\\n  cameraTarget() {\\n    return this.look;\\n  }\\n\\n  status() {\\n    if (!this.sim) return `${this.mode} focus=${this.focus}`;\\n    const vitals = Math.round(this.sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? this.sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `${this.sim.id} stage=${this.sim.stageIndex} vitals=${vitals} t=${Math.floor(this.sim.timeLeft)} score=${Math.floor(this.sim.score)}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  fingerprint() {\\n    return `${this.mode}|${this.focus}|${this.line}|${this.sim ? hashSim(this.sim) : '0'}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  dispose() {\\n    if (this.readyTimer) clearInterval(this.readyTimer);\\n    this.session?.silence?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  act(input = {}) {\\n    if (!this.sim) return null;\\n    const seat = input.seat ?? 0;\\n    const body = { ...input };\\n    delete body.seat;\\n    step(this.sim, { [seat]: body }, 1 / 60);\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  goto(mode) {\\n    if ((mode === 'pause' || mode === 'dev') && !this.sim) return;\\n    this.mode = mode;\\n    this.focus = 0;\\n    if (mode === 'dev') this.devTab = 0;\\n  }\\n\\n  promptState() {\\n    const confirm = promptConfirm(this.device, this.settings.glyphs);\\n    return { confirm, device: this.device, glyphs: this.settings.glyphs };\\n  }\\n\\n  promptName() {\\n    return this.promptState().confirm;\\n  }\\n\\n  scene() {\\n    return SCENES[this.sceneIndex] || null;\\n  }\\n\\n  listTitle() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return 'ON CALL';\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return 'OPERATING LOG';\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return 'CONSULT';\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return 'PICK A CASE';\\n    return 'MAIN';\\n  }\\n\\n  listItems() {\\n    if (this.mode === 'menu') return MENU;\\n    if (this.mode === 'call') return [`DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`, 'NEW SHIFT', 'CONTINUE'];\\n    if (this.mode === 'log') return this.logItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'consult') return this.consultItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'picks') return this.pickItems();\\n    if (this.mode === 'settings') return this.settingsRows();\\n    if (this.mode === 'pause') return PAUSE;\\n    if (this.mode === 'dev') return this.devRows();\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n\\n  settingsRows() {\\n    const music = Math.round((this.ctx?.audio?.volume?.music ?? this.settings.music) * 100);\\n    return [\\n      `GLYPHS ${this.settings.glyphs === 'xbox' ? 'XBOX' : 'PLAYSTATION'}`,\\n      `MUSIC ${music}%`,\\n      `SOUND ${Math.round(this.settings.sound * 100)}%`,\\n      `VOICES ${Math.round(this.settings.voices * 100)}%`,\\n      `RUMBLE ${this.settings.rumble ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n      `DIFFICULTY ${this.settings.difficulty}`,\\n      'RESET',\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  devRows() {\\n    if (this.devTab === 1) return CHEATS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 2) return this.jumpRows();\\n    if (this.devTab === 3) return ACTIONS.map((row) => row[1]);\\n    if (this.devTab === 4) {\\n      return [\\n        `HITBOXES ${this.hitbox ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT PLAYS ${this.forceBot ? 'ON' : 'OFF'}`,\\n        `BOT SKILL ${this.botSkill.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        `SIM SPEED ${this.simSpeed.toFixed(1)}`,\\n        'FRAME STEP',\\n        `FPS ${Math.round(this.fps || 0)}`,\\n        this.simLine(),\\n      ];\\n    }\\n    const rows = Object.keys(DEFAULTS).map((key) => `${key} ${trimNum(getConfig()[key])}`);\\n    rows.push('RESET');\\n    return rows;\\n  }\\n\\n  jumpRows() {\\n    const kind = this.jumpKind || 'op';\\n    if (kind === 'stage') {\\n      const n = this.sim?.stages?.length || 1;\\n      const rows = ['LIST STAGES'];\\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) rows.push(`STAGE ${i}`);\\n      return rows;\\n    }\\n    if (kind === 'scene') return ['LIST SCENES', ...SCENES.map((scene) => scene.title)];\\n    const pile = opById('pile');\\n    const ops = pile ? STORY_OPS.concat([pile]) : STORY_OPS;\\n    return ['LIST OPS', ...ops.map((op) => op.title)];\\n  }\\n\\n  simLine() {\\n    const sim = this.sim;\\n    if (!sim) return 'SIM NONE';\\n    const vitals = Math.round(sim.tables?.[0]?.vitals ?? sim.vitals ?? 0);\\n    return `SIM ${sim.phase} V ${vitals} T ${Math.floor(sim.timeLeft)} SC ${Math.floor(sim.score)} M ${sim.mistakes}`;\\n  }\\n\\n  seatInput(i, dt) {\\n    const seat = this.sim.seats[i];\\n    const skill = this.mode === 'attract' ? 1 : (this.forceBot ? this.botSkill : (seat.botSkill || this.botSkill));\\n    const human = seat.human && this.mode !== 'attract' && !this.forceBot;\\n    if (!human) return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n    const pad = this.padInputs[i];\\n    const drive = i === this.drive;\\n    const lastIsPad = this.device === 'pad';\\n    if (drive && !lastIsPad) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (lastIsPad && pad) return pad;\\n    if (drive) return this.humanInput || {};\\n    if (pad) return pad;\\n    return botInput(this.sim, i, skill, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  frameStep() {\\n    if (!this.sim || this.sim.phase === 'won' || this.sim.phase === 'lost') return;\\n    const inputs = {};\\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sim.seats.length; i++) inputs[i] = this.seatInput(i, 1 / 60);\\n    step(this.sim, inputs, (1 / 60) * (this.simSpeed || 1));\\n  }\\n\\n  pauseItems() {\\n    return PAUSE;\\n  }\\n\\n  logItems() {\\n    const save = readSave();\\n    const rows = STORY_OPS.map((op) => {\\n      const rec = save?.ops?.[op.id];\\n      return rec ? `${op.title}  ${rec.rank || '-'}` : `${op.title}  LOCKED`;\\n    });\\n    return rows.length ? rows : ['NO CHARTS YET'];\\n  }\\n\\n  consultItems() {\\n    return [0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => `SEAT ${i + 1}  ${this.joined[i] ? 'IN' : 'OUT'}`).concat(['START']);\\n  }\\n\\n  pickItems() {\\n    return this.choices().map((id) => opById(id)?.title || id);\\n  }\\n\\n  aboutLines() {\\n    return aboutPageLines(this.aboutPage);\\n  }\\n\\n  followLine() {\\n    const rank = this.sim?.rank || 'C';\\n    const pack = this.opDef?.reyes || this.opDef?.follow || {};\\n    if (typeof pack === 'string') return pack;\\n    return pack[rank] || pack.S || 'Chart closed.';\\n  }\\n\\n  applyUrl() {\\n    const q = pageQuery();\\n    if (q.get('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    if (q.get('attract') === '1') {\\n      this.startAttract();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('op')) {\\n      this.beginOp(q.get('op'), { fromUrl: true, q, consult: Number(q.get('seats') || 1) > 1 });\\n      if (q.get('dev') === '1') { this.mode = 'dev'; this.devTab = 0; }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (q.get('scene')) {\\n      const index = SCENES.findIndex((scene) => scene.id === q.get('scene'));\\n      this.enterScene(index < 0 ? 0 : index, false);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    this.mode = 'title';\\n  }\\n\\n  beginOp(defOrId, opts = {}) {\\n    const def = typeof defOrId === 'string' ? opById(defOrId) : defOrId;\\n    if (!def) return null;\\n    this.opDef = def;\\n    const q = opts.q;\\n    const seed = Number(q?.get?.('seed') ?? opts.seed ?? 1);\\n    const seats = Number(q?.get?.('seats') ?? opts.seats ?? 1);\\n    const difficulty = q?.get?.('diff') || opts.difficulty || this.settings.difficulty || 'resident';\\n    if (q?.get?.('bot') === '0') this.forceBot = false;\\n    else this.forceBot = q?.get?.('bot') === '1' || !!opts.bot;\\n    if (opts.fromUrl && q?.get?.('hold') === '1') this.simHold = true;\\n    applySlider('aimAssist', this.settings.aim);\\n    applySlider('cursorSpeed', this.settings.cursor);\\n    this.sim = createOp(def, {\\n      seed: Number.isFinite(seed) ? seed : 1,\\n      seats: Math.max(1, seats || 1),\\n      difficulty,\\n      god: q?.get?.('god') === '1' || !!opts.god,\\n      consult: !!opts.consult,\\n    });\\n    const stage = Number(q?.get?.('stage'));\\n    if (Number.isFinite(stage) && q?.get?.('stage') != null) devCheat(this.sim, 'stage', stage);\\n    this.opOpts = { seed, seats, difficulty, god: !!opts.god, consult: !!opts.consult };\\n    if (this.mode !== 'attract' && this.mode !== 'results' && this.mode !== 'dev') this.mode = 'op';\\n    return this.sim;\\n  }\\n\\n  onKey(ev) {\\n    if (!this.session || (this.mode !== 'card' && this.mode !== 'session')) return;\\n    if (ev.key === 'Enter') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (ev.key === 'm' || ev.key === 'M') globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n    if (ev.key === 'Escape') ev.preventDefault?.();\\n  }\\n\\n  syncSessionMode() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || !this.session) return;\\n    this.cardPlayers = hub.players || [];\\n    const t = hub.time?.() ?? -Infinity;\\n    if (this.session.sim) this.sim = this.session.sim;\\n    if (!this.session.ended && t >= 0 && this.sim) this.mode = 'session';\\n    else if (!this.session.ended) this.mode = 'card';\\n    this.session.me = hub.me;\\n  }\\n\\n  pullSession() {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub) return;\\n    this.syncSessionMode();\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    const seat = this.sim?.seats?.[me];\\n    const aim = this.humanInput || {};\\n    const aimedX = aim.x;\\n    const aimedZ = aim.z;\\n    const local = {\\n      sx: aim.sx || 0,\\n      sz: aim.sz || 0,\\n      use: !!aim.use,\\n      gift: !!aim.gift,\\n      steady: !!aim.steady,\\n      tool: aim.tool || seat?.tool || 'forceps',\\n      place: !!aim.place,\\n      x: aimedX != null ? aimedX : (seat?.x ?? 0),\\n      z: aimedZ != null ? aimedZ : (seat?.z ?? 0),\\n    };\\n    if (aim.seek) local.seek = true;\\n    this.session.local = local;\\n    this.session.me = me;\\n  }\\n\\n  predictLocal(dt) {\\n    const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\\n    if (!hub || hub.isHost || !this.sim || this.mode !== 'session') return;\\n    const me = hub.me;\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(me)) return;\\n    predictSeat(this.sim, me, this.session.local || {}, dt);\\n  }\\n\\n  readInput(ctx) {\\n    const input = ctx.input;\\n    const pads = sampleAll(this.padMemory);\\n    const key = this.anyKey(input);\\n    const click = input.wasPressed('MouseLeft');\\n    const right = input.wasPressed('MouseRight');\\n    const moved = Math.hypot(input.mouseDelta?.x || 0, input.mouseDelta?.y || 0) > 0.4;\\n    const px = input.pointer?.x;\\n    const py = input.pointer?.y;\\n    const pointerMoved = this.lastPx != null && px != null && (Math.abs(px - this.lastPx) > 0.002 || Math.abs(py - this.lastPy) > 0.002);\\n    if (px != null) {\\n      this.lastPx = px;\\n      this.lastPy = py;\\n    }\\n    const pointed = moved || pointerMoved;\\n    if (key) this.device = 'key';\\n    else if (click || right || pointed) this.device = 'mouse';\\n    else if (pads.any) this.device = 'pad';\\n    const button = key || click || right || pads.any;\\n    if (this.holdOff) {\\n      if (button || moved) return;\\n      this.holdOff = false;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'attract' && (button || pointed)) {\\n      this.exitAttract();\\n      this.holdOff = true;\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (button || pointed) this.idleAt = now();\\n    this.buildSeatInputs(input, pads);\\n    if (this.session) {\\n      this.readCard(input, pads);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (this.mode === 'title') {\\n      if (button) this.goto('menu');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    const count = this.listItems().length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowDown') || input.wasPressed('KeyS') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.down)) this.bump(1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('ArrowUp') || input.wasPressed('KeyW') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.up)) this.bump(-1, count);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('End')) this.focus = Math.max(0, count - 1);\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Home')) this.focus = 0;\\n    if (pointed && !key) this.hover(input, count);\\n    const confirm = input.wasPressed('Enter') || input.wasPressed('Space') || click || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge);\\n    const back = input.wasPressed('Escape') || right || pads.pads.some((p) => p.back);\\n    const left = input.wasPressed('ArrowLeft') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.left);\\n    const rightEdge = input.wasPressed('ArrowRight') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.right);\\n    const tabL = input.wasPressed('KeyQ') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.l1);\\n    const tabR = input.wasPressed('KeyE') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.r1);\\n    if (pads.pads.some((p) => p.options) || (input.wasPressed('Escape') && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'pause'))) {\\n      this.togglePause();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (left) this.nudge(-1);\\n    if (rightEdge) this.nudge(1);\\n    if (tabL) this.tab(-1);\\n    if (tabR) this.tab(1);\\n    if (back && this.mode !== 'op') this.back();\\n    else if (confirm) this.confirm();\\n    pads.pads.forEach((pad) => {\\n      if (pad.useEdge && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = true;\\n      if (pad.back && this.mode === 'consult') this.joined[pad.index] = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  buildSeatInputs(input, pads) {\\n    this.padInputs = {};\\n    for (const pad of pads.pads) {\\n      const row = { sx: pad.sx, sz: pad.sz, use: pad.use, gift: pad.gift, steady: pad.steady };\\n      if (pad.tool) row.tool = pad.tool;\\n      if (pad.left) row.table = Math.max(0, (this.sim?.active || 0) - 1);\\n      if (pad.right) row.table = (this.sim?.active || 0) + 1;\\n      this.padInputs[pad.index] = row;\\n      if (this.settings.rumble && pad.use) this.rumble(pad.index);\\n    }\\n    const row = { sx: 0, sz: 0, use: false, gift: false, steady: false };\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyA') || input.isDown('ArrowLeft')) row.sx -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyD') || input.isDown('ArrowRight')) row.sx += 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyW') || input.isDown('ArrowUp')) row.sz -= 1;\\n    if (input.isDown('KeyS') || input.isDown('ArrowDown')) row.sz += 1;\\n    row.use = input.isDown('MouseLeft') || input.isDown('KeyJ');\\n    row.gift = input.isDown('Space');\\n    row.steady = input.isDown('ShiftLeft') || input.isDown('ShiftRight');\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) row.tool = TOOLS[n - 1];\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyQ')) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[this.drive]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + 7) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wheel) {\\n      const cur = toolIndex(row.tool || this.sim?.seats?.[0]?.tool || 'drain');\\n      row.tool = TOOLS[(cur + (input.wheel > 0 ? 1 : 7)) % 8];\\n    }\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Tab') && this.sim) row.table = ((this.sim.active || 0) + 1) % this.sim.tables.length;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyE') && this.sim?.def?.partner && this.mode === 'op') this.drive = this.drive ? 0 : 1;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyF')) row.tool = 'syringe';\\n    if (this.device === 'mouse' && this.sim && this.ctx?.camera?.rayAt && (this.mode === 'op' || this.mode === 'session')) {\\n      this.ctx.camera.rayAt(input.pointer.x, input.pointer.y, this.rayO, this.rayD);\\n      const hit = aimOnSurface(this.sim.arena || 'forearm', this.rayO, this.rayD, this.pulse);\\n      row.place = true;\\n      row.x = hit.x;\\n      row.z = hit.z;\\n    }\\n    if (this.device === 'pad' && this.padInputs[0]) this.humanInput = { ...this.padInputs[0], ...row.tool ? { tool: row.tool } : {} };\\n    else this.humanInput = row;\\n  }\\n\\n  anyKey(input) {\\n    const keys = ['Enter', 'Space', 'Escape', 'ArrowUp', 'ArrowDown', 'ArrowLeft', 'ArrowRight', 'KeyW', 'KeyA', 'KeyS', 'KeyD', 'KeyE', 'KeyQ', 'KeyJ', 'KeyK', 'KeyF', 'KeyM', 'Tab', 'Home', 'End'];\\n    if (keys.some((key) => input.wasPressed(key))) return true;\\n    for (let n = 1; n <= 8; n++) if (input.wasPressed(String(n))) return true;\\n    return false;\\n  }\\n\\n  readCard(input, pads) {\\n    if (this.mode !== 'card') return;\\n    if (input.wasPressed('Enter') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.useEdge)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('ready');\\n    if (input.wasPressed('KeyM') || pads.pads.some((p) => p.triangle)) globalThis.AIHub?.answer?.('more');\\n\",\"total_lines\":981}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e29b7cf-ab32-4ca9-b1a5-d5d129eea4b8-4","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n10→  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n20→  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n30→  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n40→\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n50→      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\n60→function beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n70→  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n80→        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n90→  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n100→  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n110→    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n120→    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n130→    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n140→    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n150→        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n160→  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n170→  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n180→    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n190→          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n200→        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n210→        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n220→      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n230→    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n240→  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n10→  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n20→  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n30→  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n40→\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n50→      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\n60→function beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n70→  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n80→        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n90→  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n100→  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n110→    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n120→    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n130→    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n140→    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n150→        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n160→  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n170→  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n180→    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n190→          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n200→        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n210→        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n220→      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n230→    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n240→  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/net/session.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\nfunction beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":242}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-4","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n10→  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n20→  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n30→  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n40→\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n50→      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\n60→function beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n70→  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n80→        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n90→  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n100→  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n110→    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n120→    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n130→    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n140→    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n150→        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n160→  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n170→  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n180→    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n190→          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n200→        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n210→        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n220→      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n230→    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n240→  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n10→  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n20→  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n30→  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n40→\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n50→      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\n60→function beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n70→  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n80→        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n90→  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n100→  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n110→    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n120→    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n130→    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n140→    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n150→        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n160→  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n170→  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n180→    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n190→          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n200→        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n210→        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n220→      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n230→    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n240→  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/net/session.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"/** Shared-world host loop. The server copy runs this and never starts the renderer. */\\n\\nimport { applyDecoded, encodeFast, encodeKey } from '../sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, step } from '../sim/op.js';\\nimport { SESSION_OPS } from '../content/ops.js';\\n\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\n\\nexport function buildStandings(players, scoreOf) {\\n  const scores = {};\\n  const ids = [];\\n  for (const p of players || []) {\\n    if (!Number.isInteger(p.id) || ids.includes(p.id)) continue;\\n    ids.push(p.id);\\n    const n = Number(scoreOf(p));\\n    scores[p.id] = Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.round(n) : 0;\\n  }\\n  ids.sort((a, b) => scores[b] - scores[a] || a - b);\\n  const standings = [];\\n  for (const id of ids) {\\n    const group = standings[standings.length - 1];\\n    if (group && scores[group[0]] === scores[id]) group.push(id);\\n    else standings.push([id]);\\n  }\\n  return { standings, scores };\\n}\\n\\nfunction allow(state, cost = 1) {\\n  const t = nowMs();\\n  state.tokens = Math.min(30, state.tokens + ((t - state.refill) / 1000) * 16);\\n  state.refill = t;\\n  if (state.tokens < cost) return false;\\n  state.tokens -= cost;\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction nowMs() {\\n  return globalThis.performance?.now?.() || Date.now();\\n}\\n\\nfunction finishRound(hub, state, won) {\\n  if (state.finished || state.ended || !hub.isHost) return;\\n  const players = (hub.players || []).filter((p) => Number.isInteger(p.id));\\n  if (!players.length) return;\\n  state.finished = true;\\n  const { standings, scores } = buildStandings(players, (p) => state.sim?.seats?.[p.id]?.score || 0);\\n  const stats = {};\\n  for (const p of players) {\\n    stats[p.id] = {\\n      SCORE: String(scores[p.id]).slice(0, 16),\\n      MISTAKES: String(state.sim?.mistakes || 0).slice(0, 16),\\n    };\\n  }\\n  const best = standings[0]?.[0];\\n  const awards = best == null ? [] : [{ id: best, title: 'STEADIEST HAND', detail: 'Held the line' }];\\n  const patientSaved = !!won && state.sim?.phase === 'won';\\n  hub.finish({ standings, scores, won: patientSaved, stats, awards });\\n}\\n\\nfunction beginOp(hub, state) {\\n  const list = SESSION_OPS.filter(Boolean);\\n  const def = list[(hub.round || 0) % list.length];\\n  const seed = Math.floor(hub.rng('deal')() * 1e9);\\n  const seats = Math.max(1, (hub.players || []).length);\\n  state.sim = createOp(def, { seed, seats, consult: true, difficulty: 'resident' });\\n  state.onSim?.(state.sim);\\n}\\n\\nfunction applySnap(state, snap) {\\n  if (!state.sim || !snap) return;\\n  const view = applyDecoded(state.sim, snap);\\n  const me = state.me;\\n  (view.seats || []).forEach((s, i) => {\\n    const seat = state.sim.seats[i];\\n    if (!seat) return;\\n    if (i === me) {\\n      const dx = (s.x ?? seat.x) - seat.x;\\n      const dz = (s.z ?? seat.z) - seat.z;\\n      if (Math.hypot(dx, dz) > 1) {\\n        seat.x += dx * 0.35;\\n        seat.z += dz * 0.35;\\n      }\\n    } else {\\n      seat.x = s.x;\\n      seat.z = s.z;\\n      if (s.tool) seat.tool = s.tool;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (view.phase) state.sim.phase = view.phase;\\n  if (view.strainDead) state.sim.flags.strainDead = true;\\n}\\n\\nfunction hostInputs(state) {\\n  const inputs = {};\\n  const n = state.sim?.seats?.length || 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    const net = state.inputs[i] || {};\\n    if (i === state.me && state.local) inputs[i] = { ...net, ...state.local };\\n    else inputs[i] = net;\\n  }\\n  return inputs;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Attach the hub listeners and the host timer.\\n * `hub` is the session client. Returns the shared state.\\n */\\nexport function openSession(hub) {\\n  const state = {\\n    sim: null,\\n    inputs: {},\\n    local: { x: 0, z: 1.2, tool: 'forceps', use: false, gift: false, steady: false, sx: 0, sz: 0 },\\n    card: null,\\n    started: false,\\n    ended: false,\\n    finished: false,\\n    lastT: null,\\n    tokens: 16,\\n    refill: nowMs(),\\n    acc: { input: 0, snap: 0, key: 0, ping: 0 },\\n    me: hub.me,\\n    timer: 0,\\n    silence: null,\\n    onSim: null,\\n  };\\n\\n  const send = (data, reliable) => {\\n    if (state.ended || state.finished) return;\\n    if (!allow(state)) return;\\n    hub.send(data, { reliable: !!reliable });\\n  };\\n\\n  hub.on('card', (card) => {\\n    state.card = card;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('start', () => {\\n    state.started = true;\\n    state.me = hub.me;\\n    if (state.sim) return;\\n    try {\\n      beginOp(hub, state);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      hub.fail(String(err?.message || err));\\n    }\\n  });\\n  hub.on('message', (data) => {\\n    if (!data || data.t === 'p') return;\\n    if (data.t === 'i' && Number.isInteger(data.n)) {\\n      state.inputs[data.n] = {\\n        x: data.x, z: data.z, sx: data.sx, sz: data.sz, tool: data.tool,\\n        use: !!data.use, gift: !!data.gift, steady: !!data.steady, place: !!data.place,\\n      };\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if ((data.t === 's' || data.t === 'k') && !hub.isHost) applySnap(state, data.snap);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('leave', (info) => {\\n    if (info && info.id === hub.host) state.hostGone = true;\\n  });\\n  hub.on('time-up', () => {\\n    if (state.hostGone) return;\\n    finishRound(hub, state, false);\\n  });\\n  hub.on('end', () => {\\n    state.ended = true;\\n    clearInterval(state.timer);\\n    state.silence?.();\\n  });\\n\\n  hub.probe?.(() => ({\\n    scene: state.sim ? 'op' : 'card',\\n    menu: '',\\n    world: state.sim?.id || 'card',\\n    input: 'pad',\\n  }));\\n\\n  const sessionTick = () => {\\n    try {\\n    if (state.ended) return;\\n    const t = hub.time();\\n    const wall = nowMs();\\n    if (!hub.isHost && state.me != null) {\\n      state.acc.input += wall - (state.acc.inputAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.inputAt = wall;\\n      if (state.acc.input >= 66) {\\n        state.acc.input = 0;\\n        const loc = state.local || {};\\n        const body = {\\n          t: 'i', n: state.me, x: loc.x ?? 0, z: loc.z ?? 0, sx: loc.sx || 0, sz: loc.sz || 0,\\n          tool: loc.tool || 'forceps', use: !!loc.use, gift: !!loc.gift, steady: !!loc.steady,\\n          place: !!loc.place,\\n        };\\n        if (!allow(state)) return;\\n        hub.send(body, { to: hub.host, reliable: false });\\n      }\\n    } else if (hub.isHost) {\\n      state.acc.ping += wall - (state.acc.pingAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.pingAt = wall;\\n      if (!state.started || t < 0) {\\n        if (state.acc.ping >= 250) {\\n          state.acc.ping = 0;\\n          send({ t: 'p' }, false);\\n        }\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      if (state.sim && !state.finished) {\\n        if (state.lastT == null) state.lastT = t;\\n        let steps = Math.round((t - state.lastT) / (DT * 1000));\\n        if (steps > 4) steps = 4;\\n        if (steps < 0) steps = 0;\\n        state.lastT += steps * DT * 1000;\\n        for (let i = 0; i < steps; i++) step(state.sim, hostInputs(state), DT);\\n        if (state.sim.phase === 'won' || state.sim.phase === 'lost') finishRound(hub, state, state.sim.phase === 'won');\\n      }\\n      state.acc.snap += wall - (state.acc.snapAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.snapAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.snap >= 84) {\\n        state.acc.snap = 0;\\n        send({ t: 's', snap: encodeFast(state.sim) }, false);\\n      }\\n      state.acc.key += wall - (state.acc.keyAt || wall);\\n      state.acc.keyAt = wall;\\n      if (state.sim && state.acc.key >= 1000) {\\n        state.acc.key = 0;\\n        send({ t: 'k', snap: encodeKey(state.sim) }, true);\\n      }\\n    }\\n    } catch {\\n      /* A bad tick must not take the round down. */\\n    }\\n  };\\n  state.pump = sessionTick;\\n  state.timer = setInterval(sessionTick, 34);\\n\\n  return state;\\n}\\n\\nexport function stopSession(state) {\\n  if (!state) return;\\n  state.ended = true;\\n  clearInterval(state.timer);\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":242}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-3e29b7cf-ab32-4ca9-b1a5-d5d129eea4b8-5","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"470→  - **Comm bust:** a tiny real 3D bust of the speaker placed near the camera at the top-left corner, with `castShadow = false`, so in-op talk uses the same models and mouth animation.\\n- **Results:** the chart drops in. Lines tally one at a time with ticks: time, vitals, technique, streak, mistakes. Rank stamp slams with shake, then a Reyes comment, then the patient's follow-up line for that rank.\\n- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\\n- **Settings** (own HUD screen, navigable by pad):\\n  - Music (**10% default**), Sound, Voices.\\n  - Button glyphs (PlayStation/Xbox), Aim Assist, Cursor Speed, Rumble, Gift Hold/Toggle.\\n  - Look (engine looks), Pixel Size, Screen Shake, Reduce Flashes, Text Speed, Difficulty, Fullscreen, Reset.\\n- **About/Credits:** paged, big text. Pages: Source Information; Testing Feedback; Engine Feedback; Prompt Feedback; Credits. All field labels and answers as your brief lists them. Data in `src/content/about.js`, filled in last. Credits condense the kit's `CREDITS.md` (engine MIT, three.js, Rapier, Kenney furniture CC0) and the game's own \\\"all art and audio written in code\\\".\\n\\n**Touch-only devices.** Detect before `Engine.start`: no `(any-pointer: fine)`, `maxTouchPoints > 0`, no gamepad. ✔ Phones report art like 136×276 at 8×, so the HUD would be a narrow column.\\n480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n490→- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n500→---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n510→| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\\n520→```js\\nconst LOOK = (sat = 1, vig = .3, spread = 0) => ({\\n  scene: [{ id: 'vignette', params: { intensity: vig } }, { id: 'adjust', params: { saturation: sat, contrast: 1 } }, { id: 'chromatic', params: { spread } }],\\n  actors: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: .85, crease: .2 }, filters: [] },\\n  environment: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: 0, crease: 0 }, filters: [] },\\n});\\n```\\nThe split look renders two passes (about a third of the frame rate on software WebGPU here). That's fine: your brief puts performance out of scope. `sixteen_bit` dithers the whole frame and hurts readability ✔. Tag every tool, hand, strain and character with `setLookLayer(obj, 'actors')`.\\n\\n**Camera in surgery:** `{ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.6, 3.1], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 44, minZoom: 1, maxZoom: 1 }`.\\n530→\\n- ✔ Without the min/max lock the mouse wheel zooms the \\\"fixed\\\" camera, and wheel is our tool cycle.\\n- ✔ Enter and WASD don't disturb a fixed rig.\\n- ✔ Move the camera for parallax, dives and whip-pans by setting `ctx.camera.camera.position` and `.lookAt()` each frame; it sticks and `rayAt` follows. Add ±0.25 units of drift toward the tip.\\n- For narrow windows multiply the camera's distance by `max(1, (16/9) / aspect)`.\\n\\n**Lighting.**\\n\\n- Field ✔: sun intensity 1.0 from `[.25, 1, .35]`, ambient 0.55 warm white (`0xfff0e0`), one point light at `[0, 5.2, .4]`, intensity 5, radius 15. Much more than that washes the tissue out.\\n- OR-7 wide ✔: sun 0.35, ambient 0.28 cool (`0x8fa8c8`), lamp point light over the table at intensity 14, radius 7, a monitor glow. A dark room with a pool of light is the mood.\\n540→- Never `new PointLight`; use `ctx.lights`.\\n\\n**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\\n\\n- ✔ Copying the base into the buffer and painting 60 blood discs measured about 0.5 ms a frame.\\n- Mapping ✔: `px = (x / 16 + .5) · W`, `py = (z / 9 + .5) · H`, and **flip the plane's UV v** (`uv.setY(i, 1 - uv.getY(i))`), or the paint lands mirrored.\\n- Set `magFilter`/`minFilter` Nearest and `needsUpdate` after each paint.\\n- Each frame: write the prebuilt base into the buffer, then paint scars, pools, wounds, stitches, gel and burns from sim state. Displace the mesh by `heightAt` plus heartbeat, breathing and bulges, then `computeVertexNormals()`.\\n\\nBase painting recipe (✔ the look, shown for the heart; each arena has its own ramp and shape):\\n550→```js\\nconst BAYER = [0,8,2,10,12,4,14,6,3,11,1,9,15,7,13,5];\\nconst RAMP = [0x3c0d24, 0x5e1430, 0x8a1f38, 0xb5343f, 0xd65c4f];      // dark to light, 5 steps\\n// per texel: m = shape mask (0 outside the organ); light = 0.25 + 0.75*m + (fbm(x*.9, z*.9) - .5)*.9 + tilt;\\n// index = floor(clamp(light)*5 + BAYER[(px&3) + (py&3)*4]/16*.9 - .2) into RAMP (ordered dither between bands)\\n// outside the organ: a dark cavity colour (0x1c0a18) with noise blotches of RAMP[0]\\n// then: fat blobs (0xe9c46a) where fbm(x*1.6, z*2.4) > .66 near edges\\n//       vessels: random-walk branches (heading += noise*.55, step .09, width 2 then 1, branch at 4.5%), arteries 0xf08a5d, veins 0x2e1a52\\n//       wet sheen: a few hundred single 0xf6d0c0 texels on the light-facing side\\n```\\n560→\\n| Arena | Ramp feel, shape |\\n|---|---|\\n| forearm | tan skin ramp, hair flecks, teal drape window |\\n| stomach | pink-salmon, folded rugae lines |\\n| 3 tables | one skin ramp each, small windows |\\n| bone | dark muscle with a white bone silhouette |\\n| liver | deep maroon, two big lobes |\\n| kidney bed | fat-yellow bed, kidney bean mesh (plum to red tween) |\\n| lung | grey-pink, dotted alveoli, breathing |\\n570→| heart | the recipe above |\\n| whole chest | ribs, lung and heart together |\\n| spine | pale ivory and cool shadow |\\n\\nFrame every arena with raised teal drapes (boxes, `y` 0.4), steel clamps and retractors. Pools, blood and wounds use 2 or 3 flat colours with animated sparkle texels, plus particles for droplets, smoke and foam (`ctx.particles.register`; sizes are whole art pixels).\\n\\n**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\\n\\n```js\\nexport const handDef = model({ id:'glove-hand', about:'Gloved surgeon hand gripping a shaft, wrist toward +Z', tags:['character','hand'], floats:true,\\n580→  palette:{ glove:'sky', fold:'blue', sleeve:'teal' }, parts:[\\n  { name:'palm', box:[.72,.3,.8], at:[0,0,0], c:'glove' }, { name:'knuck', box:[.74,.16,.14], at:[0,.12,-.34], c:'fold' },\\n  ...[-.27,-.09,.09,.27].flatMap((x,i)=>[{ name:`f${i}a`, box:[.16,.16,.34], at:[x,.05,-.56], rot:[18,0,0], c:'glove' },{ name:`f${i}b`, box:[.15,.15,.26], at:[x,-.09,-.76], rot:[58,0,0], c:'glove' }]),\\n  { name:'thumb', box:[.18,.18,.5], at:[-.44,-.04,-.26], rot:[10,-28,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'cuff', cyl:[.62,.62,.3], at:[0,0,.54], rot:[90,0,0], c:'fold' }, { name:'wrist', cyl:[.56,1.6,.56], at:[0,0,1.46], rot:[90,0,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'sleeve', cyl:[.8,2.6,.8], at:[0,0,3.4], rot:[90,0,0], c:'sleeve' } ]});\\n```\\n\\n- ✔ Placement that read well: tool at `(x, surface + .05, z)`, rotation `(-.5, -.7, 0)`; hand at `tip + (.88, 1.1, 1.25)`, rotation `(-.46, -.72, .2)`.\\n- Seats 2 to 4 enter from other corners. Glove colour follows the seat: palette `red`, `blue`, `green`, `sand` in 3D; `info.players[i].color` exactly on the HUD (`hud.text` colours take numbers).\",\"content_concise\":\"470→  - **Comm bust:** a tiny real 3D bust of the speaker placed near the camera at the top-left corner, with `castShadow = false`, so in-op talk uses the same models and mouth animation.\\n- **Results:** the chart drops in. Lines tally one at a time with ticks: time, vitals, technique, streak, mistakes. Rank stamp slams with shake, then a Reyes comment, then the patient's follow-up line for that rank.\\n- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\\n- **Settings** (own HUD screen, navigable by pad):\\n  - Music (**10% default**), Sound, Voices.\\n  - Button glyphs (PlayStation/Xbox), Aim Assist, Cursor Speed, Rumble, Gift Hold/Toggle.\\n  - Look (engine looks), Pixel Size, Screen Shake, Reduce Flashes, Text Speed, Difficulty, Fullscreen, Reset.\\n- **About/Credits:** paged, big text. Pages: Source Information; Testing Feedback; Engine Feedback; Prompt Feedback; Credits. All field labels and answers as your brief lists them. Data in `src/content/about.js`, filled in last. Credits condense the kit's `CREDITS.md` (engine MIT, three.js, Rapier, Kenney furniture CC0) and the game's own \\\"all art and audio written in code\\\".\\n\\n**Touch-only devices.** Detect before `Engine.start`: no `(any-pointer: fine)`, `maxTouchPoints > 0`, no gamepad. ✔ Phones report art like 136×276 at 8×, so the HUD would be a narrow column.\\n480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n490→- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n500→---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n510→| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\\n520→```js\\nconst LOOK = (sat = 1, vig = .3, spread = 0) => ({\\n  scene: [{ id: 'vignette', params: { intensity: vig } }, { id: 'adjust', params: { saturation: sat, contrast: 1 } }, { id: 'chromatic', params: { spread } }],\\n  actors: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: .85, crease: .2 }, filters: [] },\\n  environment: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: 0, crease: 0 }, filters: [] },\\n});\\n```\\nThe split look renders two passes (about a third of the frame rate on software WebGPU here). That's fine: your brief puts performance out of scope. `sixteen_bit` dithers the whole frame and hurts readability ✔. Tag every tool, hand, strain and character with `setLookLayer(obj, 'actors')`.\\n\\n**Camera in surgery:** `{ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.6, 3.1], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 44, minZoom: 1, maxZoom: 1 }`.\\n530→\\n- ✔ Without the min/max lock the mouse wheel zooms the \\\"fixed\\\" camera, and wheel is our tool cycle.\\n- ✔ Enter and WASD don't disturb a fixed rig.\\n- ✔ Move the camera for parallax, dives and whip-pans by setting `ctx.camera.camera.position` and `.lookAt()` each frame; it sticks and `rayAt` follows. Add ±0.25 units of drift toward the tip.\\n- For narrow windows multiply the camera's distance by `max(1, (16/9) / aspect)`.\\n\\n**Lighting.**\\n\\n- Field ✔: sun intensity 1.0 from `[.25, 1, .35]`, ambient 0.55 warm white (`0xfff0e0`), one point light at `[0, 5.2, .4]`, intensity 5, radius 15. Much more than that washes the tissue out.\\n- OR-7 wide ✔: sun 0.35, ambient 0.28 cool (`0x8fa8c8`), lamp point light over the table at intensity 14, radius 7, a monitor glow. A dark room with a pool of light is the mood.\\n540→- Never `new PointLight`; use `ctx.lights`.\\n\\n**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\\n\\n- ✔ Copying the base into the buffer and painting 60 blood discs measured about 0.5 ms a frame.\\n- Mapping ✔: `px = (x / 16 + .5) · W`, `py = (z / 9 + .5) · H`, and **flip the plane's UV v** (`uv.setY(i, 1 - uv.getY(i))`), or the paint lands mirrored.\\n- Set `magFilter`/`minFilter` Nearest and `needsUpdate` after each paint.\\n- Each frame: write the prebuilt base into the buffer, then paint scars, pools, wounds, stitches, gel and burns from sim state. Displace the mesh by `heightAt` plus heartbeat, breathing and bulges, then `computeVertexNormals()`.\\n\\nBase painting recipe (✔ the look, shown for the heart; each arena has its own ramp and shape):\\n550→```js\\nconst BAYER = [0,8,2,10,12,4,14,6,3,11,1,9,15,7,13,5];\\nconst RAMP = [0x3c0d24, 0x5e1430, 0x8a1f38, 0xb5343f, 0xd65c4f];      // dark to light, 5 steps\\n// per texel: m = shape mask (0 outside the organ); light = 0.25 + 0.75*m + (fbm(x*.9, z*.9) - .5)*.9 + tilt;\\n// index = floor(clamp(light)*5 + BAYER[(px&3) + (py&3)*4]/16*.9 - .2) into RAMP (ordered dither between bands)\\n// outside the organ: a dark cavity colour (0x1c0a18) with noise blotches of RAMP[0]\\n// then: fat blobs (0xe9c46a) where fbm(x*1.6, z*2.4) > .66 near edges\\n//       vessels: random-walk branches (heading += noise*.55, step .09, width 2 then 1, branch at 4.5%), arteries 0xf08a5d, veins 0x2e1a52\\n//       wet sheen: a few hundred single 0xf6d0c0 texels on the light-facing side\\n```\\n560→\\n| Arena | Ramp feel, shape |\\n|---|---|\\n| forearm | tan skin ramp, hair flecks, teal drape window |\\n| stomach | pink-salmon, folded rugae lines |\\n| 3 tables | one skin ramp each, small windows |\\n| bone | dark muscle with a white bone silhouette |\\n| liver | deep maroon, two big lobes |\\n| kidney bed | fat-yellow bed, kidney bean mesh (plum to red tween) |\\n| lung | grey-pink, dotted alveoli, breathing |\\n570→| heart | the recipe above |\\n| whole chest | ribs, lung and heart together |\\n| spine | pale ivory and cool shadow |\\n\\nFrame every arena with raised teal drapes (boxes, `y` 0.4), steel clamps and retractors. Pools, blood and wounds use 2 or 3 flat colours with animated sparkle texels, plus particles for droplets, smoke and foam (`ctx.particles.register`; sizes are whole art pixels).\\n\\n**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\\n\\n```js\\nexport const handDef = model({ id:'glove-hand', about:'Gloved surgeon hand gripping a shaft, wrist toward +Z', tags:['character','hand'], floats:true,\\n580→  palette:{ glove:'sky', fold:'blue', sleeve:'teal' }, parts:[\\n  { name:'palm', box:[.72,.3,.8], at:[0,0,0], c:'glove' }, { name:'knuck', box:[.74,.16,.14], at:[0,.12,-.34], c:'fold' },\\n  ...[-.27,-.09,.09,.27].flatMap((x,i)=>[{ name:`f${i}a`, box:[.16,.16,.34], at:[x,.05,-.56], rot:[18,0,0], c:'glove' },{ name:`f${i}b`, box:[.15,.15,.26], at:[x,-.09,-.76], rot:[58,0,0], c:'glove' }]),\\n  { name:'thumb', box:[.18,.18,.5], at:[-.44,-.04,-.26], rot:[10,-28,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'cuff', cyl:[.62,.62,.3], at:[0,0,.54], rot:[90,0,0], c:'fold' }, { name:'wrist', cyl:[.56,1.6,.56], at:[0,0,1.46], rot:[90,0,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'sleeve', cyl:[.8,2.6,.8], at:[0,0,3.4], rot:[90,0,0], c:'sleeve' } ]});\\n```\\n\\n- ✔ Placement that read well: tool at `(x, surface + .05, z)`, rotation `(-.5, -.7, 0)`; hand at `tip + (.88, 1.1, 1.25)`, rotation `(-.46, -.72, .2)`.\\n- Seats 2 to 4 enter from other corners. Glove colour follows the seat: palette `red`, `blue`, `green`, `sand` in 3D; `info.players[i].color` exactly on the HUD (`hud.text` colours take numbers).\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/PLAN.md\",\"offset\":470,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"  - **Comm bust:** a tiny real 3D bust of the speaker placed near the camera at the top-left corner, with `castShadow = false`, so in-op talk uses the same models and mouth animation.\\n- **Results:** the chart drops in. Lines tally one at a time with ticks: time, vitals, technique, streak, mistakes. Rank stamp slams with shake, then a Reyes comment, then the patient's follow-up line for that rank.\\n- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\\n- **Settings** (own HUD screen, navigable by pad):\\n  - Music (**10% default**), Sound, Voices.\\n  - Button glyphs (PlayStation/Xbox), Aim Assist, Cursor Speed, Rumble, Gift Hold/Toggle.\\n  - Look (engine looks), Pixel Size, Screen Shake, Reduce Flashes, Text Speed, Difficulty, Fullscreen, Reset.\\n- **About/Credits:** paged, big text. Pages: Source Information; Testing Feedback; Engine Feedback; Prompt Feedback; Credits. All field labels and answers as your brief lists them. Data in `src/content/about.js`, filled in last. Credits condense the kit's `CREDITS.md` (engine MIT, three.js, Rapier, Kenney furniture CC0) and the game's own \\\"all art and audio written in code\\\".\\n\\n**Touch-only devices.** Detect before `Engine.start`: no `(any-pointer: fine)`, `maxTouchPoints > 0`, no gamepad. ✔ Phones report art like 136×276 at 8×, so the HUD would be a narrow column.\\n\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\\n```js\\nconst LOOK = (sat = 1, vig = .3, spread = 0) => ({\\n  scene: [{ id: 'vignette', params: { intensity: vig } }, { id: 'adjust', params: { saturation: sat, contrast: 1 } }, { id: 'chromatic', params: { spread } }],\\n  actors: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: .85, crease: .2 }, filters: [] },\\n  environment: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: 0, crease: 0 }, filters: [] },\\n});\\n```\\nThe split look renders two passes (about a third of the frame rate on software WebGPU here). That's fine: your brief puts performance out of scope. `sixteen_bit` dithers the whole frame and hurts readability ✔. Tag every tool, hand, strain and character with `setLookLayer(obj, 'actors')`.\\n\\n**Camera in surgery:** `{ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.6, 3.1], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 44, minZoom: 1, maxZoom: 1 }`.\\n\\n- ✔ Without the min/max lock the mouse wheel zooms the \\\"fixed\\\" camera, and wheel is our tool cycle.\\n- ✔ Enter and WASD don't disturb a fixed rig.\\n- ✔ Move the camera for parallax, dives and whip-pans by setting `ctx.camera.camera.position` and `.lookAt()` each frame; it sticks and `rayAt` follows. Add ±0.25 units of drift toward the tip.\\n- For narrow windows multiply the camera's distance by `max(1, (16/9) / aspect)`.\\n\\n**Lighting.**\\n\\n- Field ✔: sun intensity 1.0 from `[.25, 1, .35]`, ambient 0.55 warm white (`0xfff0e0`), one point light at `[0, 5.2, .4]`, intensity 5, radius 15. Much more than that washes the tissue out.\\n- OR-7 wide ✔: sun 0.35, ambient 0.28 cool (`0x8fa8c8`), lamp point light over the table at intensity 14, radius 7, a monitor glow. A dark room with a pool of light is the mood.\\n- Never `new PointLight`; use `ctx.lights`.\\n\\n**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\\n\\n- ✔ Copying the base into the buffer and painting 60 blood discs measured about 0.5 ms a frame.\\n- Mapping ✔: `px = (x / 16 + .5) · W`, `py = (z / 9 + .5) · H`, and **flip the plane's UV v** (`uv.setY(i, 1 - uv.getY(i))`), or the paint lands mirrored.\\n- Set `magFilter`/`minFilter` Nearest and `needsUpdate` after each paint.\\n- Each frame: write the prebuilt base into the buffer, then paint scars, pools, wounds, stitches, gel and burns from sim state. Displace the mesh by `heightAt` plus heartbeat, breathing and bulges, then `computeVertexNormals()`.\\n\\nBase painting recipe (✔ the look, shown for the heart; each arena has its own ramp and shape):\\n```js\\nconst BAYER = [0,8,2,10,12,4,14,6,3,11,1,9,15,7,13,5];\\nconst RAMP = [0x3c0d24, 0x5e1430, 0x8a1f38, 0xb5343f, 0xd65c4f];      // dark to light, 5 steps\\n// per texel: m = shape mask (0 outside the organ); light = 0.25 + 0.75*m + (fbm(x*.9, z*.9) - .5)*.9 + tilt;\\n// index = floor(clamp(light)*5 + BAYER[(px&3) + (py&3)*4]/16*.9 - .2) into RAMP (ordered dither between bands)\\n// outside the organ: a dark cavity colour (0x1c0a18) with noise blotches of RAMP[0]\\n// then: fat blobs (0xe9c46a) where fbm(x*1.6, z*2.4) > .66 near edges\\n//       vessels: random-walk branches (heading += noise*.55, step .09, width 2 then 1, branch at 4.5%), arteries 0xf08a5d, veins 0x2e1a52\\n//       wet sheen: a few hundred single 0xf6d0c0 texels on the light-facing side\\n```\\n\\n| Arena | Ramp feel, shape |\\n|---|---|\\n| forearm | tan skin ramp, hair flecks, teal drape window |\\n| stomach | pink-salmon, folded rugae lines |\\n| 3 tables | one skin ramp each, small windows |\\n| bone | dark muscle with a white bone silhouette |\\n| liver | deep maroon, two big lobes |\\n| kidney bed | fat-yellow bed, kidney bean mesh (plum to red tween) |\\n| lung | grey-pink, dotted alveoli, breathing |\\n| heart | the recipe above |\\n| whole chest | ribs, lung and heart together |\\n| spine | pale ivory and cool shadow |\\n\\nFrame every arena with raised teal drapes (boxes, `y` 0.4), steel clamps and retractors. Pools, blood and wounds use 2 or 3 flat colours with animated sparkle texels, plus particles for droplets, smoke and foam (`ctx.particles.register`; sizes are whole art pixels).\\n\\n**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\\n\\n```js\\nexport const handDef = model({ id:'glove-hand', about:'Gloved surgeon hand gripping a shaft, wrist toward +Z', tags:['character','hand'], floats:true,\\n  palette:{ glove:'sky', fold:'blue', sleeve:'teal' }, parts:[\\n  { name:'palm', box:[.72,.3,.8], at:[0,0,0], c:'glove' }, { name:'knuck', box:[.74,.16,.14], at:[0,.12,-.34], c:'fold' },\\n  ...[-.27,-.09,.09,.27].flatMap((x,i)=>[{ name:`f${i}a`, box:[.16,.16,.34], at:[x,.05,-.56], rot:[18,0,0], c:'glove' },{ name:`f${i}b`, box:[.15,.15,.26], at:[x,-.09,-.76], rot:[58,0,0], c:'glove' }]),\\n  { name:'thumb', box:[.18,.18,.5], at:[-.44,-.04,-.26], rot:[10,-28,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'cuff', cyl:[.62,.62,.3], at:[0,0,.54], rot:[90,0,0], c:'fold' }, { name:'wrist', cyl:[.56,1.6,.56], at:[0,0,1.46], rot:[90,0,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'sleeve', cyl:[.8,2.6,.8], at:[0,0,3.4], rot:[90,0,0], c:'sleeve' } ]});\\n```\\n\\n- ✔ Placement that read well: tool at `(x, surface + .05, z)`, rotation `(-.5, -.7, 0)`; hand at `tip + (.88, 1.1, 1.25)`, rotation `(-.46, -.72, .2)`.\\n- Seats 2 to 4 enter from other corners. Glove colour follows the seat: palette `red`, `blue`, `green`, `sand` in 3D; `info.players[i].color` exactly on the HUD (`hud.text` colours take numbers).\\n\",\"total_lines\":893}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-d80bff3a-7fc1-4412-b1ca-9b0044bf9e30-5","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"470→  - **Comm bust:** a tiny real 3D bust of the speaker placed near the camera at the top-left corner, with `castShadow = false`, so in-op talk uses the same models and mouth animation.\\n- **Results:** the chart drops in. Lines tally one at a time with ticks: time, vitals, technique, streak, mistakes. Rank stamp slams with shake, then a Reyes comment, then the patient's follow-up line for that rank.\\n- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\\n- **Settings** (own HUD screen, navigable by pad):\\n  - Music (**10% default**), Sound, Voices.\\n  - Button glyphs (PlayStation/Xbox), Aim Assist, Cursor Speed, Rumble, Gift Hold/Toggle.\\n  - Look (engine looks), Pixel Size, Screen Shake, Reduce Flashes, Text Speed, Difficulty, Fullscreen, Reset.\\n- **About/Credits:** paged, big text. Pages: Source Information; Testing Feedback; Engine Feedback; Prompt Feedback; Credits. All field labels and answers as your brief lists them. Data in `src/content/about.js`, filled in last. Credits condense the kit's `CREDITS.md` (engine MIT, three.js, Rapier, Kenney furniture CC0) and the game's own \\\"all art and audio written in code\\\".\\n\\n**Touch-only devices.** Detect before `Engine.start`: no `(any-pointer: fine)`, `maxTouchPoints > 0`, no gamepad. ✔ Phones report art like 136×276 at 8×, so the HUD would be a narrow column.\\n480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` always: ✔ no joystick appears.\\n- The attract mode loops behind the message.\\n- If a key is pressed or a pad connects, drop the gate and play normally.\\n\\n**Attract mode.** 10 s with no input on Title or any menu screen starts it. Input means a key, click, mouse move, stick beyond deadzone, pad button or touch; each resets the timer.\\n\\n- A looping reel of real sim segments of 20 to 30 s each, played by the bot with cheats (god vitals, free Composure): a talking-head snippet, Op 1 hooks, Op 2 scan and laser, Op 3 table swaps, Bone Mend, Introit with The Quiet, Second Look rewind, Lacrimosa, Dies Irae with Code Blue, then Pile-Up with four hands.\\n- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\\n490→- It must never touch saves or settings.\\n\\n**Dev Mode** (from Pause; tabs on L1/R1, Q/E or click):\\n\\n- **BALANCE:** live sliders, Reset to Defaults (list in section 12).\\n- **CHEATS:** God Vitals, Infinite Composure, Freeze Clock, Unlimited Mistakes, Unlock All.\\n- **JUMP:** any op and stage, any story scene.\\n- **ACTIONS:** Complete Stage, Win Op, Fail Op, Trigger Code Blue, Spawn (pool, bleeder, laceration, hook, strain), Copy Op JSON to console.\\n- **VIEW:** hitbox overlay (entity circles and ids), Bot Plays (with skill slider), Sim Speed 0.1× to 3×, Frame Step, FPS and sim stats.\\n\\n500→---\\n\\n## 9. Art direction: what works\\n\\nThe engine's native style is low-poly 3D turned into pixel art. My mock of the heart arena with this recipe looked like a shipped game. Keep to these numbers unless you can beat them.\\n\\n**Framing.** `aspect: 'fill'` always. ✔ It gives no black bars:\\n\\n| Viewport | Art resolution | Scale |\\n|---|---|---|\\n510→| 1920×1080 | 480×270 | ×4 |\\n| 3840×2160 | 480×270 | ×8 |\\n| 1280×720 | 427×240 | ×3 |\\n| 1024×768 | 342×256 | ×3 |\\n| 800×600 | 400×300 | ×2 |\\n| 600×400 | 600×400 | ×1 |\\n\\nWithout it, 1280×720 letterboxes to 960×540. Lay out all HUD from anchors.\\n\\n**The look** (✔ crisp outlines on tools and creatures, none on tissue):\\n520→```js\\nconst LOOK = (sat = 1, vig = .3, spread = 0) => ({\\n  scene: [{ id: 'vignette', params: { intensity: vig } }, { id: 'adjust', params: { saturation: sat, contrast: 1 } }, { id: 'chromatic', params: { spread } }],\\n  actors: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: .85, crease: .2 }, filters: [] },\\n  environment: { pixel: { size: 1, outline: 0, crease: 0 }, filters: [] },\\n});\\n```\\nThe split look renders two passes (about a third of the frame rate on software WebGPU here). That's fine: your brief puts performance out of scope. `sixteen_bit` dithers the whole frame and hurts readability ✔. Tag every tool, hand, strain and character with `setLookLayer(obj, 'actors')`.\\n\\n**Camera in surgery:** `{ preset: 'fixed', position: [0, 9.6, 3.1], target: [0, 0, 0.1], fov: 44, minZoom: 1, maxZoom: 1 }`.\\n530→\\n- ✔ Without the min/max lock the mouse wheel zooms the \\\"fixed\\\" camera, and wheel is our tool cycle.\\n- ✔ Enter and WASD don't disturb a fixed rig.\\n- ✔ Move the camera for parallax, dives and whip-pans by setting `ctx.camera.camera.position` and `.lookAt()` each frame; it sticks and `rayAt` follows. Add ±0.25 units of drift toward the tip.\\n- For narrow windows multiply the camera's distance by `max(1, (16/9) / aspect)`.\\n\\n**Lighting.**\\n\\n- Field ✔: sun intensity 1.0 from `[.25, 1, .35]`, ambient 0.55 warm white (`0xfff0e0`), one point light at `[0, 5.2, .4]`, intensity 5, radius 15. Much more than that washes the tissue out.\\n- OR-7 wide ✔: sun 0.35, ambient 0.28 cool (`0x8fa8c8`), lamp point light over the table at intensity 14, radius 7, a monitor glow. A dark room with a pool of light is the mood.\\n540→- Never `new PointLight`; use `ctx.lights`.\\n\\n**The tissue canvas** is the game's signature. Each table has a 480×270 RGBA `DataTexture` on a 192×108 `PlaneGeometry` in `toonMaterial(PALETTE.white, { map })` with `receiveShadow`.\\n\\n- ✔ Copying the base into the buffer and painting 60 blood discs measured about 0.5 ms a frame.\\n- Mapping ✔: `px = (x / 16 + .5) · W`, `py = (z / 9 + .5) · H`, and **flip the plane's UV v** (`uv.setY(i, 1 - uv.getY(i))`), or the paint lands mirrored.\\n- Set `magFilter`/`minFilter` Nearest and `needsUpdate` after each paint.\\n- Each frame: write the prebuilt base into the buffer, then paint scars, pools, wounds, stitches, gel and burns from sim state. Displace the mesh by `heightAt` plus heartbeat, breathing and bulges, then `computeVertexNormals()`.\\n\\nBase painting recipe (✔ the look, shown for the heart; each arena has its own ramp and shape):\\n550→```js\\nconst BAYER = [0,8,2,10,12,4,14,6,3,11,1,9,15,7,13,5];\\nconst RAMP = [0x3c0d24, 0x5e1430, 0x8a1f38, 0xb5343f, 0xd65c4f];      // dark to light, 5 steps\\n// per texel: m = shape mask (0 outside the organ); light = 0.25 + 0.75*m + (fbm(x*.9, z*.9) - .5)*.9 + tilt;\\n// index = floor(clamp(light)*5 + BAYER[(px&3) + (py&3)*4]/16*.9 - .2) into RAMP (ordered dither between bands)\\n// outside the organ: a dark cavity colour (0x1c0a18) with noise blotches of RAMP[0]\\n// then: fat blobs (0xe9c46a) where fbm(x*1.6, z*2.4) > .66 near edges\\n//       vessels: random-walk branches (heading += noise*.55, step .09, width 2 then 1, branch at 4.5%), arteries 0xf08a5d, veins 0x2e1a52\\n//       wet sheen: a few hundred single 0xf6d0c0 texels on the light-facing side\\n```\\n560→\\n| Arena | Ramp feel, shape |\\n|---|---|\\n| forearm | tan skin ramp, hair flecks, teal drape window |\\n| stomach | pink-salmon, folded rugae lines |\\n| 3 tables | one skin ramp each, small windows |\\n| bone | dark muscle with a white bone silhouette |\\n| liver | deep maroon, two big lobes |\\n| kidney bed | fat-yellow bed, kidney bean mesh (plum to red tween) |\\n| lung | grey-pink, dotted alveoli, breathing |\\n570→| heart | the recipe above |\\n| whole chest | ribs, lung and heart together |\\n| spine | pale ivory and cool shadow |\\n\\nFrame every arena with raised teal drapes (boxes, `y` 0.4), steel clamps and retractors. Pools, blood and wounds use 2 or 3 flat colours with animated sparkle texels, plus particles for droplets, smoke and foam (`ctx.particles.register`; sizes are whole art pixels).\\n\\n**The hand and instruments.** Each is `model()` data with the tip at the origin, pointing −Z. A gloved hand plus forearm from below the frame sells first-person presence, and its cast shadow gives depth ✔.\\n\\n```js\\nexport const handDef = model({ id:'glove-hand', about:'Gloved surgeon hand gripping a shaft, wrist toward +Z', tags:['character','hand'], floats:true,\\n580→  palette:{ glove:'sky', fold:'blue', sleeve:'teal' }, parts:[\\n  { name:'palm', box:[.72,.3,.8], at:[0,0,0], c:'glove' }, { name:'knuck', box:[.74,.16,.14], at:[0,.12,-.34], c:'fold' },\\n  ...[-.27,-.09,.09,.27].flatMap((x,i)=>[{ name:`f${i}a`, box:[.16,.16,.34], at:[x,.05,-.56], rot:[18,0,0], c:'glove' },{ name:`f${i}b`, box:[.15,.15,.26], at:[x,-.09,-.76], rot:[58,0,0], c:'glove' }]),\\n  { name:'thumb', box:[.18,.18,.5], at:[-.44,-.04,-.26], rot:[10,-28,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'cuff', cyl:[.62,.62,.3], at:[0,0,.54], rot:[90,0,0], c:'fold' }, { name:'wrist', cyl:[.56,1.6,.56], at:[0,0,1.46], rot:[90,0,0], c:'glove' },\\n  { name:'sleeve', cyl:[.8,2.6,.8], at:[0,0,3.4], rot:[90,0,0], c:'sleeve' } ]});\\n```\\n\\n- ✔ Placement that read well: tool at `(x, surface + .05, z)`, rotation `(-.5, -.7, 0)`; hand at `tip + (.88, 1.1, 1.25)`, rotation `(-.46, -.72, .2)`.\\n- Seats 2 to 4 enter from other corners. Glove colour follows the seat: palette `red`, `blue`, `green`, `sand` in 3D; `info.players[i].color` exactly on the HUD (`hud.text` colours take numbers).\",\"content_concise\":\"470→  - **Comm bust:** a tiny real 3D bust of the speaker placed near the camera at the top-left corner, with `castShadow = false`, so in-op talk uses the same models and mouth animation.\\n- **Results:** the chart drops in. Lines tally one at a time with ticks: time, vitals, technique, streak, mistakes. Rank stamp slams with shake, then a Reyes comment, then the patient's follow-up line for that rank.\\n- **Pause (Options/Esc):** Resume, Retry Stage, Restart, Settings, **Dev Mode**, Quit to Menu. Use your own pause flag and stop stepping the sim. ✔ Don't use `engine.paused`: `update()` stops running and your menu dies. Disabled in a session.\\n- **Settings** (own HUD screen, navigable by pad):\\n  - Music (**10% default**), Sound, Voices.\\n  - Button glyphs (PlayStation/Xbox), Aim Assist, Cursor Speed, Rumble, Gift Hold/Toggle.\\n  - Look (engine looks), Pixel Size, Screen Shake, Reduce Flashes, Text Speed, Difficulty, Fullscreen, Reset.\\n- **About/Credits:** paged, big text. Pages: Source Information; Testing Feedback; Engine Feedback; Prompt Feedback; Credits. All field labels and answers as your brief lists them. Data in `src/content/about.js`, filled in last. Credits condense the kit's `CREDITS.md` (engine MIT, three.js, Rapier, Kenney furniture CC0) and the game's own \\\"all art and audio written in code\\\".\\n\\n**Touch-only devices.** Detect before `Engine.start`: no `(any-pointer: fine)`, `maxTouchPoints > 0`, no gamepad. ✔ Phones report art like 136×276 at 8×, so the HUD would be a narrow column.\\n480→\\n- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\\n- `touch: false` alw