{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_598","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" criteria serve as a derived checklist. I must judge each criterion MET or UNMET. This is a re-verification round focused on prior gaps. New objections require a demonstrable defect in shipped behavior or an unmet gating criterion.I need to check the initial seat tool.\n\nThe prior gap only cited frame step and FPS. It did not mention hitbox circles. The anti-ratchet rule forbids raising fresh nits. Entity circles are part of the same VIEW criterion. The prior gap implicitly accepted text-only IDs.","signature":"CEGjpRwsrAUDudRtGkyzKYeLRriNt1CCDC8kEPFLGn91cONIjQDq5bvLQSUW5F2yrDctxQ+fls/4Y1LvsnMiy2Vx4R3y/8vXZfkUNYvc7hJDnjeViOZFOGvzLa7RPgj2IV+l9QG4Vp4sKEt0gZv+LJTvdcVWxrLrcxAv//faHziV0p/88yQZZTpPbx9q0jiY4XGsadqlbOtLr+q9OMSu0P0+824j1lB/E6frzBbvnL1oJdBIrIUuaxkbO6FEYkoagBp7jqyh8QXChdf+noS+8CCKU02uNKtLfPZl"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7590e15c-e897-4bbd-b4ca-4c6ba7be3ddb-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":1,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7590e15c-e897-4bbd-b4ca-4c6ba7be3ddb-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js","offset":1,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-7590e15c-e897-4bbd-b4ca-4c6ba7be3ddb-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":520,"limit":60}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":517