{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_606","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe dev jump test is confirmed correct. The story scene jump does not require a save. A potential issue was spotted in frame step: when the human device is pad and no pad inputs are present, seatInput falls through.\n\nThe frame step logic is sound. When no pad is connected, the function returns empty human input, yet the simulation clock still advances. The prior gap was that the view had no frame step; now it exists and is wired to the menu.The constructor sets the device to 'pad' by default.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eaaa422e-3a14-4441-b62d-8adfc7050221-34","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eaaa422e-3a14-4441-b62d-8adfc7050221-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/sim/op.js","offset":580,"limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-eaaa422e-3a14-4441-b62d-8adfc7050221-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/src/content/ops.js","offset":20,"limit":55}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3797,"output_tokens":341,"cache_read_input_tokens":85888,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"0fa67055-97d5-49d7-a481-2fb86c17f240"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-eaaa422e-3a14-4441-b62d-8adfc7050221-34","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { DIFFICULTY, getConfig } from '../core/config.js';\\nimport { makeRng } from '../core/rng.js';\\nimport { angDiff, coverage, dist, makeEntity, pathMetrics, toolFor, woundFrame } from './geom.js';\\nimport { applyRank, ratePoints } from './score.js';\\nimport { noteEyeLaser, notePlate, noteSob, startStrain, tickStrains } from './strains.js';\\n\\nconst FIELD = { x: 8, z: 4.5 };\\n\\nexport function createOp(def, opts = {}) {\\n10→  const config = opts.config || getConfig();\\n  const difficulty = opts.difficulty || 'resident';\\n  const diff = DIFFICULTY[difficulty] || DIFFICULTY.resident;\\n  const rng = makeRng(opts.seed ?? 1);\\n  const human = Math.max(1, opts.seats || 1);\\n  const consult = !!opts.consult;\\n  const partner = !!def.partner && !consult;\\n  const seatCount = partner ? Math.max(2, human) : human;\\n  const seats = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < seatCount; i++) {\\n20→    const gift = giftOf(def, i, consult);\\n    seats.push({\\n      id: i,\\n      x: -1.2 + i * 0.8,\\n      z: 1.4,\\n      tool: (def.tools && def.tools[0]) || 'forceps',\\n      use: false,\\n      score: 0,\\n      holding: -1,\\n      draw: 0,\\n30→      dry: 0,\\n      bruised: false,\\n      gift,\\n      human: consult ? true : i === 0,\\n      pref: def.partner ? (i === 0 ? 'R' : 'L') : '',\\n      stitches: 0,\\n      cleans: 0,\\n      sloppies: 0,\\n      botSkill: i === 0 ? 1 : 0.85,\\n    });\\n40→  }\\n  const starts = Array.isArray(def.vitals?.start) ? def.vitals.start : [def.vitals?.start ?? 80];\\n  const tables = starts.map((v, i) => ({ id: i, vitals: v }));\\n  const coop = 1 + config.coopScale * Math.max(0, (consult ? human : 1) - 1);\\n  const sim = {\\n    id: def.id,\\n    title: def.title,\\n    arena: def.arena || 'forearm',\\n    def,\\n    config,\\n50