at 10 moves roughly 3.3 units\n\nThe engine loop order in 20 frames, satisfying is sound. Input is  the test threshold.sampled in update and The key input path  consumed in fixedUpdate,correctly tracks KeyD so the first frame  as a key device withcorrectly uses previous-frame sx=1 across frames. data.\n\nA new potential bug surfaced: when the device is mouse, seat 0 (drive) may receive mouse PLACE input instead of keyboard input, while seat 1 uses its pad.\n\nThe couch input test is correct. When the device is mouse, seat 0 snaps to the cursor and seat 1 uses its\n\nThe idle pad fix is pad. This matches the confirmed. The key test runs inside withIdlePad, plan's specification so the idle pad is  that two stub pads present but pads.anyproduce two independent stays false and the device remains key. tips. The old bug where fixedUpdate always used padInputs regardless of device is now prevented by checking the active device first.\n\nRunning the hands test to verify the 151-pass\n\nThe host correctly avoids sending its  result is genuine. own input to itself.The default suite includes The client-side `allow` guard returns from  sim and testHands, the entire session tick,adding 34 checks over but this only affects the client branch.  the prior 117. Now The host's `send` also uses `allow`, whichtallying check() calls would stop snaps if in testHands and testSessionHands. tokens run out, though that is not the current gap. `applySnap` skips tool changes for the local player and only applies remote ones.\n\nTallying check() calls in testHands and testHandsOnInput. testHands covers 17 checks: idle pad yields, key input, pad stick, jump lists, stage and\n\nThe host place merge scene jumps, spawn  logic is sound. Localkinds, view tools, frame input overrides network step, bot toggle, sim data when available, speed limits, fps stat, so the host's own placement and op JSON copy. testHandsOnInput adds 8 more for input is preserved even if path tests.\n\nThe tally reaches  the network state lacks34 new checks. The total it. of 151 matches the prior count exactly. This confirms the new tests were included and passed. A quick run would verify current code, but confidence is high.\n\nThe default refutation bias applies to uncertainty, not to verified code paths. I will spot-check the hands test and compare file timestamps to confirm the captured log is genuine.\n\nRunning the hands ","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6155ea52-6df8-4521-a989-c0ca59d3c470-35","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/run.mjs","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-6155ea52-6df8-4521-a989-c0ca59d3c470-36","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"hitbox|devSpeed|simSpeed","glob":"**/{clinic.js,stage.js,hud.js}"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3399,"output_tokens":3138,"cache_read_input_tokens":86144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"fdae8810-8190-4924-9245-d28c772a2764"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-6155ea52-6df8-4521-a989-c0ca59d3c470-35","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→/**\\n * The Second Opinion Clinic — one test command.\\n *\\n * Filters (also documented in docs/AUTHORING.md):\\n *   sim      tool rules, gifts, rank, sliders, codec, determinism, balance\\n *   content  story length, About fields, banned strings, campaign save\\n *   audio    rendered voice and one effect are finite and not silent\\n *   browser  pad stand-in, keys, mouse, attract, touch gate, dev sliders\\n *   launch   two file:// boots, fresh-profile music, aimed tool\\n10→ *   hub      five shared-world harness URLs\\n *   cal      print Resident bot scores (not part of the default)\\n *   all      every filter except cal\\n *\\n * Default (no argument): sim + content + audio.\\n * Prints only failures and one count line. Exit 0 when nothing failed.\\n * `cal` may also print scores.\\n */\\nimport { mkdirSync, readdirSync, readFileSync, statSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { join, dirname } from 'node:path';\\n20→import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { parseSong } from '../pixel-engine.js';\\nimport { ABOUT_FIELDS, AI_HUB, ENGINE_FEEDBACK, PROMPT_FEEDBACK, SOURCE_INFORMATION, TESTING_FEEDBACK } from '../src/content/about.js';\\nimport { playCampaign } from '../src/content/campaign.js';\\nimport { ALL_OPS } from '../src/content/ops.js';\\nimport { CAST, SCENES } from '../src/content/story.js';\\nimport { applySlider, getConfig, resetConfig } from '../src/core/config.js';\\nimport { SONGS } from '../src/audio/songs.js';\\nimport { effectBuffer, rms, voicePcm } from '../src/audio/voice.js';\\nimport { Clinic } from '../src/game/clinic.js';\\n30→import { buildStandings, openSession, stopSession } from '../src/net/session.js';\\nimport { applyDecoded, decodeState, encodeFast, snapshotOf } from '../src/sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, devCheat, hashSim, retryStage, step } from '../src/sim/op.js';\\nimport { play, sameHash } from '../src/sim/run.js';\\nimport { rankFor } from '../src/sim/score.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\nconst BOSSES = new Set(['op5', 'op7', 'op8', 'op9']);\\nconst fails = [];\\n40→let passed = 0;\\n\\nfunction check(name, cond) {\\n  if (cond) passed += 1;\\n  else fails.push(name);\\n}\\n\\nfunction approx(a, b, eps = 0.05) {\\n  return Math.abs(a - b) <= eps;\\n}\\n50→\",\"content_concise\":\"1→/**\\n * The Second Opinion Clinic — one test command.\\n *\\n * Filters (also documented in docs/AUTHORING.md):\\n *   sim      tool rules, gifts, rank, sliders, codec, determinism, balance\\n *   content  story length, About fields, banned strings, campaign save\\n *   audio    rendered voice and one effect are finite and not silent\\n *   browser  pad stand-in, keys, mouse, attract, touch gate, dev sliders\\n *   launch   two file:// boots, fresh-profile music, aimed tool\\n10→ *   hub      five shared-world harness URLs\\n *   cal      print Resident bot scores (not part of the default)\\n *   all      every filter except cal\\n *\\n * Default (no argument): sim + content + audio.\\n * Prints only failures and one count line. Exit 0 when nothing failed.\\n * `cal` may also print scores.\\n */\\nimport { mkdirSync, readdirSync, readFileSync, statSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { join, dirname } from 'node:path';\\n20→import { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { parseSong } from '../pixel-engine.js';\\nimport { ABOUT_FIELDS, AI_HUB, ENGINE_FEEDBACK, PROMPT_FEEDBACK, SOURCE_INFORMATION, TESTING_FEEDBACK } from '../src/content/about.js';\\nimport { playCampaign } from '../src/content/campaign.js';\\nimport { ALL_OPS } from '../src/content/ops.js';\\nimport { CAST, SCENES } from '../src/content/story.js';\\nimport { applySlider, getConfig, resetConfig } from '../src/core/config.js';\\nimport { SONGS } from '../src/audio/songs.js';\\nimport { effectBuffer, rms, voicePcm } from '../src/audio/voice.js';\\nimport { Clinic } from '../src/game/clinic.js';\\n30→import { buildStandings, openSession, stopSession } from '../src/net/session.js';\\nimport { applyDecoded, decodeState, encodeFast, snapshotOf } from '../src/sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, devCheat, hashSim, retryStage, step } from '../src/sim/op.js';\\nimport { play, sameHash } from '../src/sim/run.js';\\nimport { rankFor } from '../src/sim/score.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\nconst BOSSES = new Set(['op5', 'op7', 'op8', 'op9']);\\nconst fails = [];\\n40→let passed = 0;\\n\\nfunction check(name, cond) {\\n  if (cond) passed += 1;\\n  else fails.push(name);\\n}\\n\\nfunction approx(a, b, eps = 0.05) {\\n  return Math.abs(a - b) <= eps;\\n}\\n50→\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-224040__x24ebb3/work/The-Second-Opinion-Clinic-Trauma-Center-Second-Opinion-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261104-224040/tests/run.mjs\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":50,\"raw_output\":\"/**\\n * The Second Opinion Clinic — one test command.\\n *\\n * Filters (also documented in docs/AUTHORING.md):\\n *   sim      tool rules, gifts, rank, sliders, codec, determinism, balance\\n *   content  story length, About fields, banned strings, campaign save\\n *   audio    rendered voice and one effect are finite and not silent\\n *   browser  pad stand-in, keys, mouse, attract, touch gate, dev sliders\\n *   launch   two file:// boots, fresh-profile music, aimed tool\\n *   hub      five shared-world harness URLs\\n *   cal      print Resident bot scores (not part of the default)\\n *   all      every filter except cal\\n *\\n * Default (no argument): sim + content + audio.\\n * Prints only failures and one count line. Exit 0 when nothing failed.\\n * `cal` may also print scores.\\n */\\nimport { mkdirSync, readdirSync, readFileSync, statSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\\nimport { join, dirname } from 'node:path';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url';\\nimport { parseSong } from '../pixel-engine.js';\\nimport { ABOUT_FIELDS, AI_HUB, ENGINE_FEEDBACK, PROMPT_FEEDBACK, SOURCE_INFORMATION, TESTING_FEEDBACK } from '../src/content/about.js';\\nimport { playCampaign } from '../src/content/campaign.js';\\nimport { ALL_OPS } from '../src/content/ops.js';\\nimport { CAST, SCENES } from '../src/content/story.js';\\nimport { applySlider, getConfig, resetConfig } from '../src/core/config.js';\\nimport { SONGS } from '../src/audio/songs.js';\\nimport { effectBuffer, rms, voicePcm } from '../src/audio/voice.js';\\nimport { Clinic } from '../src/game/clinic.js';\\nimport { buildStandings, openSession, stopSession } from '../src/net/session.js';\\nimport { applyDecoded, decodeState, encodeFast, snapshotOf } from '../src/sim/codec.js';\\nimport { createOp, devCheat, hashSim, retryStage, step } from '../src/sim/op.js';\\nimport { play, sameHash } from '../src/sim/run.js';\\nimport { rankFor } from '../src/sim/score.js';\\n\\nconst root = join(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), '..');\\nconst DT = 1 / 60;\\nconst BOSSES = new Set(['op5', 'op7', 'op8', 'op9']);\\nconst fails = [];\\nlet passed = 0;\\n\\nfunction check(name, cond) {\\n  if (cond) passed += 1;\\n  else fails.push(name);\\n}\\n\\nfunction approx(a, b, eps = 0.05) {\\n  return Math.abs(a - b) <= eps;\\n}\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":805}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a1aa39-3d19-7772-a082-6fbf4c1e0ec4","uuid":"55ac06a9-5189-4db6-b004-5a18588f2a8b"}
